<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">NKONGO- ZIGUA Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc1">Nko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nkongo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Chitabu cha Nkongo</para>
  <para style="mt">NKONGO</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Nkongo Ulosi wenye winule idizina dye ichitabu chino Genesis manakwe “nkongo” ne ivyo nivyo ichitabu chino cha nkongo che Idilagano dya Kale chikwitangwa. Ibaluwa yenye ye Ichiebulaniya ye ichitabu chino iviya yakonga ne imilosi ino “Aho nkongo.” Chitabu chino chachilagisa ahantu vilaile ivintu vyose ne ivyo Chohile akongile mwivano na wantu. Watakuzuza mawandiko mazuwa yano wana fanyanyi zesimane zilozize zikumlanga mntu hegu wantu wawandike ichitabu cha Nkongo na nichipindi chani chiwandikwe ichitabuchino. Weyuko wakufanyanya kugamba chitabu chino chiwandikwa kulawana na baluwa za chikale mwechipindi che kaline ya 5-6 (Kulisito henati kwelekwa). Watuhu wazumilana mbuli wahokele zikuzumilwa ni wantu walozize kugamba Musa awandikaga ichatabu cha Nkongo, naho iviya ne ivitabu vituhu vya Kulawa na Mbulinza Walawi na Uwazwa na Lukumbusa gatigati ye imihilimo ya 1,300 hegu 1,400 Kulisito henati Kwelekwa). Chitabu cha ngonko chimema mbuli za mana vidala ziwambize Wakulisito kumanya muntu mtuhu mose msigale mwe Ibibiliya, zitende ni zedilagano dya Kale hegu Idihya. Chitabu cha Nkongo chachilagisa ivyo masa yengile mwe isi ne ivyo wantu wose wakunga Mwambula. Iviya chitabu chino chalavyanya pwilili mwalo wa Chohile wa kuwambula wantu. Mbuli ino yadaha kubunkuka kulawana na uoni wa nkongo ukulotela kumlanga Yesu (Nkono 3:15) na ndagano ya Chohile kwa Abulahamu ya kuwajimbika awantu mwe izisi zose (Nkongo 12:3). Kwa ujihi</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Chohile aumbaga isi, naho iviya kawaumba Adamu na Hawa saviya vikutamwilwa mwe isula ya 1 na ya 2. 2. Sula ya 3 kubula ya 5 yawatambalisa Adamu na Hawa, masa yawo na ulweleko lwawo. Sula ya 3 na 6 kubula ya 9 yamtambalisa Nuhu ne imbuli idya amabohwelo yakulise. 4. Ukalawa aho chitabu cha Nkongo chatambalisa chiya chilaile hagati he ichipindi cha Nuhu na chiya cha Abulahamu, iviya yahanganya mbuli zo umnala wa Babeli mwe isula ya 10 na 11. 5. Sula ya 12 kubula ya 50 zamlanga Abulahamu, wantu we ikaya yakwe na nkoengelo ya awantu we isi ya Izulaeli. Wikazi wa Abulahamu na mkaziwe Sala vyatambaliswa kulawa sula ya 12 kubula ya 25. Wikazi wa Isaka na mkaziwe Lebeka watambaliswa kulawa mwe isula ya 21 kubula ya 28, ne ifile yakwe yatambaliswa mwe isula ya 35. Wikazi wa Yakobo na wanawe yatambaliswa mwe isula ya 25 kubula ya 50. Sula ya 37 kubula ya 50 imema mbuli za Yusufu, mwana chendegwa ywa Yakobo, ne ivyo ezile kutenda seuta ywe isi ya Misili.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Kuumbwa kwe Isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Chikale icho Chohile aumbaga imbingu ne isi. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Si nendile heina sula naho neheina chintu. Ziza nadigubika china chitali cha mazi na Muye wa Chohile nouzagala mlanga mwa mazi. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Chohile agamba, “Ung'azi utende” ung'azi niyo walaila. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Chohile kawona ung'azi kugamba ni wedi. Akaheza Chohile apagula ung'azi na ziza, <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />ung'azi awitanga, “Msi” na ziza aditanga “Chilo.” Vyata chisingi, vyata mtondo, zuwa dya nkongo.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Chohile niyo adamanya luhenyo mgati mwa mazi, upagule mazi ntendele mbili. <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Chohile niyo adamanya luhenyo, ayapagula mazi ye mlanga mwo ulanga na yadya yehasi mwo ulanga uwo. Vyata ivyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Chohile niyo alwitanga luhenyo ulo “Ulanga.” Vyata chisingi, vyata mtondo, zuwa dya kaidi.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Chohile agamba, “Mazi ye hasi ho ulanga nayechisanye hantu hamwenga, isi itogile ilaile.” Vyata ivyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Chohile ahetanga ahantu hatogile “Sanga” na mduganyo wa mazi awitanga “Bahali.” Chohile kawona kugamba ni vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Vikaheza Chohile agamba, “Sanga nailavye mimeya, mimeya ikweleka mbeyu, na miti ikweleka matunda yana mbeyu.” Vyata ivyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Ivyo, sanga yahota mimeya ikweleka mbeyu zesimile na miti yesimane. Chohile kawona ni vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Vyata chisingi, vyata mtondo, zuwa dya katatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Chohile agamba, “Ung'azi naulaile mo ulanga, upagule msi na chilo ilagise misimu, mazuwa na mihilimo, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />na imulike ulanga na kwing'aziza Isi.” Vyatenda ivyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Ivyo, Chohile adamanya ng'azi mbili nkulu, zuwa ding'ale nomsi na mnenge ung'ale nechilo, naho niyo adamanya na ntondo. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Chohile niyo aika izing'azi izo mo ulanga zilangazize isi, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />vitende msi na chilo, na kuupagula ung'azi ne chiza. Chohile kawona ni vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Vyata chisingi, vyata mtondo, zuwa dya kane.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Chohile agamba, “Mazi na yamemezwe ni mafyo ya vyumbe vyesimile vikwikala na wadege wapuluke mo ulanga.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Ivyo, Chohile niyo aumba vyumbe vikulise vya mwe bahali na vyumbe vyose vyesimile vikwikala vikujenda na kumema mwa mazi, niyo aumba wadege wesimile wose. Chohile kawona ni vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Chohile niyo avijimbika, agamba, “Elekani, mjenyele, mmeme mwe zibahali, wadege nawo wongezekele mwe isi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Vyata chisingi, vyata mtondo zuwa dya shano.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Chohile agamba, “Sanga nailavye vyumbe vyose vyesimile vikwikala, wanyama wa kudimwa, vyumbe vikutambala na wanyama wa kumbago wa chila namna wakulu na wadodo.” Vyata ivyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Ivyo, Chohile aumba wanyama wa kumbago saviya weli, wanyama wa kudimwa, na vyumbe vikutambala. Chohile kawona kugamba ni vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Vikaheza Chohile agamba, “Chumbe mntu kwa mliganyo wetu, kwa sula yetu, alongoze samaki mwe bahali, wadege wo ulanga, wanyama wa kudimwa, isi yose na vyumbe vyose vikutambala.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Ivyo, Chohile niyo aumba mntu kwa mliganyo wakwe, kwa mliganyo wakwe Chohile kamumba. Kawaumba mgosi na mvyele. <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Chohile kawajimbika na kuwagamba, “Elekani mjenyele, mkaimmyemeze isi na kuilongoza, mlongoze samaki mwe bahali, wadege mo ulanga, na chila chumbe chikwikala na chikutambala mwe isi.”<verse eid="GEN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Vikaheza Chohile agamba, “Kaula, nawenkani chila mmeya mwe isi ukweleka mbeyu, na chila mti ukweleka matunda yana mbeyu, mbeyu zawo na matunda yawo nayatende nkande yenyu. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Naho wanyama wose mwe isi, wadege wose wa mo ulanga, vyumbe vyose vikutambala, seivyo, chila chumbe china ujima, nkande yawo naitende mani yose ye mimeya.” Vyata ivyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Chohile niyo awona chila chintu adamanye kugamba ni chedi vitendese. Vyata chisingi, vyata mtondo, zuwa dya mtandatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Ivyo nivyo mbingu ne isi zikomelekele na vintu vyose viyumo. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Zuwa dya mfungate Chohile ahumulaga kwaviya abindaga indima yakwe yose adamanye. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Chohile niyo ajimbika zuwa dya mfungate na kudikukiza, kwaviya zuwa idyo Chohile nidyo ahumulaga indima yakwe yose yokumba ize iheze. <verse eid="GEN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Ivyo nivyo mbingu neisi zumbigwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Zuwa diya Chohile eze aumbe mbingu ne isi, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />hahendaga hahana mimeya mlanga mwe isi hegu miti vihotile kwaviya Zumbe Chohile hanyesaga fula mwe isi, naho nahahana mntu wa kuilima. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Seivyo, mazi nayakalawa hasi yakanywesa ulongo wose. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Ivyo, Chohile kamumba mntu mgosi kwa ulongo, amvila muye wa ujima mwe mpula, na uyo mgosi atenda chumbe chikwikala.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Vikaheza Chohile niyo ahanda konde uko Edeni, ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa, na umo kamwika uyo mgosi aumbile. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Zumbe Chohile niyo ahoteza kulaila mwe sanga chila miti yedi yesimile ikweleka matunda yedi kwa nkande. Mgati mwe konde dya Edeni dyendaga na mti uwo matunda yakwe yenkiza ujima na mti wa kumanya yedi na yehiye.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Mto ukujuluzisa mazi na kuinywese idyo idikonde kulaila Edeni, komto uwo naupangana na kutenda mito mine. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Zina dyo mto we nkongo ni Pishoni, uwo naugonja gonja mwe isi yose ya Hawila kwendaga na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Zahabu ye isi iyo ni yedi vitendese. Uko kuna manunkizo yakwitangwa bedola na vito vikwitangwa shohamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Zina dyo mto wa kaidi ni Gihoni, uwo ugonja gonja mwe isi ya Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Zina dyo mto wa katatu ni Tigili, nawo wajuluzika ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa we isi ya Ashulu, na zina dyo mto wa kane ni Efulati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Ivyo, Chohile niyo amguha uyo mgosi, amwika mwe idikonde dya Edeni, ailime na kuidima. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Zumbe Chohile amlagiza uyo mgosi, “Wadaha kudya matunda ya mti wowose mwe idikonde, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />mna amatunda yo mti wo kumanya yedi na yehiye, usekudya, kwaviya zuwa nodye amatunda yo mti uwo, chindedi no ubanike.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Akaheza Chohile agamba, “Sivyo vyedi yuno mgosi atende echedu. Nani mdamanyize mnyawe ywa kumwambiza.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Ivyo, kulaila mo ulongo, Chohile niyo aumba chila mnyama wakumbago na chila wadege mwo ulanga, akaheza amwigaila uyo mgosi awone awenke mazina yani, na mazina enkile ivyumbe ivyo, yatenda nayo amazina yawo. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Ivyo, uyo mgosi niyo awenka mazina wanyama wose wakudimwa, wanyama wa kumbago na wadege wose mwo ulanga. Mna hawoneke mnyawe awagile kumwambiza.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Ivyo, Chohile niyo amjela uyo mgosi ntongo fofofo, hadya emwe zintongo, niyo aguha ulubavu lwakwe lumwenga niyo ahagubika hantu aho na nyama. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Na ulubavu ulo Chohile alavize kwa yudya mgosi kalutenda mvyele, amwigala kwa yudya mgosi. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Naho yudya mgosi akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Chindedi! Yuno ni vuha kulaila mwa mavuha yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">na nyama kulaila mwe nyama yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Yuno netangwe ‘Mvyele,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">kwaviya kalavywa mwe mgosi.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Nivyo vikuleka mgosi amwasa tati yakwe na mami yakwe, atongelana na mkaziwe, nawo waidi watenda mwili umwenga.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Uyo Adamu na mkaziwe wose wendaga wemwazi, mna hawawone soni.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Masa ya wantu wankongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Nyoka endaga mbala kujinka wanyama wose wa kumbago waumbwagwa ni Zumbe Chohile. Ivyo, nyoka amgambaga uyo mvyele, “Hambwe Chohile kawagamba msekudya matunda ya mti wowose mwe dikonde?”<verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Yudya mvyele ahitula iyo inyoka, “Chadaha kudya matunda ya mti wowose mwe dikonde, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />mna Chohile kagamba, ‘Msekudya matunda yo mti wi hagati he dikonde, naho msekuudonta, mnase kubanika.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Nyoka amgamba yudya mvyele, “Bule hambanike! <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Chohile kalonga ivyo kwaviya kamanya kugamba mnadya amatunda yo mti uwo na mgubulwe ameso, nanyuwe na mtende enga Chohile, mkamanya yedi na yehiye.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Ivyo, mvyele eze awone kugamba mti uwo wawagila kwa nkande, welela mwameso, nakugamba ni wedi kwa kupata umanyi, niyo adahula tunda dyakwe adya, nakumwigaila mgosiwe naye niyo adya. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Naho meso yawo yagubulwe, wabunkula kugamba wemwazi, ivyo niyo wesumila mani ya miti, wedamanyiza masegele.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Chisingi icho, chipindi wakahunga mpeho, uyo mgosi na mkaziwe weze weve nkacho za Zumbe Chohile akaenda mwe dikonde, niyo wefisa mgati mwe miti, Chohile asekuwawona. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amwitanga uyo Adamu, “Wikuhi?” <verse eid="GEN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Naye amhitula, “Siva izwi dye nkacho zako mwe dikonde, niyo nogoha nakwefisa, kwaviya ni mwazi.” <verse eid="GEN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Chohile amuza, “Ni yuhi akugambile wimwazi? Togola, kudya iditunda dyo mti husigile usekudya?” <verse eid="GEN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Uyo mgosi amhitula, “Mvyele uninkile ekale hamwenga na miye nuyo aninkile iditunda dyo mti uwo, nami niyo nadya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Aho Zumbe Chohile amuza yudya mvyele, “Weye kutenda mbwani?” Mvyele amhitula, “Nyoka kanidantiliza, miye niyo nadya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkanto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Akaheza Zumbe Chohile amgamba nyoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">“Kwaviya kudamnya ivyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">Nakuligita weye du mgati mwa wanyama wose wa kudimwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">na kujinka wanyama wose wa kumbago.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">Notambale ne inda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">na kudya tifili mazuwa yose ya wikazi wako.<verse eid="GEN 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Nanike unkondo mgati mwako na uyo mvyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">mgati mwo lweleko lwako no lweleko lwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">uyo nauhonde umtwi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">weye nawe noumlume ichisigino chakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Akaheza amgamba yudya mvyele, “Nahongezeze usungu wa kweleka kwa usungu naweleke wana. Ivyo nkwina zako zose nazitende kwa mgosiwo naho nakulongoze.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Akaheza amgamba yudya Adamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">“Kwaviya weye kumwetegeleza mkaziwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">kudya matunda yomti udya husigile usekudya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">ulongo siuligita kwachausa chako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">Kwa chiluke noupate nkande yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">mazuwa yose yo wikazi wako. <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Ulongo naukwelekele miwa na magugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:18">nawe naudye mani ya mimeya ya mwe nkonde.<verse eid="GEN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Kwa chiluke chako na welondele nkande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">kubula aho nowiye molongo uguhigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">kwa viya weye wi tifili na mwe ditifili nauye.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Adamu amwinka mkaziwe zina “Hawa” kwaviya natende mami ya wana wa wantu wose wakwelekwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Zumbe Chohile kawadamanyiza Adamu na mkaziwe awavisa suche, njingo ya mnyama.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Hawa wabalazwa mwe dikonde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Akaheza Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Haluse, mntu katenda saviya yumwe ywetu, kamanya yedi na yehiye. Vyaungwa kumchinda anasekudya iditunda dyo mti wo ujima, kwaviya anadya nekale mazuwa yose!” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Ivyo, Zumbe Chohile kamusa Adamu mwe dikonde dya Edeni, chani akalime mwo ulongo mudya aumbigwe. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Zumbe Chohile kamusa mwe dikonde nakwika wamizi wakwitangwa makelubi ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa we dikonde dya Edeni na bamba dya moto dikuhituka kuno na kuno, kudima isila ikwita ko mti wo ujima.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Kaini na Habili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Adamu kammanya mkaziwe Hawa, niyo atenda msoka, amweleka Kaini. Hawa agamba, “Sipata mwana chigosi kwa wambizi wa Zumbe Chohile!” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Akaheza amweleka mwana amwitanga Habili. Habili endaga mdimi ywa ngoto, mna Kaini endaga mlimi. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Chize chijinke chipindi chisiku Kaini niyo amlaviza Zumbe Chohile malavyo yakulawana na ulozo. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Habili naye niyo amlaviza Zumbe Chohile lavyo dya mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywe zi ngoto zakwe inonile. Chohile niyo awagilwa ni Habili ne dilavyo dyakwe, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />mna hawagilwe ni Kaini ne dilavyo dyakwe. Ivyo, Kaini keihisiswa, na uso wakwe niyo atenda na mankunyankunya. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Niyo Zumbe Chohile amgamba Kaini, ni mbwani kwihiwa, na uso wako una mankunyankunya? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Uneva unadamanya vyedi, hauhokelwe? Huna damanye vyedi wavu wiyaho, wakunyatila holwivi, naho wakubesa, mna waungwa uuhude.<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Kaini niyo amgamba mlukolo ywakwe Habili, “Chite koluwala.” Hadya eze watende koluwala, Kaini niyo amwebunga mlukolo ywakwe na kumkoma.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Zumbe Chohile amgamba Kaini, “Ekuhi Habili mlukolo ywako?” Amgamba, “Simanyize, miye ni mdimi ywa mlukolo ywangu?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Zumbe Chohile agamba Kaini, “Nimbwani ukatenda mbuli saino? Sakame ya mlukolo ywako yanilila miye kulaila mwo ulongo. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Ivyo haluse, weye sikuligita hodahe kulima vituhu mwe ulongo udya ukwinga mlomo uhokele sakame ya mlukolo ywako umkomile. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Unalima mwo ulongo hokwinke ulozo. Nautende mta kwangadika, hwina wikazi wesimile mwe isi.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kaini amgamba Zumbe Chohile, “Kanto dyangu ditendesa kulu, sanidahe kudijijimiza. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Kaula, dyelo kunusa mwe ulongo wedi na kunika hale na weye. Ivyo, nanitende mntu ywa kwangadika, hena wikazi wesimile mwe isi, na yoyose naniwone nanikome.” <verse eid="GEN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Mna Zumbe Chohile amgamba, “Bule! Nakukome weye Kaini nalihizwe nkanana mfungate kujinka weye.” Chohile niyo amfamika hula Kaini, chani yoyose namuwone anase kumkoma. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Akaheza Kaini niyo ahalawa hameso ya Zumbe, akwikala mwe isi ya kwangadika ikwitangwa Nodi, ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa wa Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lweleko lwa Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Nyumani Kaini kagona na mkaziwe niyo wamweleka Henoko, akaheza Kaini niyo akonga kuzenga mzi niyo awitanga Henoko zina dya mwanawe. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Henoko amweleka Iladi, Iladi amweleka Mehuyaeli, Mehuyaeli amweleka Mesushaeli, Mesushaeli amweleka Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameki asolaga wavyele waidi, ywa nkongo ketangwa Ada, na mtuhu ketangwa Zila.<verse eid="GEN 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada amweleka Yabali, uyo nuyo endaga babawo wadya nawekalaga mwa mahema wakadima. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Mlukolo ywakwe endaga Yubali uyo nuyo babawo watowa zeze na miluli. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Zila niyo amweleka Tubali Kaini, uyo nuyo endaga mfula vyuma na shaba, lumbudyakwe Tubalkaini endaga Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lameki awagamba wakazize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada na Zila netegelezani izwi dyangu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Tegelezani nyuwe wavyele wa Lameki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Miye nakomaga mntu kwa kunilumiza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Chindedi, nakomaga mbwanga kwa kunilumiza <verse eid="GEN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Uneva Kaini nalihizwe nkanana mfungate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">chindedi Lameki nalihizwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">milongo mfungate na mfungate.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seti na Enoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adamu niyo agona na mkaziwe eleka mwana mtuhu. Hawa agamba, “Chohile kaninka miye mwana chigosi niyo amwitanga Seti hantu ha Habili, kwaviya Kaini amkomaga Habili. <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Seti naye niyo eleka mwana, amwitanga Enoshi. Icho nicho chipindi wantu wakongile kwitanga zina dya Zumbe wakagamba weye wi Chohile.”<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa Adamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Wano ni welekwa lwa Adamu. Hadya Chohile aumbaga wantu, amuumbaga kwa mliganyo wakwe yeye mwenye. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Aumbaga mgosi na mvyele, ukajika niyo awajimbika, niyo awetanga “Wantu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adamu eze abule mihilimo gana na milongo mitatu, niyo eleka mwana wafanane mta sula sayakwe, amwitanga Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Eze amweleke Seti Adamu kekala mihilimo magana mnane na kweleka wana watuhu wachigosi na wachiche. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Adamu abanikaga akatenda na mihilimo magana chenda na milongo mitatu.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Seti eze abule mihilimo gana na mishano, eleka mwana akwitangwa Enoshi, <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Eze amweleke Enoshi niyo ekala mihilimo magana mnane na mfungate, na kweleka wana watuhu wachigosi na wachiche. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Seti abanikaga akatenda na mhilimo magana chenda na mlongo na midi.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Enoshi eze abule mihilimo milongo chenda amweleka Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Eze amweleke Kenani, Enoshi kekala mihilimo magana mnane na mlongo na mishano na kweleka wana watuhu wachigosi na wachiche. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Enoshi abanikaga akatenda na mihilimo magana chenda na mishano.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Kenani eze abule mhilimo milongo mfungate, eleka mwana, zina dyakwe Mahalaleli, <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Eze amweleke Mahalaleli, Kenani niyo ekala mihilimo magana mnane na milongo mine na kweleka wana watuhu wachigosi na wachiche. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Kenani abanikaga akatenda na mihilimo magana chenda na mlongo.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Mahalaleli eze abule mihilimo milongo mtandatu na mishano, eleka mwana ywa chilume akwitangwa Yaledi, <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />eze amweleke Yaledi kekala mihilimo magana mnane na milongo mitatu na kweleka wana watuhu wachigosi na wachiche. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Mahalaleli abanikaga akatenda na mihilimo magana mnane na milongo chenda na mishano.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Yaledi eze abule mihilimo gana na milongo mtandatu na midi amweleka mwana amwitanga Henoko, <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />eze amweleke Henoko ekala mihilimo magana mnane, elekaga wana watuhu wachigosi na wachiche. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yaledi abanikaga akatenda na mhilimo magana chenda na milongo mtandatu na midi.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Henoko eze abule mihilimo wa milongo mtandatu na mishano, niyo amweleka Mesusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Vize viheze, Henoko kekala wikazi wedi kulongozi kwa Chohile mihilimo magana matatu, na kweleka wana watuhu wachigosi na wachiche. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Henoko abanikaga akatenda na mihilimo magana matatu na milongo mtandatu na mishano. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Henoko kekala akamvikila Chohile mwo wikazi wakwe, akaheza niyo aga, kwaviya Chohile kamguha atende naye.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Mesusela eze abule mihilimo gana na milongo mnane na mfungate, amweleka Lameki, <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />eze amweleke Lameki niyo ekala mihilimo magana mfungate na milongo mnane na midi. Elekaga wana watuhu wachigosi na wachiche. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Mesusela abanikaga akatenda na mihilimo magana chenda na milongo mtandatu na chenda.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Lameki eze abule mhilimo gana na milongo mnane na midi, eleka mwana chilume. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Amwitanga zina dyakwe Nuhu, agamba, “Yuno mwana nuyo nachinke chinyemi kulawana ne ndima yetu ndala chikudamanya kwa mikono yetu mwe ulongo udya Chohile aligite.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Eze amweleke Nuhu, Lameki ekalaga mihilimo magana mashano na milongo chenda na mishano. Elekaga wana watuhu wachigosi na wachiche. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Lameki abanikaga akatenda na mihilimo magana mfungate na milongo mfungate na mfungate.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Nuhu eze abule mhilimo magana mashano, eleka wana chigosi watatu, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Wavu wa Wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Eze vitende wantu wongezekela mwe isi wana chiche niyo welekwa kwawo, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />wana wa Chohile wawawonaga awo wana chiche wa wantu kugamba ni watana, niyo wasola yoyose wawone wawagila. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Zumbe agamba, “Muye wangu hawikale mndani mwa wantu mazuwa yose, kwaviya ni wata kubanika, ivyo mazuwa yawo nayatende mihilimo gana na milongo midi iyodu.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Mwa mazuwa ayo, na nyumani kwendaga na mazintu mwe isi, yetangagwa Wanefili welekwa wa wana wa chilume wa Chohile na wandele wa wantu awo nawo wendaga wantu wakankalu wamanyikise na wata ntunyo chikale icho,<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Zumbe eze awone wihi wa mntu utendesa mwe isi, na chila idyo akufanyanya mo moyo wakwe diha mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Zumbe nakalungumula kumuba mntu na kumwika mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Ivyo agamba, “Nani wabinde wantu wano wose numbile mwe isi, wanyama wose, wadya wakutambala, wadege we kulanga, kwaviya nalungumula ni mbwani siwaumba.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Mna Zumbe eleleswaga ni Nuhu.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Ino ni mbuli ya Nuhu no lweleko lwakwe. Nuhu endaga mntu akumuwagila Zumbe hena lema akumvikila Chohile. Chohile kamguha atende naye. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nuhu endaga na wana chigosi watatu, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Chohile awonaga isi kugamba ibanika naho imema upolaganyi. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Chohile kaikaula isi niyo awona kugamba imema wihi chila mntu katimila sila ya chizavu.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Chohile amgamba Nuhu, “Naunga ni wabinde wantu wose mwe isi. Naniwakome wose, kwaviya waimemeza isi kwa wihi wa upolaganyi. Heye naniwabinde hamwenga ne isi. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Elo, kwezengele safina ya mti wa mhingo, zenga vyumba mndani mwe safina, ikulugute lami kundani na kuse. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Nauidamanye vino utali wakwe mikono magana milongo mitatu na chenda, wangalamu wakwe mikono milongo midi na shano chimo chakwe mlongo na mishano. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Wike hantu hakwingiziza ung'azi utali wa mkono umwenga ujele lwivi holubavu lwakwe, uikiye golofa ntatu, ya hasi ya kaidi na ya katatu. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Kaula, nanigale galika ya mazi mlanga mwe isi, nibalange chila chintu chikwikala mwe isi, chisekutenda hasi he mbingu, chila china ujima chimweisi nachife. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Mna nanidamanye lagano na weye, nawingile mwe safina, weye na wanawo na mkaziwo na wakaza wanawo. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Mwe safina nawingize vyumbe waididi wesimane gosi na vyele, chani wekale hamwenga na weye wanasekufa. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Kwa wadya wakupuluka na kwa chila mnyama ivyo weli na chila chikutambala, waididi awo uwaike kwako uwadime. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Uguhe chila nkande ikudigwa, ukachisanye, naitende nkande yako na yawo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nuhu niyo adamanya chila chintu, saviya agambilwe ni Chohile.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Mabohwelo yatendese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Zumbe amgamba Nuhu, “Ingila mwe safina hamwenga na wose mo welekwa wako, kwaviya sikuwona weye wimta kuwagilwa ywangu mwa meso yangu mwe cheleko chino. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Guha mwa wanyama wose wadya huzumila kulavizwa ntambiko mfungate fungate gosi na vyele na mwa wanyama wadya sikuzumila kulavizwa ntambiko waididi, gosi na vyele. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Iviya guha wadege wose wesimane mfungate fungate, kagosi na kavyele, chani kwika mbeyu ya wanyama na wadege weze welekane vituhu mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Mazuwa mfungate yanaomboka nainye fula mazuwa milongo mine chilo na msi, chila chumbe chikwikala mwe isi nanichuse na kuchibalanga.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Nuhu kadamanya viya vyoseni alagizwe ni Chohile adamanye.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Nuhu endaga na mihilimo magana mtandatu umo mabohwelo yakalaila mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Uyo na mkaziwe, wengila mwe safina, na wana wawo, wakazizawo chani kwenege amabohwelo. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Wanyama huwagila kulavizwa ntambiko na wanyama sikuwagila kulavizwa ntambiko na wadege na vyumbe vyose vikutambala. <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />Wengila mwe safina hamwenga na Nuhu, waididi, gosi na vyele, saviya Chohile alagize. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Mazuwa mfungate yeze yomboke, mabohwelo niyo yeza yagubika isi.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Nuhu eze atende na mihilimo magana mtandatu, zuwa dya mlongo na mfungate mo mwezi wakaidi, sokwe zose za china chitali niyo za lavya mazi yalozize, ulanga niyo wazibuka. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Fula niyo yanya mwe isi mazuwa milongo mine msi na chilo. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Zuwa idyo hadya fula ikongile kunya, Nuhu na mkaziwe na wanawe, shemu na Hamu na Yafeti, hamwenga na wakazizawo wengila mndani mwe safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Wengila wowo wenye hamwenga na chila mnyama akudimwa na ywa kumbago, wanyama wakutambala na wadege wesimile. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Wengila mwe safina hamwenga na Nuhu waididi kwa chila vyumbe vyesimile vikwikala. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Chila vyumbe vyesimile vyengila gosi na vyele saviya Chohile asigile. Niyo Zumbe avugala ulwivi.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Mabohwelo yajendeleza kwa mazuwa milongo mine, na mazi yongezekela, yaitenda isafina iyeye mlanga mwa mazi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Mazi niyo yongezekela mwe isi ne safina niyo yayeye mlanga mwa mazi. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Mazi yajenyela vidala yajinka na kugubika magulu yose matali mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Mazi yongezekela kubula nkacho mfungate na nusu kulanga kwa magulu matali. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Vyumbe vyose vikwikala mwe isi niyo vyabanika. Wadege na wanyama wakudimwa na wanyama wa kumbago, mafyo ya vyumbe vyose mwe isi nkavu na wantu wose. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Chila chintu chikale mwe isi chi kuhema chibanika. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Zumbe kavibalanga vyose vyendile vikekala mwe isi, wantu na wanyama na wadege. Asigalaga Nuhu uyodu na awo wendile hamwenga mwe safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Mazi yano hayanyaile kwa mazuwa gana na milongo mishano.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Udumo wa mabohwelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Chohile hamjaile Nuhu na wadya wanyama endaga nawo mwe safina, kadamanya nkung'unto, mazi niyo yakonga kunywela hasi. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Mwe chipindi icho sokwe zina china chitali nazivugalwa, naho ulanga niyo wavugalwa, fula nayo niyo yacha, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />mazi yajendeleza kuhunguka eze vibule mazuwa gana dimwenga na milongo mishano. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Mwe zuwa dya mlongo umwe na mfungate mwezi wa mfungate mazi niyo yahunguka safina niyo yauya hasi mlanga mwa magulu lwa Alalati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Mazi yajendeleza kuhunguka mpalahole na mwedizuwa dya nkongo dyo mwezi wa mlongo, magulu yakonga kuwoneka kulanga.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Eze yomboke mazuwa milongo mine, Nuhu avugula idilanga dye safina, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />niyo alavya kungulu kuse, nadyo hadiwiye mna nadikapuluka kuno na uko kubula hadya mazi yeze yanyale. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Akaheza Nuhu alavya kasuwamanga awone hegu mazi yahunguka mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Mna, kadya kasuwamanga hakawone hantu hakuchima, kauya mwe safina. Nuhu niyo alavya umkono akagwila akavuza mndani mwe safina. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Nuhu kagoja vituhu mazuwa mfungate alavya kadya kasuwamanga vituhu. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Kasuwamanga kauya nechisingi na zani mwo mlomo wakwe. Ivyo Nuhu amanya kugamba mazi ya hunguka mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Akaheza kagoja mazuwa matuhu mfungate, kakalavya kadya kasuwamanga vituhu, ntambo ino kasuwamanga hakawiye.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Nuhu eze abuze mihilimo magana mtandatu na umwenga, zuwa dya nkongo dya mwezi wa nkongo, mazi niyo yanyala mwe isi. Nuhu niyo ausa ingubiko ye safina eze akaule awona isi inyala. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Mwe zuwa dya milongo midi na mfungate mwezi wa kaidi isi yose nainyalisa.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Aho, Chohile amgamba Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Fosa mwe safina, weye hamwenga na mkaziwo, wanawo na wakazizawo. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Lavya naho vyumbe vyose vikwikala vyesimile wendile hamwenga na weye, wadege na wanyama na chila chumbe chikutambala chani welekane mwe isi wajenyele na kwenela chila hantu mwe isi.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Ivyo, Nuhu niyo alawa mwe safina na mkaziwe hamwenga na wavyele wa wanawe. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Walawa kutimilana na mafyo yawo, wanyama wose wa kumbago, vyumbe vyose vikutambala, wadege wose na wanyama wose wakujenda mwe isi.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu amlaviza Chohile ntambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Nuhu aumbikagaga mayuwe na kutenda nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko kwa Chohile, niyo aguha mwe chila mnyama akuwagila kulavywa ntambiko na kadege kakuwagila kulavywa ntambiko, amlaviza Chohle lavyo dya koka. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Zumbe niyo eva mhempe ukumwelela, egamba, “Ng'o saniiligite vituhu isi kwachausa cha mntu, simanya kugamba fanyanyi zakwe kukongela udodo wakwe ni zawihi. Naho sanibalange vyumbe vyose saviya nidamanye. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Kwe ivyo isi naikale na kulaila vipindi vya kuhanda na kulozola, mwe mpeho na fukuto, chipindi cha masika na chiyangazi, chilo na msi havileke.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">Chohile adamanya lagano na Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Chohile amjimbika Nuhu na wanawe, na kugamba, “Elekani, mwongezekele, mkamemeze isi. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Wanyama woseni, wadege na samaki nazikale zikawogohani. Vyose vikigwa mwe ulongozi wenyu. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Wanyama wose wata ujima na watende nkande yenyu, nawenkani saviya niwenkileni mboga za mani zitende nkande yenyu. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Mna msekudya nyama ina sakame, kwa viya ujima wimwe sakame. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Sakame yo ujima wenyu nanitigize, naniitigize kulaila kwa chila mnyama na mntu. Namkome mntu mnyawe nanimtigize ujima wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Netile sakame ya mntu, sakame yakwe na itilwe ni mntu, kwaviya mntu kaumbwa kwa mliganyo wa Chohile.”<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />“Nyuwe nanywi elekani, mjenyele, elekani vitendese, mjenyele mwe isi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utamwasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Naho, Chohile amgamba Nuhu na wanawe, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Naika lagano dyangu na nyuwe na welekwa wenyu, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />na vyumbe vyose vina ujima mwe isi na wadege na wanyama wa kudimwa na wakwenyika, wose walaile mwe safina nawehamwenga na nyuwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Navilikiza lagano dyangu na nyuwe, kugamba, ng'o viumbe vyose vina ujima havibangwe ni mabohwelo, naho hailaile mabohwelo kuibalanga isi.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Naho Chohile niyo agamba, “Dino nidyo idilagiso dye dilagano hudamanya mgati mwangu na nyuwe na chila chumbe china ujima chihamwenga na nyuwe kwa lweleko lose lukwiza, <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />naika utamwasi wangu mwamaingu, nawo nautende chilagiso che dilagano mgati mwangu ne isi. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Chila haigubika isi na maingu, uwo utamwasi we fula nauwoneke mwa maingu, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />nanikumbuke idilagano dyangu na nyuwe ne vyumbe vyose vina ujima. Ng'o mazi hayahituke kutenda mabohwelo ya kuvibalanga vyumbe vyose vikwikala. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Uwo utamwasi ukalaila mwa maingu naniuwone nanikumbuke lagano idyo dya mazuwa yose mwangu na vyumbe vyose vina ujima mwe isi.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Niyo Chohile amgamba Nuhu, “Ichi nicho chilajiso cha lagano nidamanye na vyumbe vyose vina ujima mwe isi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu na wanakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Wana wa Nuhu walaile mwe safina wendaga Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti. Hamu endaga ise dya Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Awo nawo wana watatu wa Nuhu, kulawana na awo wantu nawenela mwe isi yose.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Nuhu endaga mlimi ywa nkongo alimaga nkonde ya mizabibu, <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Zuwa dimwenga anywelesaga divai akolwa, agona mwazi mwedihema dyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Hamu, ise dya Kanani, awonaga ulusi lwa ise, niyo afosa kuse na kuwagambila walukolo weyawe waidi. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Mna Shemu na Yafeti waguha suche, niyo wegubika mwa mayega yawo, wauya kisengele nyuma na kugubika ulusi lwa tati yawo. Wasinya kunkanda, naho hawaluwone ulusi lwa tati yawo. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Nuhu eze aleukwe na kumanya ivyo atendelwe ni mwanawe umdodo, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Kanani naligitwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Natende mtumwa ywa watumwa kwa walukolo wakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Naho agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">“Shemu na ajimbikwe ni Zumbe Chohile ywangu! Kanani na atende mntumwa ywakwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Chohile angamule mihaka ya Yafeti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">ekale mwa mahema ya Shemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanani natende mtumwa ywakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Mabohwelo yeze yajinke Nuhu niyo ekala mihilimo magana matatu na milongo mishano, <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Ukajika Nuhu kabanika akatenda na mihilimo magana chenda na milongo mishano.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Lweleko Lwa Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Wano nawo welekwa wa Nuhu, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti. Wadya weleke wana mabohwelo yeze yajinke.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Wana chilume wa Yafeti, ni Gomeli na Magogu na Madai na Yavani na Tubali na Meshaki na Tilasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Wana chilume wa Gomeli ni Ashikenazi na Lifati na Togama. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Wana chilume wa Yavani ni Elisha na Talishishi na Kitimu na Walodani. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Awo nawo kolwa dya wantu wekale mpwani na mwe visiwa, chila wantu kwa kabila dyawo, milongele yawo.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Wana chilume wa Hamu ni Kushi na Misili na Putu na Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Wana wa chilume wa Kushi ni Seba na Havila na Sabita na Laama na Sabiteka. Na wana wa Lama ni, Sheba na Denani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kushi amwelekaga Nimlodi, yudya endaga mkankalu mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Kwa udahi wa Zumbe endaga mcheseka mkankalu, nivyo vikuleka kuna kasimo kakugamba “Vikwinga Nimlodi mkankalu ywa kucheseka kwa udahi wa Zumbe!” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Mizi ya nkongo yo useuta wakwe yendaga, Babeli na Eleku na Akadi na mwe isi ya Shinali. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Eze alawe mwe isi iyo Nimlodi aita Ashulu, azenga mwe mizi ya Ninawi na Lehobotili na Kala, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />na Leseni wimgati mwa Ninawi na mzi mkulu wa Kala.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Misili amwelekaga Waludi na Wanani na Walehabi na Wanafituhi, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Wapatilusi na Wakasiluhi uko nuko walaile Wafilisiti na Wakafitoli.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanani kamweleka Sidoni mwanawe ywa nkongo na Heti, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />na mkale ywawo Wayebusi na Waamoli na Wagilagashi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />na Wahivi na Waliki na Wasini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />na Walavadi na Wasemali na Wahamati, vikaheza nkolo za Wakanani niyo zamwaganikana, <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />kubula mo mhaka wa Kanani kulaila Sidoni ulailo wa zuwa kwita Gelali haguhi na Gaza, naho kwamwenye mzi kwita Sodoma na Gomola, Adama na Seboimu kubula Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Awo nawo welekwa wa Hamu kutimilana na makabila yawo na si zawo na milongele yawo.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Shemu mkuluwe dywa Yafeti endaga tati yawo Waebulaniya wose. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Wana chilume wa Shemu ni Elamu na Ashulu na Alifakisadi na Ludi na Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Wana wa Alamu ni Usi na Huli na Geteli na Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Alifakisadi kamweleka Sela, Sela kamweleka Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Ebeli endaga na wana waidi wa chilume, yumwenga na ketangwa Pelegi kwaviya mwe chipindi icho wantu mwe isi wamwaganikaga, mlukolo ywakwe naketangwa Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yoktani kamweleka Alimodadi, na Shelefu, Hasalimaweti na Yela, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />na Hadolamu, na Dikila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />na Obali na Abimaeli na Seba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofili na Havila na Yobali. Awo wose nawo wanawe wa Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Isi yawo wekalaga ni kulaila Mesha kwa sila ya Sefali, mwe si ya magulu lwa ulailo wa zuwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Wano nawo welekwa wa Shemu, kutimilana na makabila yawo, milongele yawo na mwe izisi zawo na si zawo.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Zino ni nkolo za wana Nuhu, kutimilana ne vyeleko vyawo. Kulawana nawo si zose zenela mwe isi yeze yajinke mabohwelo.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Mnala wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Aho nkongo, wantu nawana mlongele umwenga na milosi imwe. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Ivyo umo wantu wakatamba ntendele za ulailo wa zuwa wabwila si iligane heina magulu Shinali, niyo wekala uko. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Walosana, “Hayani! Chidamanyeni matofali chikayoke.” Ivyo wendaga wakazenga na matofali hewana mayuwe, na lami ukaleka chokaa. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Wagamba, “Hayani, nachezengele mzi, na mnala udya ulunenengwe lwakwe nalubule kwembingu chani chitunywe, chinase kuzagala mwe isi.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Niyo Zumbe Chohile asela hasi akaule umzi no umnala uzengigwe ni wadya wantu, <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Kaula, wano wose ni wantu wamwenga walongela chalumwe, ino ni nkongelo ya yadya wakunga wa damanye. Dyodyose wakunga wadamanye nawadidamanye! <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Gojani chisele uko, chikawazaganye imilongele yawo chani wasekwivana.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Ivyo Zumbe kawamwaganisa isi yose na kuwatenda waleke kuzenga udya umzi. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Ivyo mzi witangwa Babeli, kwaviya aho naho Zumbe azaganye milongele ye isi yose, kulaila aho niyo wamwaganika mwe isi yose.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lweleko lwa Shemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Luno nulo lweleko lwa Shemu, Mihilimo midi yeze yajinke amabohwelo, umo Shemu akatenda na mihilimo gana elekaga mwana chilume niyo amwitanga Alfaksadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Eze amweleke Alfaksadi, Shemu niyo ekala mihilimo magana mashano eleka wana watuhu wachilume na wachiche.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Umo Alfaksadi eze abule mihilimo milongo mitatu na mishano eleka mwana wachilume, amwitanga Sela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Eze amweleke Shela, Alfiksadi kekala mihilimo magana mane na ntatu na kweleka wana wachilume na wachiche.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Sela eze abule mihilimo milongo mitatu, amweleka Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Eze amweleke Ebeli, Shela kekala mihilimo magana mane na mitatu, eleka wana watuhu wachilume na wachiche.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Ebeli akatenda na mihilimo milongo mitatu na mine, amweleka Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Eze amweleke Pelegi, Ebeli kekala mihiimo magana mane na milongo mitatu, eleka wana watuhu wachilume na wachiche.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Pelegi eze abule mihilimo milongo mitatu, amweleka Leu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Eze amweleke Leu, Pelegi kekala mihilimo magana milongo midi na chenda, eleka wana watuhu wachilume na wachiche.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Leu akatenda na mihilimo milongo mitatu na midi, amweleka Selugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Eze amweleke Selugi, Leu kekala mihilimo magana milongo midi na mfungate, eleka wana watuhu wachilume na wachiche.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Selugi akatenda na mihilimo milongo mitatu, amweleka Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Eze amweleke Naholi, Selugi kekala mihilimo milongo midi, eleka wana watuhu wachilume na wachiche.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Naholi eze abule mihilimo milongo midi na chenda, amweleka Tela, <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Eze amweleke Tela, Naholi kekala mihilimo gana mlongo umwe na chenda, eleka wana watuhu wachilume na wachiche.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Tela eze abule mihilmo milongo mfungate, kaweleka Bulahamu na Naholi na Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lweleko lwa Tela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Wakutimila ni welekwa wa Tela, endaga ise dya Bulahamu, Naholi na Halani. Halani tatiyakwe Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Uyo Halani kabanika hadya tatiyakwe Tela endaga akekala Uli kudya elekagwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Bulahamu na Naholi nawasola. Mkaza Bulahamu naketangwa Salai na mkaza Naholi aketangwa Milka mwana ywa chiche ywa Halani, uyo endaga tatiyakwe dya Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Salai endaga hakweleka.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Tela kamguha mwanawe ywa chilume Bulahamu, mwezukuluwe wachilume, Lutu mwanawe Halani, Salai mkaza Bulahamu, hamwenga nawo wahalawa ho mzi wa Ulu Wawakalidayo kwita kwe isi ya Kanani. Mna weze wabule Halani niyo wekala. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tela kabanika akateda na mihilimo magana madi na mishano.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Chohile amwitanga Bulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Zumbe amgamba Bulahamu, “Fosa mwe isi yako, na weyawo na wenyumba ya tatiyako, wite kwe isi na hulagise. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Nahutende utende na wantu walozize, nahujimbike nakuditenda dizina dyako dimanyike, nawe nautende jimbiko.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Naniwajimbike wadya wa kukujimbika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">mna nanimligite akukuligita.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Nakulawana na weye nanijimbike isi zose.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Ivyo Bulahamu eze atende ana mihilimo milongo mfungate na mishano, eze akulawe Halani, saviya Zumbe amsigile adamanye, nakaita hamwenga na Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Bulahamu kamguha mkaziwe Salai na Lutu mwana mlukolo ywake na vintu vyawo vyose wapatile Halani, wahalawa waita Kanani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:5">Weze wabule mwe isi ya Kanani, <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Bulahamu katamba kujinkila mgatigati mwe isi abula hantu hakwitangwa Shekemu hantu hakukile, ho mti wa Mwale. Wakanani wendile wachei wakekala mwe isi iyo. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Naho Zumbe amlaila Bulahamu na kumgamba, “Lweleko lwako na nilwinke isi ino.” Ivyo Bulahamu kaumbika mayuwe na kutenda nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko kwahausa cha Zumbe amlaile. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Eze viheze, Bulahamu ahalawa aita ko lugulu ulailo wa zuwa wa Beteli, azenga idihema dyakwe mgati mwa Beteli uswelo wa zuwa na mzi wa Ai ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa. Aho naho amzengela Zumbe nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko uko, nakumvikila kwa zina dyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Bulahamu niyo ajendeleza kutamba kwita ntendele za Negebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulahamu mwe isi Misli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Chipindi icho kwendaga na gumbo mwe isi, Bulahamu kasela kwita Misili uko ekale hadodo kwaviya gumbo dyatendesaga. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Hadya akatenda haguhi na Misili, amgamba mkaziwe Salai, “Simanya kugamba weye wimvyela mtana ywa kwelela. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Wamisili wanakuwona, 'nawagambe yuno ni mkaziwe', ivyo nawanikome na kukuleka weye. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Hampu wagambe kugamba wilumbu dyangu, chani nidanyizwe yedi kwachausa chako na ujima wangu naulewe kwachausa chako.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Bulahamu eze engile Misili, Wamisili niyo wamwona mkaziwe kugamba ni mtana. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Wakulu wedibalaza dya Falao wamwona, wamgambila seuta Falao ivyo eli mtana, ivyo yudya mvyele kegalwa kwenyumba ya Falao. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Kwachausa chakwe yudya mvyele seuta Falao niyo amtundulia vyedi Bulahamu na kumwinka ngoto na ng'ombe na mpunda ngosi na fyele na ngamiya na wandima wagosi na wavyele.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Mna Zumbe niyo awenka nyonje Falao ne nyumba yakwe yose kwaviya amguhile Salai mkaziwe Bulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Seuta Falao niyo amwitanga Bulahamu na kumuza, “Kunitenda mbwani? Nimbwani ukasakunigambila kugamba Salai ni mkaziwo? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Ni mbwani ukanigamba ni lumbudyo, vileka miye simtenda mkazangu? Mkaziwo yuno, mguhe naho uhalawe!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Seuta Falao asigila wantu kwachausa chakwe, wamsindikiza kwe sila, namkaziwe na chila ananacho.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Bulahamu na Lutu wapagulana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Bulahamu kakwela kulaila Misili, engila ntendele ya Negebu. Endile ana mkaziwe na ugoli wakwe wose hamwenga na Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Bulahamu endaga mgoli vitendese. Endaga na mafyo ya wanyama, hela na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Niyo ajendeleza kutamba kulaila ntendele ya Negebu kubula Beseli. Kabula hantu aikaga nkambi ya hema aho nkongo, mgati mwa Beseli na Ai, <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />hantu hadya azengaga nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko. Aho Bulahamu niyo amvikila Zumbe kwakwitanga zina dyakwe.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Hamwenga nayo, Lutu, yudya atimilane na Bulahamu, endaga na ngoto na mifugo na hema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Idifyo dyo ludimo dyendaga kulu vyatenda isi idya itende isekuwachinta Bulahamu na Lutu kwikala hamwenga. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Ivyo niyo kwauka nkumbizi mgati mwa wadimi wa Bulahamu na wadimi wa Lutu. Mwe chipindi icho, Wakanani na Wapelizi nawo wendaga wakaya we isi iyo.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Ivyo, Bulahamu amgamba Lutu, “Kusekutenda na kusentana mgati mwetu miye na weye na mgati mwa wadimi wako na wadimi wangu, kwaviya suwe chiwamwe. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Kaula isi yose ino imwameso yako. Nachipangane. Ukaita kumoso, miye nanite kulume, ukaita kulume, nanite kumoso.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Lutu niyo enula ameso yakwe, awona bwandasi dyo mto Yolodani, awona kugamba dina mazi ya kuchinta chila hantu saviya chibuta cha Zumbe na enga si ya Misili ntendele ya Soali. Yano yendaga Zumbe henati kuibalanga mizi ya Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Ivyo, Lutu niyo esagwila idibwandasi dyose dyomto wa Yolodani, ahinga na ulailo wa zuwa, ivyo wapangana. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Bulahamu niyo asigala mwe isi ya Kanani na Lutu ekala mgati mwe mizi yendile mwedibwandasi, asamiza nkambi yakwe Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Wantu wa mzi wa Sodoma wendaga wavu watendese kwa Zumbe.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulahamu alagiswa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Eze Lutu wasane na Bulahimu, Zumbe amgamba Bulahamu, “Inula ameso yako kulaila aho wili ukaule ntendele zose, kwa mwenye mzi, kwa mtwa, ulailo wa zuwa na uswelo wa zuwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Isi ino yose ukuwona nahwinke weye na lweleko lwako itende yenyu mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Welekwa wako naniwatende walozize wasekuwazika, saviya tifili dye isi, na saviya tifili hedi kudahika kuwazwa, seivyo na welekwa wako hawadahike kuwazika! <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Ivyo, inuka uitalamkile isi mwo wangalamu wakwe na utali wakwe, kwaviya nahwinke weye.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Kwaivyo, Bulahamu niyo ang'ola idihema, aita kwikala haguhi na mti mkulu wa Mamle kudya Hebuloni, uko niyo amzengela Zumbe nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Bulahamu amkombola Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Mwe chipindi icho, seuta Amlafeli ywa Shinali na seuta Alioko ywa Elasali na seuta Kedoliaomeli ywa Elamu na seuta Tidali ywa Goiimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />watowana nkondo na Bela seuta dya Sodoma na Bilisha seuta ywa Gomola, Shinabu seuta dya Adima, Shemebeli seuta ywa Seboimu na Bela kugamba Soali. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Maseuta ayo washano waduganyaga awankondo wawo mwedikolongo dya Sidimu kugamba bahali ya munyu. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Kwa chipindi cha mihilimo mlongo na midi nendile wakamtunya seuta Kedolaomeli, mna eze vibule mhilimo wa mlongo na mitatu, niyo wamlemela. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Mihilimo mlongo na mine, seuta Kedolaomelli na wadya maseuta weyawe wezaga na kuwahuda wantu wa Lefaimu uko Ashitalosi kalinaimu na wazuzi uko Hamu, na Waemi uko Shawe kiliataimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />na Waholi uko kolugulu lwawo Seili, wawabalazaga kubula Elipalani, mwo mhaka wedijangwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Vikaheza wauya kunyuma wabula Enimishipati kugamba Kadeshi, watowa isi yose ya Waamaleki, na kuwahuda Waamoli wekalaga Hasason timali.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Naho seuta ywa Sodoma na seuta ywa Gomola na seuta ywa Adima na seuta ywa Seboimu na seuta ywa Bela kugamba Soali, wengila mwe inkondo mwedikolongo dya Sidimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />kutowana na Kedolaomeli seuta ywa Elamu, Tidali seuta dya Goiimu na Amlafeli seuta ywa Shinali na Alioko seuta ywa Elasali, maseuta wane watowana na maseuta washano. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Kolongo dya Sidimu dyendaga dimema mabome ya lami, elo maseuta wa Sodoma na Gomola umo wakasumka inkondo watolobela umo, mna awatuhu wasumkila kolugulu. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Ivyo, wadya wahudile, niyo wataha ugoli wose wa Sodoma na Gomola, hamwenga ne zinkande zawo, waita zawo. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Wamtahaga na Lutu, mwana mlukolo ywa Bulahamu endaga akekala Sodoma, hamwenga no ugoli wakwe, waita zawo.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Mntu yumwenga anyilikaga, aitaga kumgambila yudya Mwebulaniya Bulahamu yudya endile akekala haguhi na mti mkulu wa Mamle. Mamle endaga mlukolo ywakwe Eshikoli na Aneli. Wose wadamanyaga wivano na Bulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Bulahamu eze eve kugamba mwihwawe katahigwa, afosa na wantu wakwe wakankalu magana matatu na mlongo na mnane welekwe mwe nyumba yakwe, awatimila wankondo abula Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Uko, apagula wankondo wakwe mwe mafyo. Nechilo, awebunga wankondo wakwe, awahuda na kuwabalaza kubula Hoba, kwamwenye mzi wa Damesiki. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Ivyo, Bulahamu aikombola isi yose itahigwe na wankondo, na kumkombola Lutu mwihwawe, ugoli wakwe, hamwenga na wavyele na wantu watuhu.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melikizedeki amjimbika Bulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Bulahamu eze auye umo amhudile seuta Kedolaomeli na weyawe, seuta ywa Sodoma alawaga kwita kumsingila mwe dikolongo dya Shawe, kugamba Kolongo dya Zumbe. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Naho Melikizedeki seuta ywa mzi wa Salemu, endile mlavyantambiko ywa Chohile Mkulu, aleta mgate na divai, <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />amjimbika Bulahamu akagamba, “Bulahamu na ajimbikwe ni Chohile Mkulu, Akumba imbingu ne isi! <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Atunywe Chohile Mkulu akudahize kuwahuda wankondo wako!” Naho Bulahamu niyo amwinka Melikizedeki msango wakwe fungu dya mlongo dye vintu vyose nendile ananavyo.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Seuta ywa Sodoma amgamba Bulahamu, “Ninka awantu awo, mna kweguhile ugoli wose weye mwenye.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Mna Bulahamu niyo amgamba seuta ywa Sodoma, “Nelisa kwa Chohile, nenula mkono wangu kwa Zumbe Mkulu, aumbile mbingu ne isi, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />kugamba saniguhe kazuzi hegu luzigi lwa chilatu, hegu chochose chako, unasekweduvya na kugamba kunitenda mgoli. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Ivyo, saniguhe chochose ukaleka viya ivintu wabwanga wangu wadile na hantu ha wadya wendile hamwenga na miye, Aneli na Eshikoli na Mamle wadya wawagile.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Lagano dya Chohile na Bulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Eze yaheze ayo, ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile wamwizila Bulahamu mwe sozi. “Bulahamu! Usekogoha! Miye nahudime. Nahwikwe Jeleko kulu kwa kunitunya!”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Mna Bulahamu agamba, “Weye Zumbe Chohile, noninke mbwani kuno hajendeleza kwikala sina mwana na mlisi ywangu ni Eliezeli wa Damesiki? <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Kaula! Hunati kuninka mwana, mtumwa elekwe mwe nyumba yangu nuyo natende mlisi ywangu!”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Naho Zumbe amgamba, “Yuno hatende mlisi ywako! Mwanawo ywa chindedi nuyo natende mlisi ywako.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Aho Zumbe amleta Bulahamu kuse na kumgamba, “Kaula ko ulanga! Ziwaze izintondo, hegu chindedi nodahe kuziwaza! Ivyo nivyo lweleko lwako na lutendese!”<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Bulahamu amzumila Chohile, ivyo Chohile kamzumila Bulahamu kugamba ni ywedi' <verse eid="GEN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Zumbe amgamba Bulahamu, “Miye nuyo Zumbe huletile kulaila Uli, mzi wa Wakalidayo, chani hwinke isi ino itende yako.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Mna Bulahamu amgamba, “Weye Zumbe Chohile, nanimanye vivihi kugamba naitende yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Zumbe amgamba, “Nigaila ndama ina mihilimo mitatu, ntogota ina mihilimo mitatu, ndolome ina mihilimo mitatu, na suwamanga na mpuji.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Bulahamu niyo amwigaila vyose, asenga chila mnyama vihande vidi, avika mwe nchanjale mbili, vikasinyana mna wadege hawasengile vihande vidi. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Na magushu yeze yabase vimba ivyo, Bulahamu ayagulusa.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Zuwa dikengila, Bulahamu niyo atozwa nintongo zitendese, chiza chikulu chikutisa chize chimgubika niyo awona nkama. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Aho Zumbe amgamba Bulahamu, “Umanye chindedi kugamba lweleko lwako nalutende saviya wajeni mwesi siyo yawo, na watende watumwa na wasulumizwe kwa chipindi cha mihilimo magana mane. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Seivyo, naniikantile isi nawaisankanile, vikaheza welekwa wako nawafose wakatenda na ugoli ulozize. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Mna weye mwenye na wikale wikazi mtali na kubanika kwa utondowazi. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Lweleko lwako na wauye hano mwe cheleko cha kane, kwaviya ubanasi wa Waamoli haunati kuchinta mwe kukantilwa.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Zuwa dize dingile niyo kwakomela chiza, chimpupa yalaila nyungu ikulawa mosi na myale ya moto yajinka hagatigati mweviya vihande vye zinyama. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Zuwa idyo, Zumbe adamanyaga lagano na Bulahamu akagamba, “Lweleko lwako nalwinka isi ino, kulaila mto Naili wa Misili kubula udya umto umkulu wa Fulati, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />kugamba si za Wakeni na Wakenizi na Wakadimoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Wahiti na Wapelizi na Walefai, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Waamoli na Wakanani na Wagiligashi na Wayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Salai na Hajili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Ivyo, Salai, mkaza Bulahamu nendile hanati kumwelekela mgosiwe mwana. Mna nendile ana mtumwa ywa chivyele akwitangwa Hajili, kulaila Misili. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Ivyo, Salai amgamba Bulahamu, “Kumanya kugamba Zumbe hanati kuninka mwana. Mguhe Hajili umtumwangu ywe chivyele ugone naye, tankani nadaha nipate mwana kwakwe.” Bulahamu niyo etikila ulosi wa Salai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Akaheza, Salai amwinka Bulahamu Hajili mtumwa ywakwe ywe chivyele, Mmisili, atende mkaziwe. Yano yalaila eze vitende Bulahamu kwikala mwe isi ya Kanani kwa chipindi cha mihilimo mlongo. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Bulahamu niyo amguha Hajili agona naye, uyo Hajili atenda msoka. Mna hadya eze awone katenda msoka, Hajili akonga kumbela Salai.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Salai amgamba Bulahamu, “Weye nuyo nolihwe wihi hudamanywa. Miye nasinkwinka mtumwa ywangu wachivyele, mna eze atende msoka, miye sitenda hezi mwameso yakwe! Zumbe na kanteda mgati mwako na miye!”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Mna Bulahamu amgamba Salai, “Mtumwa ywako wechivyele emwe ulongozi wako, mdamanye ivyo ukunga.” Ivyo, Salai niyo amsulumiza vyatenda anyilika.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishimaeli elekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe ambwila Hajili kwenyika he sokwe ya mazi imwesila ikwita Shuli. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Mndima ywa kwembingu amuza, “Hajili, mtumwa ywa chiche wa Salai! Walawahi naho waita nahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Hajili amhitula, “Namsumka mkulu ywangu Salai.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Yudya mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe amgamba, “Uya kwa mkulu ywako Salai na umwetegeleze.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Kujinka ayo, mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe amgamba Hajili, “Nanilwongeze lweleko lwako lusekudaha kuwazika mwo ujenyezi wawo.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Akaheza uyo mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe amgamba, “Weye wimsoka nawefungule mwana chilume, na umwitange zina dyakwe Ishumaeli, kugamba Zumbe kayawona masulumizo yako. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Ishumaeli nekale saviya mpunda ya kumbago, natende mnkondo ywa chila mntu na wantu nawo nawatende wankondo wakwe, nekale akatenda mnkondo ywa walukolo wakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Ivyo, Hajili kamwinka zina diya Zumbe alongile naye uko, Hajili elongela, “Weye wi Chohile akuwona.” Kwaviya na kafanyanya, “Chindedi sibunkula kugamba Chohile aniwona!” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Nivyo vilekile diya disima diketangwa, Belilahailoi. “Kugamba sima dya mta ujima aniwone.” Idisima dino dihagati ha Kadeshi na Beledi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Hajili kamwelekela Bulahamu mwana ywa chigosi. Bulahamu kamwitanga umwana uyo Ishumaeli. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Bulahamu endaga na mihilio ya milongo mnane na mtandatu umo Hajili amwelekele Ishumaeli.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Lagano dya kujelwa ngasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Chipindi Bulahamu akatenda na mihilimo milongo chenda na chenda, Zumbe kamlaila, amgamba, “Miye ni Zumbe mta nguvu. Tongela ulongozi wangu damanya yedi. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Nami nanidamanye lagano na weye nakukongezezesa lweleko lwako.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Aho Bulahamu niyo afika madi amvikila Chohile amgamba, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Nanidamanye lagano dino na weye, nautende tati ywa si zilozize. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Kukongela vino haluse, hawitangwe Bulahamu, mna nawitangwe Ibulahimu, kugamba sikutenda kutenda tati ywa si zilozize. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Nahutende utende na lweleko lulozize, kwako nazitende si zilozize na watuhu nawatende maseuta.”<verse eid="GEN 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />“Nanihikilize dilagano dyangu na weye, lweleko lwako na vyeleko vyawo vyose mazuwa yose, naho nanitende Chohile ywako na Chohile ywa lweleko wako mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Nahwinke weye no lweleko isi ino ukwikala enga mjeni. Kugamba isi yose ya Kanani itende yenyu mazuwa yose, nami nanitende Chohile wawo.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Akaheza Chohile amgamba Ibulahimu, “Kwentendele yako, weye nauditoze idi lagano dyangu, weye du, lweleko lwako na vyeleko vyawo vyose. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Dino nidyo idilagano nautoze mgati mwangu na weye na lweleko lwako chila mwana chilume mgati mwenyu aungwa ajelwe ngasu. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Namjelwe ngasu kwa kukantwa mazoba yenyu, na ino naitende nidyo dilajiso dye dilagano mgati mwangu na nyuwe. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Chila mwana chilume ywa mazuwa mnane mgati mwenyu aungwa ajelwe nkasu. Chila mgosi mwo lweleko lwenyu, atende mtumwa elekwe mwenyumba yenyu hegu aguligwe kwa hela zenyu kulaila ko ujeni hemuli mwo lweleko. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Heye, chila yumwe ywawo elekwe mwe nyumba yawo na yudya aguligwe kwa hela zako aungwa ajelwe nkasu. Icho ni chilajiso mwemili yenyu che dilagano dyangu dya mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Mgosi yoyose hejeligwe ngasu na sentwe ni wantu, kwaviya natende kabalanga lagano dyangu.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu enkwa lagano dya mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Akaheza Chohile amgamba Ibulahimu, “Vikungwa mkaziwo, homwitange vituhu zina dyakwe Salai, mna zina dyakwe naditende Sala. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Nanimjimbike nakwelekele mwana chilume. Heye, na nimjimbike Sala naatende mami ywa si zilozize na maseuta wa si nawalaile kwakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Aho Ibulahimu niyo amfikila madi amvikila aseka chimoyo moyo akafanyanya, “Hambwe, navidahike chindedi mwana kwelekwa kwa mkale wa mihilimo gana? Togola, Sala mta mihilimo milongo chenda, naadahe kupata mwana?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Ivyo, Ibulahimu amgamba Chohile, “Hegu wazumile idilagano idyo dimlange Ishumaeli.”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Chohile amhitula, “Bule! Mna mkaziwo Sala naakwelekele mwana ywa chilume, weye nawe nomwitange Isaka kugamba seka.” Nanidilavyanye dilagano dyangu kwakwe na vyeleko vyakwe, kutenda lagano dya mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />“Navimlange Ishumaeli, siva lombezo dyako. Nanimjimbike na nimwinke wana walozize na kuwongezeza. Ishumaeli natende tati ywa vilongozi mlongo na waidi, nami nanimtende tati ywa si nkulu. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Mna lagano dyangu nadiwonelwe kwa Isaka yudya Sala nakwelekele mhilimo ukwiza chipindi sa chino.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Ivyo Chohile eze abinde kulonga, kamwasa Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />“Aho Ibulahimu kawajela ngasu wose mwe zuwa idyo saviya Chohile amlagise, amjela ngasu mwanawe Ishumaeli, na kuwajela ngasu watumwa wose we chigosi welekwe mwe nyumbakwe na waguligwe kwa hela zakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Ibulahimu naana mihilimo milongo chenda na chenda umwo akajelwa ngasu. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Na Ishumaeli mwanawe naana mihilio mlongo na mitatu umo ajeligwe ngasu. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Ibulahimu na mwanawe Ishumaeli wajelwa ngasu zuwa idyo, <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />hamwenga na wagosi wa mwenyumbakwe, watumwa wose welekwe mwe nyumbakwe na waguligwe kwa hela zakwe wajelwa ngasu zuwa idyo.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Chohile alavyanya dilagano dyakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Zumbe kamlaila Ibulahimu ho mti mkulu wa Mamle. Ibulahimu nendile kekala ho lwivi lwe dihema dyakwe umo mwe dizuwa dyo msi, <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />eze enule meso yakwe, kawona wantu watatu wachimala hale hadodo ha meso yakwe. Aho eze awawone, niyo aguluka kulaila holwivi lwe dihema dyakwe, aita akuwasingila. Eze awabwile efunamiza kwa kutunya, <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />nakugamba, “Mazumbe wangu, uneva mwanunga nahaunga msekunomboka miye mndima ywenyu mna msinde kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Namwigailwe mazi majeche chani mhake mwe viga na mhumule hasi ho mti. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Umo mkahumula na nidamanye nkande njeche, mdye, chani mpate nguvu za kujendeleza nentambo yenyu, kwaviya mnizila miye mndima ywenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Nawo wagamba, “Nivyo! Damanya seivyo ulongile.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Ibulahimu niyo asunguza kuya kwedihema amgamba Sala, “Sunguza hima vihungu vitatu vya unga wedi, udamanye nkande.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Akaheza niyo asunguza kulawa aita kwedifyo dye zing'ombe, aguha njeku imwenga yedi inonile, amwinkaga mndima yudya asunguze kwichinja na kwambika. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Ibulahimu aguha siyagi, mele naidya inyama idamanywe, aweikiya awajeni awo nkande, mwenye niyo achimala haguhi hawo akawasankanila umo wakadya hasi ho mti uno.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Wadya wajeni wamuza, “Mkaziwo Sala ekuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Ibulahimu awahitula, “Ekwedihema”. <verse eid="GEN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Yumwenga ywawo agamba, “Chindedi nahuwiye umo mwe chipindi sachino mhilimo ukwiza mkaziwo Sala natende na mwana ywa chigosi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Sala nehangwelo ho lwivi lwe dihema, aketegeleza. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Ibulahimu na Sala nendile wadalahala, Sala mbuli ze chivyele zizwelwe nazitenda zamjinkaga mazuwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Ivyo niyo asekela momoyo akagamba, “Miye si dalahala, na mgosi wangu seivyo. Togola, vino nidalahale, nadaha kwelelwa na kupata wana?” <verse eid="GEN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Aho yudya endile chilongozi Zumbe Chohile amuza Ibulahimu, “Nimbwani Sala kaseka na kweuza kugamba, ‘Chindedi vyadahika apate mwana kuno kodalahalo?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Togola, kuna mbuli yoyose heikudahika kwa Zumbe Chohile? Nahuwiye mwe chipindi chikigwe, chipindi sachino mhilimo ukwiza Sala natende na mwana ywa chilume.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Mna Sala akatenda na nkama, alemela agamba, “Sisekile!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">“Heye, kuseka,” Zumbe amhitula. “Kuseka.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu awalombezeza wakwikala Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Nivyo Ibulahimu awasindikiza wadya wajeni watatu wahalawa, wabula hantu wadahile kuwona mzi wa Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Ivyo, Zumbe afanyanya, “Togola, nimfise Ibulahimu mbuli niikiye kwitenda? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Kwaviya uyo natende tati ywa si nkulu na kwakwe wantu wose mwe zisi zose nawajimbikwe! <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Simsagula no lweleko lwakwe, nawahinye lweleko lwakwe kutoza isila yangu, watende wachindedi na watakudamanya mbuli za kuwagila, nami nipate kuwadamanyiza ndagano zangu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Ivyo, Zumbe agamba, “Kuna mafuzumo yalozize mwa wantu wa Sodoma na Gomola na masa yawo yatendesa. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Ivyo nanisele nite uko hewonele mwenye kugamba ni chindedi wafuzuma. Naunga nimanye.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Kulaila aho, wadya wajeni waidi watoza isila kwita Sodoma, mna Zumbe kasigala, kachimala hamwenga na Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Ivyo, Ibulahimu amhokela Zumbe, amuza, “Togola, chindedi nowakome wantu wedi hamwenga na wehiye? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Vyadaha kutenda mna wantu wedi milongo mishano umo mo mzi. Togola, naukome mzi mjima ukaleka kuwasa, kwachausa cha wantu awo wedi milongo mishano weyumo? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Hangi hegu wadaha kutenda seivyo! Kuwakoma wantu wedi hamwenga na wehiye, wedi wadaha kudamanyizwa saviya wehiye! Hegu, viha! Mkanta ywa isi yose haleke kudamanya yedi!”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Zumbe amgamba, “Ninabwila wantu wedi milongo mishano kudya ko mzi wa Sodoma, ivyo nanuuleke umzi wose kwachausa cha awo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Ibulahimu agamba, “Sigamba nilonge na Zumbe, miye nitifili na maivu du. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Tankani wadaha wabwilwe wantu wedi milongo mine na washano ukaleka milongo mishano kwaviya wahunguka wantu washano?” Zumbe amhitula, “Sanukome uneva kuna wantu wedi milogo mine na washano.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Ibulahimu ongezeza kugamba, “Tankani wantu milongo mine wabwilwa umo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Zumbe amhitula, “Kwachausa cha wantu wedi milongo mine, sanitende ivyo,”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Ibulahimu ongezeza kugamba, “Weye Zumbe hampu nakulombeza unase kunihiwa, nami nanilonge vituhu. Tankani wadaha kubwila wantu wedi milongo mitatu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Zumbe amhitula, “Sanitende ivyo nina wabwila awo milongo mitatu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Ibulahimu ongezeza kulonga, “Nilekeila sigamba nilonge na Zumbe, takani wadaha kubwila wantu wedi milongo midi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Zumbe amhitula, “Sanukome kwachausa cha awo milongo midi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Uhelo, Ibulahimu agamba, “Weye Zumbe nakulombeza usekwihihwa, mna nanilonge vituhu nkanana imwedu. Togola, wanabwilwa wantu wedi mlongo umwenga du, na vitende vivihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Zumbe amhitula, “Kwachausa cha awo wantu wedi sanukome umziuwo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Zumbe eze abinde kulonga na Ibulahimu, kaita zakwe Ibulahimu naye auya kwenyumbakwe.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Masa ya wantu wa Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Wadya wandima wa kwembingu waidi wabula komzi wa Sodoma nechisingi. Lutu ekalaga he nchili yo mzi wa Sodoma, eze awawone, enuka na kuwasingila, niyo afunama kwa kuwatunya, <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />agamba, “Mazumbe wangu, ingilani mwe nyumbangu miye mndima ywenyu. Mwadaha mhake mazi mwe viga na mgone hangu ichilo cha dyelo. Mtondo chilochilo mwadaha mjendeleze no utafi wenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Mna, wowo wagamba, “Bule! Suwe nachigone muno mwo lwazo.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Lutu niyo awahembeleza vidala, eze vibule gati niyo wazumila, wahituka wengila mwenyumbakwe. Lutu awadamanyiza ngasu, oka migate heijeligwe hamila, wadya.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Mna nechilo hewenati kugona, wagosi wose wo mzi wa Sodoma, wabwanga kwa wakale, hasigale hata yumwenga, waizunguluka inyumba ya Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Wamwitanga Lutu na kumuza, “Wekuhi wadya wagosi wezile kwako? Walavye kuse. Chaunga chigone nawo.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Lutu avugala ulwivi chinyuma nyuma alawa kuse, <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />awagamba, “Walukolo wangu, nawahembelezani msekudamanya wavu uwo. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Kaula, nina wana chiche waidi hewanati kugona na mgosi. Lekani niwenkeni awo wandele muwadamanye ivyo mkunga. Mna msekuwadamanya wagosi wano kwaviya ni wajeni wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Mna wowo wagamba, “Chinkesila! Weye wezaga kuno wimjeni na haluse wetenda mkanta! Ivyo nachikutende wihi utendendese vikujinka awajeni wako.” Aho wamkunduganya Lutu kunyuma hadodo wavune ulwivi lwakwe. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Mna wadya wajeni wachulusa imikono yawo, wamvutila Lutu kunyumba na kuvugala ulwivi. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Wakaheza wawajela utuntu awo wagosi wose wendile holwivi, wakulu kwa wadodo, niyo wakunta kulonda ulwivi, wase kuluwona.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lutu afosa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Wadya wajeni waidi wamgamba Lutu, “Togola, una mntu mtuhu hano, tankani wanawo wachiche hegu wasozi wa wanawo wechiche hegu wantu watuhu wolukolo lwako wakwikala muno mo mzi? Sunguza walavye hantu hano, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />kwaviya mafuzumo yambwile Zumbe kulanga wekazi wa hano ni nkulu vitendese, uyo kachisigila chize chiwabalangeni.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Ivyo, Lutu awabasa wasozi wa wanawe wechiche, awagambila, “Sunguzani! Halaweni hantu hano, kwaviya Zumbe aunga aubalange umzi uno.” Mna wowo wamwona enga awatila du.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Mtondo kwize kuche wandima wa kwembngu wamhikiliza Lutu wakagamba, “Inuka, mguhe mkaziwo na wano wanawo wechiche waidi mnase kukomwa umo umzi uno ukabalangwa.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Lutu endile akatugatuga. Mna kwaviya Zumbe amwonele mbazi Lutu, wadya wandima wa kwembingu wamtoza uyo, mkaziwe na wanawe waidi wechindele, wawalavya kuse komzi. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Weze wawalavye kuse komzi, mndima yumwenga ywawo awagamba, “Gulukani chani mnahone. Msekusinya kunyuma naho msekuchimala hohose mwedikolongo. Gulukani ko lugulu mnase kukomwa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Lutu awagamba, “Bule, mazumbe wangu! <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Ni chindedi kugamba miye mndima ywenyu sipata wikazi mwa meso yenyu, nanywi mniwonela mbazi vitendese kwa kunikombola wikazi wangu, mna kwamagulu nihale vitendese. File ino na inibwile sinati kubula uko, nami nanibanike. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Kaulani, kudya kuna mzi mdodo udya hudaha kugulukila kwaviya wihaguhi. Ivyo, nilekani ni nyilikile uko. Udya ni mzi mdodo du, uko nanihone.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Uyo amhitula, “Nivyo, sizumila idilombezo dyako. Sanukome umzi ulongile. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Sunguza! Gulukila uko, miye nami sanidamanye dyodyose kubula aho nobwile uko.” Ivyo mzi uwo witangwa Soali kugamba mzi mdodo.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubalangwa kwa mizi ya Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Zuwa naditontomoka umo Lutu abwile mo mzi wa Soali. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Naho Zumbe aselezeze moto mkali wa chola kulaila kwembingu mlanga mwe mizi ya Sodoma na Gomola, <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />numo ayokile imizi iyo, kolongo dyose, wekazi wakwe wose ne mimeya yoseni mwe isi iyo. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Mna mkaziwe Lutu endile ekunyuma kwa Lutu, niyo ahituka kunyuma, ahituka nguzo ya munyu.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Chilo chilo. Ibulahimu kaita hadya endile achimale mwo uso wa Zumbe. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Umwo eyaho, niyo asinya hasi ntendele ye mizi ya Sodoma na Gomola nedikolongo dyose, kehelwa awona zosi dya zoto. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Chohile ivyo aibalange imizi ya mwe dikolongo endile akekala Lutu, amkumbuchila Ibulahimu kwa kumlavya Lutu mwe mizi iyo chani Lutu anase kwangamila hamwenga neiyo imizi.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kolwa dya Wamoabu na Waamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Lutu kogoha kwikala mo mzi wa Soali, ivyo niyo ausama umzi uwo hamwenga na wanawe waidi wa wachiche, waita kwikala mwe lundu mwa magulu. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Umo weyuko, mndele ywakwe umkulu amgamba mkuluwe, “Tati yetu kadalahala, na hahali mwana chigosi mweisi wakuchisola chipate wana. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Ivyo, chimkoze tate kwa divai, chani chigone naye na kwika ulukolo kwa kupata wana kwakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Ichilo icho wamkoza tati yawo kwa divai nkali na yudya mndele ywa nkongo kaita niyo agona nauyo. Mna tati yakwe havimanyize umo mndele wakwe agonile nauyo, naivyo ahalaile.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Luvi dyakwe, yudya mndele ywa nkongo niyo amgambila yudya umdodo, “Gulo neichilo miye sigona na tate, dyelo naho chimkoze kwa divai nkali, ukaheza weye wagona naye, naivyo chose na kwika ulukolo kwa kupata wana.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Ivyo, ichilo icho naho wamkoza tati yawo kwa divai nkali, akaheza yudya mndele mdodo aita akugona naye. Mna tati yakwe havimanyize umo mndele wakwe agonile naye, neivyo ahalaile. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Ivyo, wandele wose waidi wa Lutu wenula nda kulawana na tati yawo. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Yudya mndele ywa nkongo kefungula mwana wa chigosi, amwitanga Moabu. Uyo nuyo tati yawo dya Wamoabu kubula dyelo. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Yudya mndele umdodo kefungula mwana chigosi, amwitanga Benami. Uyo nuyotati yawo dya wa Waamoni kubula vino dyelo.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Kulaila Mamle, Ibulahimu katamba kugwila ntendele ya Negebu, aika wikazi wakwe mgati mwe isi ya Kadeshi na Shuli, akaheza aita kwikala hadodo uko Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Akatenda uko, Ibulahimu kagamba kugamba mkaziwe Sala ni lumbudye. Kwa ivyo, seuta Abimeleki wa Gelali niyo amguha Sala kutenda mkaziwe. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Mna Chohile kamwizila Abimeleki mwe sozi nechilo, amgamba, “Weye naubanike kwachausa cho mvyele uguhile, kwaviya ana mgosiwe.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Abimeleki nendile henati kugona na Sala, ahitula, “Zumbe, na ukome wantu hewana masa. <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Ibulahimu mwenye nuyo agambile kugamba yuno ni lumbudye. Naho hata Sala mwenye nakagamba kugamba Ibulahimu ni mkuluwe! Miye sidamanya ivyo nidamanye kwa moyo uchumile sina masa.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Ivyo, Chohile amgamba mwe isozi iyo, “Nivyo. Simanya kugamba kudamanya ivyo kwa moyo uchumile, na miye nuyo huchindile usekudamanya masa kwangu, nivyo vilekile hakuchinda use kumdonta uyo mvyele. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Haluse mvuze uyo mvyele kwa mgosiwe. Ibulahimu ni muwoni, uyo na akulombezeze na weye nawikale. Mna huna mvuzize, umanye kugamba chindedi weye naubanike hamwenga na wantu wako wose.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Ivyo, Abimeleki niyo enuka chilochilo, awetanga wandima weyawe wose na kuwagambila mbuli awone mwe sozi, wowo niyo wogohesa. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Naho Abimeleki amwitangile Ibulahimu, amuza, “Kuchitenda mbwani? Sikubalanga mbwani kubula kunigaila masa yano miye no uzumbe wangu? Kunidamanya mbuli heiwagilwe kudamanywa.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Vituhu Abimeleki ajendeleza kumuza, “Ni chibwani chikutintise kudamanya ivyo?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Ibulahimu amhitula, “Sidamanya ivyo kwa viya sifanyanya hahali mta nkama kwa Chohile hantu hano, na kugamba namnikoma chani mumguhe mkazangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Kujinka ayo, chindedi, uyo ni lumbu dyangu, tati yakwe na tati yangu ni wamwenga, mna wamazizetu wesimana, nivyo vilekile akatenda mkazangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Umwo Chohile anitendile niyase inyumba ya tate na kwita kwe si ya ujeni, nasimgamba mkazangu, ‘Hohose nachite hampu ugambe kugamba miye ni mkuluwo!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Abimeleki niyo amvuziza Ibulahimu mkaziwe Sala, amwinka na ngoto, ng'ombe na wandima wa chigosi na chivyele. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Naho Abimeleki amgamba Ibulahimu, “Kaula, isi ino yose ni yangu! Ivyo, sagula hohose ukunga, wikale.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Akaheza, amgamba Sala, “Kaula, miye simwinka mlukolo ywako vihande gana mlongo vya hela chani kuwalagisa wose wehamwenga na weye kugamba huna lema, kulavyanywa kugamba huna lema.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Akaheza Ibulahimu niyo amlombeza Chohile, uyo niyo amhonya Abimeleki, mkaziwe na mndima ywakwe, niyo wadaha kweleka wana vituhu. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Aho nkongo Zumbe endaga kawachinda wavyele wose wenyumba ya Abimeleki wasekweleka wana kwachausa cha Sala mkaza Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Chipindi chino Zumbe kamkumbuka Sala, amdamanyiza saviya alagane. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Umo, Ibulahimu adalahale, Sala niyo katenda msoka, amwelekela mwana ywa chigosi, chipindi ichiya Chohile alongaga. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Ibulahimu niyo amwinka uyo mwanawe Sala amwelekele zina Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Isaka eze abuze mazuwa mnane, Ibulahimu niyo amjela ngasu saviya Chohile amlagize. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Ibulahimu endaga na mihilimo gana umo akamweleka mwanawe Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Uyo Sala agamba, “Chohile kaninka luseko, yoyose neve izimbuli zino, naseke hamwenga na miye.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Niyo ongezeza, “Niyuhi adahile kumgamba Ibulahimu kugamba miye Sala nanonkeze wana? Naho simwelekela mwana chigosi mwo udalahailo wakwe.!”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Isaka niyo ajendeleza akula, mwedizuwa alekezwe ukonka, Ibulahimu niyo adamanya ngasu nkulu.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hajila na Ishumaeli Waguluswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Zuwa dimwe Ishumaeli, mwanawe dya Ibulahimu yudya elekwe ni Hajili, Mmisili, akamtila Isaka mwanawe. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Ivyo, Sala niyo amgamba Ibulahimu, “Mbalaze umtumwa yuno hamwenga na mwanawe. Havikudahika mwana ywa mtumwa alisi hamwenga na mwanangu Isaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Ulosi uwo umjela chiholozi vitendese Ibulahimu, kwaviya Ishumaeli naye ni mwanawe.<verse eid="GEN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Mna Chohile niyo amgamba Ibulahimu, “Usekwingilwa nichiholozi kwachausa cho mwana yuno, ukaleka umtumwa ywako ywe chivyele. Dyodyose nakugambile Sala damanya, chindedi lweleko lwako na lulawane na Isaka saviya nalongaga. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Nakulanga uyo mwana ywo mtumwa ywako, nanimtende atende tati ywa wantu walozize kwaviya uyo naye ni mwanawo.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Mtondo zuwa ditimile, Ibulahimu amwinka Hajili nkande na buyu dimemile mazi, amwinka Hajili na amwelesa umwana, nakumgamba halawe hamwenga na mwanawe. Hajili kahalawa, nakwangadika mwenyika ya Baasheba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Mazi yeze yasile mwe dibuyu, Hajili niyo amgoneza umwana hasi hemti. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Naye niyo aita hale hadodo, akwikala hatali hakwinga mpima gana, akegamba mo moyo wakwe, “Sikunga hamwona mwanagu akabanika.” Umo achei ekale aho, mwana niyo aila kwa izwi.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Chohile niyo eva uyo mwana akaila, na mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile niyo amwitanga Hajili kulaila kwembingu, amgamba, “Hajili unambwani,? Usekogoha, Chohile keva idizwi dya mwana uko eli. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Chimala umwinule na umtoze vyedi mwe mikono yako, kwaviya nanimtende atende tati ywa wantu walozize.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Chohile amgubula ameso Hajili, naye niyo awona sima dyamazi, niyo aita akumemeza idibuyu mazi na kumnywesa mwanawe. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Chohile niyo atenda hamwenga nauyo mwana, naye niyo ajendeleza kukula. Kekala kwenyika na kutenda mkala ywa uta vidala. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Nakekala mwenyika ya Palani, mami yakwe niyo amloza mvyele kulaila mwe isi ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagano dya Ibulahimu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Mwe chipindi icho, Abimeleki hamwenga na Fikoli, mkulu ywa wankondo wakwe, kambasa Ibulahimu, amgamba, “Chohile ehamwenga na weye mwe chila chintu ukudamanya. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Ivyo unelisize kwa zina dya Chohile kugamba honibalange hegu wanangu hegu welekwa wangu. Saviya miye ni mchindedi kwako, nivyo weye nawe utende mchindedi kwangu na kwe isi ino ukwikala.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Ibulahimu agamba, “Nelisa.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Chipindi icho Ibulahimu nendile akamfuzumila Abimeleki mwe disima dya mazi diya wandima wa Abimeleki wamhokaga. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimeleki niyo amgamba, “Miye simanyize niyuhi atendile ivyo, kubula dyelo vino weye hunigambile naho miye sinati kwiva izimbuli zino kubula dyelo.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Ivyo, Ibulahimu niyo aguha ngoto na ng'ombe amwinka Abimeleki nawo waidi niyo wadamanya lagano. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Ibulahimu niyo apagula ng'oto fyele mfungate. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimeleki amuza Ibulahimu, “Nimbwani ukapagula awo wanangoto wachivyele mfungate?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Ibulahimu amhitula, “Wano wanangoto mfungate nakwinka kwa mkono wangu mwenye saviya ukuzi kugamba miye nuyo nisimbile idisima dino.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Ivyo hantu hadya vileka hetangwa Beelisheba. Kwaviya wose waidi waikaga cheliso hantu aho.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Ivyo, niyo wadamanya lagano uko Beelisheba. Abimeleki na Fikoli, mkulu ywa wankondo wakwe, niyo akulawa na kuya mwe isi ya Wafilisiti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Ibulahimu niyo ahanda mkwazu uko Beelisheba, alombeza kwa zina dya Zumbe, Chohile ywa mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Ibulahimu ekalaga mwe isi ya Wafilisiti chipindi chitali.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu amlavya Isaka lavyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Chize chomboke chipindi chisiku, Chohile niyo amjeza Ibulahimu. Chohile kamwitanga, “Ibulahimu!” Naye niyo etika, “Heye netegeleza.”<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Chohile amgamba, “Mguhe mwanawo, Isaka, mwanawo ywa ichedu ukumunga, wite kubula isi ya Moliya, ukamlavye lavyo dya koka mwa malugulu ya lugulu nahulagise.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Ivyo zuwa ditimile, chilochilo Ibulahimu kenuka nakusaka imbunda yakwe, kaguha wandima wakwe waidi hamwenga na Isaka mwanawe. Kakanta nkuni za kokela idilavyo, akaheza niyo akonga ntambo kuhinga hantu agambilwe ni Chohile. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Dize dibule zuwa dya katatu, Ibulahimu niyo enula meso kahawona hantu aho kwa luhale. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Awagamba wandima wakwe, “Gojani hano hamwenga nempunda, miye na mwanangu na chite kubula kudya. Nachimvikile Chohile, ukajika nachiwawiyeni.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Ivyo Ibulahimu, kamtwisa Isaka izinkuni zokokela idilavyo, mwenye kaguha ngola na moto mo mkono, wahalawanya, <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Isaka amuza ise, “Tate, nkuni chinanazo, mna mwana ngoto ywe dilavyo dyokoka ekuhi?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Ibulahimu amhitula, “Mwanagu Chohile nepatile mwenye mwana ngoto kwachausa chedilavyo idyo.” Ivyo waidi awo wajendeleza ne ntambo yawo.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Weze wabule hantu hadya agambilwe ni Chohile, Ibulahimu aumbika mayuwe na kutenda nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko na kwika nkuni mlanga makwe. Akaheza amtaliza sigi mwanawe Isaka na kumwika mlanga mwe zinkuni mwe nchanja yokulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Ibulahimu niyo achulusa umkono wakwe, aguha ngola chani amchinje mwanawe. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Mna mndima ywa kwembngu ywa Chohile kamwitanga kulaila kwembingu, “Ibulahimu, Ibulahimu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Ahitula, “Heye, nimiye hano.”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Amgamba “Usekumchinja mwanawo naho usekumtenda dyodyose! Haluse Simanya kugamba wamtunya na kumzumila Chohile, kwaviya huninyimile kuninka mwanawo ywechedu.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Ibulahimu kakaula kuno na kuno, awona ndolome igwizigwe amahembe he kasaka. Ivyo, kaita kakuiguha ndolome iyo, kailavya lavyo dya koka na kumleka mwanawe. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Ivyo, Ibulahimu niyo ahetanga hantu aho, “Zumbe enkiza.” Saviya vikulongwa kubula vino dyelo, “Mwo lugulu lwa Zumbe, wantu nawenkwe.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe niyo amwitanga Ibulahimu nkanana ya kaidi kulaila kwembingu, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />Zumbe agamba vino, “Selisa mwenye kugamba kwa vino udamanye, huninyimile mwanawo ywechedu, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />chindedi nahuhjimbike na welekwa wako na niwongeze saviya ntondo za kwembingu, hegu msanga wa mpwani. Welekwa wako na walongoze mizi ya wankondo wawo. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Kulaila mwa welekwa wako si zose mwe isi nazijimbikwe kwaviya weye kutongela viya hugambile.”<verse eid="GEN 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Ivyo, Ibulahimu kawawiya wadya awandima wakwe, nehamwenga nawo niyo waitanya, wauya Beli sheba. Ibulahimu ekalaga uko Belisheba.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Naholi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Vikaheza kulaila ivyo Ibulahimu keva kugamba Milika naye kamwelekela mlukolo wakwe Naholi mwana ywa chilume. <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Mwelekwa ywa nkongo endaga Usi na Buzi mkuluwe, Kemueli tati yakwe dya Alamu, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kesedi na Hazo na Pilidashi na Yidilafu na Betuweli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betuweli amweleka Lebeka na Milika amwelekelaga wana mnane Naholi, mlukolo ywakwe dya Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Ukaleka ayo, Leuma chilaga cha Naholi, naye amwelekelaga wana, Teba na Gahamu na Tahashi na Maka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Kubanika kwa Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Sala ekalaga mihilimo gana milongo midi na mfungate. Iyo niyo yendaga mihilimo yo wikazi wakwe Sala. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Abanikilaga uko Kiliasialiba, kugamba Hebuloni, mwe isi ya Kanani. Ibulahimu niyo alomboleza indilo ya mkaziwe Sala.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Ibulahimu asaga imaiti ya mkaziwe, aita kulonga na Wahiti, awagamba, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Miye nekala enga mjeni mgati mwenyu. Nitagilani chihande cha sanga chani nimhambe mkazangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Wahiti wamhitula, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Elo seuta dyetu, chetegeleze, weye wimntu mkulu vitendese mgati mwetu. Mhambe mkaziwo mwe mbila yoyose nosagule, hahana yoyose mgati mwetu nakunyime hantu hakwe hekuhambila, hegu kukuchinda kumhamba mtokubanika mkaziwo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Aho Ibulahimu niyo awenamila kulongozi kwa Wahiti kwa ntunyo, <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />na kuwagamba, “Uneva mnizumila nimhambe mkazangu, hampu mlombezeni Efuloni mwana ywa Sohali, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />anitagile impanga yakwe ya Makapela imo mhaka mwe nkonde yakwe. Mwileni anitagile nitende mbila zangu, Mlombezeni anitagile kwa yombe dikuwagila kulongozi kwenyu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Efuloni mwenye endaga mgati mwa Wahiti awo waduganaga mwe nchili yo mzi. Ivyo, Efuloni Mhiti, amhitula Ibulahimu, kulongozi kwa Wahiti wose aho henchili, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“Mbwawe seuta bule, hampu netegeleza. Nakwinka inkonde yose ne mpanga idya imgati umo, naho nakwinka kulongozi kwa wanasi weyangu, mhambe umo mtokubania mkaziwo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Bulahimu niyo enama vituhu kwa ntunyo kulongozi kwa wanasi, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />na kumgamba Efuloni, wanasi wose waketegeleza, “Nakulombeza, hampu unetegeleze. Nahulihe yombe diwagile dye nkonde yako, nakulombeza uhokele maliho yano, chani nidahe kumhamba umo mtokubanika mkazangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efuloni amhitula Ibulahimu, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Netegeleza seuta dyangu nkonde ina yombe dya vihande magana milongo mine du ya hela, elo izo nichimbwani mgati mwako na miye? Mhambe mkaziwo.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Ibulahimu niyo wevana na Efuloni, niyo amhimila vikuligana ne zihela alongile kulongozi kwa Wahiti wose, hela vihande magana milongo mine, viligane na wata mayombe mwe chipindi icho.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Ivyo, inkonde ya Efuloni yendaga uko Makipela, kwamwenye mzi wa Mamle, mpanga ne miti yose yendaga hamwenga ntendele njima yatenda yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Ibulahimu agula inkonde kulongozi kwa Wahiti wose waduganaga henchili yo mzi.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Vikaheza, Ibulahimu niyo amhamba mkaziwe Sala mwe mpanga iyo yendaga mwe nkonde ya Makipela, kwamwenye mzi mwa Mamle kugamba Hebuloni mwe isi ya Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Inkonde ne mpanga yendaga umo vilavyanywa ni Wahiti vitende vya Ibulahimu atende hantu hakuhambila wata kubanika wakwe.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Isaka asola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Ibulahimu katenda kadahala ana mihilimo ilozize. Zumbe nakamjimbika kwa chila mbuli. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Ibulahimu amgamba mndima ywakwe mkulu kujinka watuhu na mchimaila wa ugoli wakwe wose, “Jela umkono wako mwamaheke yangu, <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />miye nami nahwelise kwa zina dya Zumbe, Chohile ywa kwembingu na ywe isi, kugamba homloze mwanangu ywa chiche yoyose mgati mwa wana chiche wa Wakanani hwikala nawo. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Nelisiza kugamba nawite kubula mwe isi yangu, kwa walukolo wangu, umlondele mwanangu Isaka mvyele.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Mndima amgamba, “Tankani umvyele uyo nalemele kutimilana namiye kwiza kuno, togola, aungwa nimvuze mwanawo kwe isi ulaile?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Bulahimu niyo amhitula, “Bule! Kaulisa unase kumvuza mwangu uko. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Zumbe, Chohile ywa kwembingu, anilavize kwe nyumba ya tate na kulaila mwe isi nelekwe, na yudya alongaga namiye, anelisizaga kugamba nawenke welekwa wangu isi ino. Uyo Chohile namsigile mndima ywakwe kulongozi kwako chani umwigaile mwanangu mvyele kulaila uko. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Uneva umvyele uyo haunge kutimilana na weye kubula kuno, ivyo cheliso changu hachikuchinde, mna kwa vyo vyose viya unase kumvuza mwanangu uko.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Ivyo, mndima uyo niyo ajela umkono wakwe mwamaheke ya Ibulahimu, seuta dyakwe, elisa mwe mbuli iyo.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Vikaheza mndima uyo niyo aguha ngamiya mlongo umwe za seuta dyakwe na kahalawa akatenda na majeleke yedi yesimile. Katamba kwita ko mzi ekalaga Naholi, mwe isi ya Mesopotamiya. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Umo eze abule, kazitenda izingamiya zifike mavindi mnkanda mwe disima dya mazi dyendile kuse komzi. Endaga chisingi, chipindi wavyele na wakakuteka mazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Niyo alombeza, “Weye Zumbe, Chohile ywa seuta dyangu Ibulahimu, nakulombeza dyelo unidahize kutenda mhuda naho umdamanyize yedi seuta dyangu Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Nihano sichimala hankanda hedisima hadya wandele wa wakaya womzi weza kuteka mazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Elo mndele nanimgambe kwetule idibiga dyako uninke mazi niywe, niyo aninka hamwenga na kunywesa izingamiya zangu, natende nuyo umsaguile mndima ywako Isaka. Mbuli iyo nailagise kugamba kumdamanyiza yedi seuta ywangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Umo henati kubinda ukulombeza, Lebeka kabula na biga dyakwe komtwi. Nendile ni mndele ywa Betuweli mwana ywa Milika mkaza Naholi mlukolo ywa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Endaga mndele mtana vitendese naho nendile kavunasuche. Kasela kwe disima, kamemeza idibiga dyakwe, auya. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Yudya mndima niyo asunguza kumbwila naye amgamba, “Hampu ninka mazi ya kunywa mwe dibiga dyako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Mndele amgamba, “Haya nywa seuta dyangu.” Aho etula idibiga amtozeza amnywesa. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Eze abinde, amgamba, “Nanizinywese izingamiya zako zose ivyo nazunge.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Elo niyo asunguza ajida amazi yemwedibiga dyakwe mwe hondo, akuteka mazi matuhu, kubula hadya izingamiya zose ziheza kunywa. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Yudya mgosi amkaula du, euza kugamba Zumbe kaidahiza intambo yakwe hegu bule.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ngamiya zize ziheze kuywa mazi, niyo yudya mntu amwinka chinchofu cha zahabu cha gilamu mtandatu na bangili mbili nkulu za zahabu zina yombe kulu amvisa mwemikono. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Amuza, “Hampu nigambila weye wimndele mwana yuhi? Kwenyumba yenyu kuna hantu hekugona?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Lebeka agamba, “Tate miye ni Besueli mwanawe dya Naholi na Milika, <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Kwetu kuna luwala lwa kudimila na hantu hakudaha kugona wajeni.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Yudya mntu niyo efunamiza na kumvikila Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Agamba, “Mtunyeni Zumbe, Chohile ywa Tati yangu Ibulahimu, yudya mo uzumizi wakwe hajaile chiya alangane na sekulu ywangu. Zumbe Chohile anilongoza mwenye kubula kwa walukolo wa sekulu ywangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Yudya mndele niyo aguluka kwenyumba ya nine na kawagambila wantu wose viya vilaile. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Lebeka endaga na mkuluwe akwitangwa Labani, niyo alawa nanguluko kwita kwedisima abwilana na yudya mntu. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Hadya henati kuguluka kweta kwedisima, Labani nakawona ichinchofu nebangili mwe mikono mwa lumbudye na kwiva mbuli Lebeka agambilwe ni yudya mntu. Labani kambwila yudya mntu kachimala hajihi ne ngamiya yakwe hankanda hedisima, <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Labani amgamba, “Kalibu kwekaya yetu weye ujimbikwe ni Zumbe. Ni mbwani kuchimala kuse? Nina hantu nikiye hakugona, naho hana hantu hakudaha kugoneza izingamiya zako!”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Ivyo yudya mndima ywa Ibulahamu niyo engila mwe nyumba, Labani niyo azifungula izingamiya na kuzinka mani. Akaheza amwinka uyo na wantu wakwe mazi yakwesunta mwe viga vyawo. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Niyo wamalanya nkande kwachausa chakwe, yudya mntu agamba, “Sanidye kubula nilonge chiya nendile haunga nilonge.” Labani agamba, “Haya chigambile.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Yudya mntu agamba, “Miye ni mndima ywa Ibulahimu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />“Zumbe kamjimbikisa sekulu ywangu na kumtenda mntu mgoli. Kamwinka mafyo ya ngoto na mbuzi na ng'ombe na vito vya yombe kulu na zahabu, watumwa wa chigosi na wachivyele, ngamiya na mpunda. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Sala, mkaziwe dya sekulu ywangu, kamwelekela mwana chigosi hadya endaga kadalahala, sekulu ywangu niyo amwinka uyo mwana ugoli wakwe wose. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Sekulu ywangu kaniwapiza miye, ‘Akagamba homloze mndele ywangu mgati mwa wandele wa Wakanani wadya hwikala mwe isi yawo. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Mna, nawite kwe isi yangu, kwa walukolo wangu chani umlondele Isaka mvyele.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Nami niyo namuza sekulu ywangu, ‘Uneva analemela kunitimila chizanye kuno nanitende zeze?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Mna uyo agamba, ‘Zumbe Chohile yudya akunilongoza negale mndima ywakwe ywa kwembingu aite hamwenga na weye na kukudahiza intambo yako, chani umwigaile mwanangu mvyele akulawa kwa walukolo wangu mwenye, kulaila molukolo lwa tate. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Umo unabula kwa walukolo wangu hawanakwinkile uyo mndele hochindwe ni cheliso chako.’”<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Dyelo nize nibule kwedisima, Silombeza, ‘Weye Zumbe Chohile ywa sekulu ywangu Ibulahimu, hampu dyelo nambiza mwe ntambo yangu umdamanyize yedi sekulu ywangu Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Hadya nize, nize hano hedisima. Uneva mndele neze kuteka mazi, nanimlombeze aninke mazi ya kunywa kulaila mwe dibiga dyakwe, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />uyo anazumila naho niyo azumila kuzigaila izingamiya zangu, natende nuyo mvyele usagule atende mkaza mwana sekulu ywangu.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Sinati kukomeleza malombezo yangu momoyo, Lebeka eza na biga dyakwe mo mtwi aseleza kwedisima kuteka mazi. Namgamba, ‘Hampu ninka mazi ninywe.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Asunguza kwetula idibiga dyakwe, agamba, ‘Nywa, nanizinke izingamiya zako nazo.’ Niyo azinywesa izingamiya nazo. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Namuza, ‘Tati yako ni yuhi?’ Anihitula, ‘Tate etangwa Besueli mwanawe dya Naholi elekwe ni Milika.’ Niyo namvika chinchofu mwe mpula na kumvika bangili mwe mikono yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Niyo nafika madi namvikila Zumbe. Chohile ywa sekulu ywangu Ibulahimu, yudya anilongoze kwa walukolo wakwe wa sekulu ywangu, kudya nimlondele mvyele mwana sekulu ywangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Haluse, uneva na mkaunga mumdamanyize vyedi chindedi sekulu ywangu, hampu nigambilani. Uneva sivyo ivyo longani, nanikaule dyo kudamanya.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Labani na Besueli wahitula, “Kwaviya imbuli ino ilaila kwa Zumbe Chohile, suwe hachikudaha kuilamwila. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Kaula, Lebeka ehano, mguhe wite zako. Mleke atende mkaza mwana sekulu ywako, saviya Zumbe Chohile mwenye alongile.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Mndima ywa Ibulahimu eze eve izimbuli zawo, efunamila hasi na kumvikila Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Akaheza enkiza suche na vito vya yombe kulu na zahabu, nakumwinka Lebeka. Iviya kenkiza vintu vya yombe majeleko kwa mkuluwe na kwa mami yakwe.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Akaheza mndima ywa Ibulahimu na wantu wendile wehamwenga naye wadya na kunywa, na kucheleza chilo chose. Nomtondo weze wenuke, agamba, “Lekani nuye kwa sekulu ywangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Mna mkuluwe na mami yakwe Lebeka wagamba, “Lekani ekale naswi juma dimwenga vikadahika mazuwa mlongo umwenga, mwadaha kwita naye.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Mna awagamba, “Mse kuchikawiza. Zumbe kanihudila kale intambo yangu, lekani nuye kwa sekulu ywangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Niyo wagamba, “Lekani chimwitange na chikaule nageze.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Ivyo wamwitanga Lebeka na kumuza, “Togola! Nawite nayuno mntu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Ahitula, “Heye”.<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Ivyo wamlaga Lebeka mlukolo ywawo hamwenga no mwambizi ywakwe ywa chivyele, namndima ywa Ibulahimu waitanye na wantu wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Niyo wamtunya kwa milosi ino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:60">“Utende, mvyele mweleka wana walozese hewekuwazika!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:60">“Welekwa wako watende walisi wa wadya wehi wawo!” <verse eid="GEN 24:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Akaheza Lebeka na wandima wakwe wachivyele, nawo niyo wakwela mwe zingamiya na mndima ywa Ibulahimu, nakuhalawa wose.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />“Chipindi icho, Isaka nedile kakulawa Beelilahailoi, atenda ekala uko mwe dijagwa dya Negebu” <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Zuwa dimwenga nechisingi, Isaka kaita kwezinkonde kuwazagula. Ivyo, enula meso awona ngamiya zeza. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Lebeka naye eze enule meso kamwona Isaka, apilika hasi mwengamiya yakwe, <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />na kumuza mndima ywa Ibulahimu, “Niyuhi yudya mntu akujenda kudya kwenkonde, akwiza kuchihokela?” Yudya mndima niyo ahitula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">“Uyo nuyo sekulu ywangu.” Ivyo Lebeka aguha mtandiwo wakwe na kwegubikila mwa meso.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Yudya mndima amgambila Isaka yadya yose yalale. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Niyo Isaka amwingiza Lebeka mwedihema mdya nendile mamiyakwe Sala endile akekala, nakumtenda mkaziwe. Isaka nakamungisa Lebeka, vimtenda atondowazwe kwaviya nakabanikilwa ni mami yakwe.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Lweleko lutuhu lwa Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Ibulahimu asolaga mvyele mtuhu, endaga aketangwa Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Ketula amwelekelaga Ibulahimu wana, Zimlani na Yokishani na Medani na Midiani na Ishibaki na Suwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokisha kamweleka Sheba na Dedani na lweleko lwa Dedani wendaga wantu wakwitangwa Waashulu na Waletushi na Waleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Wanawe dya Midiani wendaga Efa na Efeli na Enoki na Abida na Elida. Awo wose wendaga welekwa wa Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Ibulahimu amwinkaga Isaka ulisi wo ugoli wose endaga ananawo. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Mna wanawe eleke na wavyele watuhu awenkaga majeleko umo henati kubanika, ukajika awegala mwe isi ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa hale na mwanawe Isaka.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubanika kwa Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Ibulahimu ekalaga mihilimo gana na milongo mfungate na mishano. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Abanikaga eze ekale wikazi mtali kwa ugoli ulozize, niyo ehanga na wakale wakwe wamlongwelaga. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Wanawe Isaka na Ishumaeli wamhambaga tati yawo mwe mpanga ya Makipela, ulailo wa zuwa wa Mamle nkonde yendaga ya Efuloni mwanawe dya Sohali, Mhiti. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Ibulahimu agulaga inkonde iyo kwa Wahiti, uko nuko wahambagwa Ibulahimu na mkaziwe. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />File ya Ibulahimu ize iheze, Chohile niyo amjimbika Isaka mwana ywa Ibulahimu, naye niyo atenda ekala haguhi ne disima dya Belilahailoi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lweleko lwa Ishumaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Wano nawo welekwa wa Ishumaeli mwana ywa Ibulahimu elekagwa ni Hajila mvyele mtumwa ywa isi ya Misili endaga mndima ywa Sala, yudya Sala amwelekelaga Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Yano ni mazina ya wana wa Ishumaeli yadongoloswe kuligana na viya welekwe, Nebayosi na Kedali na Adibeli na Mibusamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Mishima na Duma na Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadadi na Tema na Yetuli na Nafishi na Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Wendaga wakale vilongozi wa nkolo mlongo na mbili, mazina ye mizi yawo yetangagwa kutimila amazina yawo. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ishumaeli abanikaga akatenda na mihilimo gana na milongo mitatu na mfungate, niyo ehanga na wakale wakwe wamlongwele. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Lweleko lwa Ishumaeli lwekalaga mwe hantu hemgati mwa Havila na Shuli ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa mwe isi ya Misili mwe sila ikwita Ashulu. Wekalaga kwa kwenegana na lweleko lutuhu lwa Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Esau na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Wano nawo welekwa wa Isaka mwana ywa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Isaka eze atende na mhilimo milongo mine amsolaga Lebeka, mndele mwana mntu ywa Besueli uyo Mwalamu kulaila Padani Alamu, lumbudye dya Labani. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Kwaviya Lebeka endaga hakweleka, Isaka niyo amlombeza Zumbe. Zumbe niyo amhitula idilombezo dyakwe, Lebeka atenda msoka. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Usoka uwo wendaga wa wana waidi, wana awo nawakahigana mndani mweinda ya Lebeka, naye agamba, “Uneva izimbuli nivyozili, Nimbwani nikale?” Niyo aita akumuza Zumbe.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Zumbe niyo amgamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Nkolo mbili zi mweinda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">nkolo mbili naweleke nazisigane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Imwenga naitende na nguvu kujinka tuhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Inkulu naimsankanile indodo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Chipindi cho kwefungula chize chibule, Lebeka niyo efungula mapacha wa chigosi. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Ywankongo endaga mnkundu guu, naho umwili wakwe wose wendaga saviya mntu availe suche ya mazoya, wamwitanga zina dyakwe Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Ywaakaidi kelekwa kuno kamkagatila Esau mwe chisigino, ivyo niyo etangwa Yakobo. Isaka endaga na mihilimo ya milongo mtandatu umo Esau na Yakobo wakelekwa.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau ataga uwelekwa wakwe wa nkongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Wadya wana niyo wakula, Esau atendaga mkala vitendese, mntu aungise kucheseka, mna Yakobo katendaga kahola akungisa kwikala mkaya. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Isaka amungisaga Esau, kwachausa cha kudya na kubweda izinyama zikukomwa ni Esau, mna Lebeka kamungisa Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Zuwa dimwenga Yakobo nakambika mahalagwe, Esau engila akalaila kokucheseka. Nana sala itendese. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Elo niyo amgamba Yakobo, “Sunguza nafa sala, ninkaga iyo inkande inkundu.” Vino nivyo vilekile aketangwa Edomu, kugamba “Unkundu.”<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobo amhitula, “Nahwinkage uneva noninke uwelewa wako wa nkongo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esau agamba, “Nivyedi! Nafa sala, welekwa wangu wa nkongo nauniwagile mbwani?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakobo niyo amgamba, “Nkongo nelisiza kugamba noninke welekwa wako wa nkongo.” Esau niyo amwelisiza na kumwinka Yakobo welekwa wakwe wa nkongo.<verse eid="GEN 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Naho Yakobo amwinkile migate mijeche na msuzi. Esau niyo adya na kunywa eze egute ahalawa. Ivyo nivyo Esau atendile kwa kuubela uwelekwa wakwe wa nkongo.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Isaka asamila Gelali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Niyo kwalaila gumbo mwe isi iyo, gubo dyesimane na diya dyalailaga aho nkongo umo Ibulahimu henati kubanika. Isaka niyo aita Gelali kwa Abimeleki seuta ywa Wafilisiti. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amlaila Isaka na kumgamba, “Usekwita Misili, ikala mwe isi ino nahugambile wikale. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Ikala mwe isi ino yo jeni, miyenami nanitende hamwenga naweye nahujimbike. Nanichintize ndagano nilagane na iso Ibulahimu, kwaviya nahwinke weye no lweleko lwako izisi zino zose. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Nanijenyeze ulweleko lwako lutende saviya ntondo zikwe mbingu na niwenke welekwa wako izisi zino zose. Kulawana na welekwa wako, wantu wose mwe zisi zose nawajimbikwe, <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Nahujimbike kwaviya Ibulahimu nakanizumila miye, nakwika sigilizi zangu na malagizo yangu na miko yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Elo, Isaka niyo ekala Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Wantu wa uko weze wamuze mbuli za mkaziwe, awahitula, “Yuno ni lumbu dyangu.” Haungile kulavyanya kugamba ni mkaziwe, kwaviya nakogoha kugamba wantu wadya nawamkome niyo wamguha Lebeka, kwaviya nanimtana vitendese. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Isaka eze ekale uko kwa chipindi chitali, seuta Abimeleki asungilaga hasi kombokela mwe langa amwona Isaka na mkaziwe Lebeka wadegesana. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimeleki niyo amwitanga Isaka na kugamba, “Chindedi yuno nimkaziwo! Nimbwani ukagamba ni lumbudyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Amhitula, “Nasifanyanya kugamba nanikomwe uneva nagambile ni mkazangu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Abimeleki agamba “Nimbuli yani uchitendile suwe? Yumwenga ywa wantu wangu nakadaha kugona na mkaziwo hene nkama, nakuchikoza masa.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Abimeleki niyo awafunda wantu wose, “Uyo na namkufye umntu yuno hegu mkaziwe nakomwe.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Isaka niyo ahanda mbeyu mwe isi idya, mo mhilimo uwo niyo avuna nkanana gana milongo saviya ahandaga, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile amjimbikaga. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Kujimbikwa uko, kumtenda Isaka ajendeleze nakutenda mgoli vitendese. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Kwaviya endaga na ngoto zilozize na ng'ombe na watumwa walozize, Wafilisiti wamdila finju. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Niyo wafunta amasima yose yasimbagwa ni watumwa wa tati yakwe Ibulahimu umo endaga henati kubanika.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Niyo Abimeleki amgamba Isaka, “Mlawe mwe isi yetu. Kwaviya kuchihuma nguvu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Elo Isaka niyo amlawa akwika nkambi mwe kolongo dya Gelali nakwikala uko kwa chipindi. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Isaka niyo ayasimba naho amasima yadya yasimbagwa mwe chipindi cha Ibulahimu, niyo Wafilisiti wayafunta umo Ibulahimu eze abanike. Isaka kayenka mazina ayadya yenkagwa ni tati yakwe.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Mna watumwa wa Isaka weze wasimbe sima mwe dikolongo na kubwila sokwe za mazi yempeho yakudibwilika, <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />wadimi wa Gelali watenda na nkumbizi na wadimi wa Isaka na kugamba, “Yano mazi ni yetu.” Naho etangile idisima idyo, “Eseki” kugamba nkumbizi.<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Vikaheza watumwa wa Isaka niyo wasimba sima tuhu, nadyo niyo wadigombela, Isaka aditanga idisima idyo “Sitina.” <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Isaka niyo asama uko aita kuntu kutuhu asimba sima tuhu. Mna idyo hawadigombele, niyo aditanga “Lehobos.” Agamba, “Haluse Zumbe kachinka kwenenwa kwikala mwe isi, naswi nachijenyele mwe isi.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Isaka kakulawa na kwita Beelisheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Mwe ichilo icho Zumbe Chohile amlaila na kumgamba, “Miye ni Chohile ywa tati yenyu Ibulahimu. Usekogoha, kwaviya nihamwenga na weye. Nahujimbike na kulujenyeza ulweleko lwako kwachausa cha Ibulahimu mndima ywangu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Isaka niyo aumbika mayuwe na kutenda nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko na kumvikila Zumbe Chohile. Akaheza azenga nkambi yakwe uko, watumwa wakwe niyo wasimba sima.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimeleki wevana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Abimeleki eza kulaila Gelali hamwenga na Ahuzahi mlangilizi ywakwe na Fikoli mkulu ywa nkondo ywakwe kumkaula Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Isaka awauza, “Nimbwani mkeza kunikaula, nanywi namkanihiwa naho mnibalaza kweisi yenyu?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Wamhitula, “Haluse chimanya pwilili kugamba Zumbe Chohile ehamwenga na weye, chafanyanya kugamba chelisizane hamwenga nakwika ndagano, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />kugamba hochilumize, saviya suwe hachikulumize. Chakutendelelaga yedi niyo chakuleka uhalawe kwa utondowazi. Haluse nichindedi kugamba Zumbe Chohile kakujimbika.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Isaka niyo awadamanyiza ngasu, wadya na kunywa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Mtondo wakwe chilo chilo welisizana wenye kwa wenye. Akaheza Isaka awalaga, nawo wahalawa kwa utondowazi.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Mwedizuwa idyo watumwa wa Isaka weza kumgambila kulanga idisima wasimbile. Wamgamba, “Chiwona mazi.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Ivyo, Isaka adinka zina idisima idyo Chiba, kugamba “Cheliso.” Ivyo zina dyo mzi uwo kubula dyelo ni Balisheba.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wavyele wa Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esau eze abule mihilimo milongo mine, niyo asola wavyele waidi wa Hiti, Judi mndele mwana ywa Beeli, na Basemasi mndele mwana ywa Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Wavyele awo wahosa wikazi wa Isaka na Lebeka utende wa kusulumila.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Isaka amjibika Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Isaka endaga mdalahala naho nendile hakuwona. Amwitanga manawe umkulu Esau na kumgamba, “Mwanangu!” Heye Tate “Miye ni hano”. <verse eid="GEN 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Isaka agamba, “Kaula miye sidalahala naho simanyize zuwa dya kubanika kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Guha uta wako nemisale, hita kumbago ukacheseke na ukanikomele nyama. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Unambikile nkande imwile idya hungisa, unigaile. Haheza ukwidya, hujimbike sinati kubanika.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Umo Isaka achei akalosana na Esau, Lebeka na aketegeleza. Ivyo Esau eze aite kokucheseka, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Lebeka amgamba Yakobo, “Siva ivyo tati yako amgambile Esau, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‘Nigaila nyama naho unambikile. Haheza ukudya, hujimbike kulongozi kwa Zumbe sinati kubanika.’” <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Haluse, Lebeka ajendeleza kulonga, “Tegeleza mwanangu naho udamanye ivyo nahugambile. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Hita kwedifyo ukaniguhile mbuzi zinonile mbili, vileke nizambike nanidamanye nkande idya tatiyako akungisa. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Ukaheza umwigaile akadye na akujimbike henati kubanika.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Mna Yakobo amgamba mamiyakwe, “Kumanya kugamba mkulu Esau ni mntu mta fili mo mwili, mna miye inkanda yangu ideleka. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Tankani Tate adaha anihahase niyo amanya kugamba miye simdantiliza, kwaivyo nanegaile ligito hantu haujimbiko.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Mamiyakwe amgamba, “Goja ligito dyako ditende mlanga mwangu, damanya du diya hukugambila naho hita ukaigaile izo izimbuzi.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Ivyo niyo Yakobo aita akuguha wana mbuzi waidi awigaila mamiyakwe, niyo adamanya nkande inamwile idya Tatiyakwe akungisa. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Akaheza Lebeka aguha suche ntana za Esau mwana ywakwe ywa nkongo, ziya ananazo mnyumba na kumvisa Yakobo mwanawe umdodo. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Niyo amvisa imikota yezimbuzi mwe mikono na mdya mwe singo yakwe mdeleke. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Amwinka inkande imwile hamwenga na mgate okile.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Akaheza Yakobo aita kwatatiyakwe na kumgamba, “Tate!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Agamba, “Yee nihano, ni weye yuhi mwanangu?” <verse eid="GEN 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakobo ahitula, “Nimiye mwanawo umkulu Esau. Sidamanya saviya unigambile. Hampu ikala udye inyama hwigaile, chani unijimbike.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Isaka amuza, “vita vivihi dyelo ukasunguza kukoma mwanangu?” Yakobo amhitula, “Zumbe Chohile ywako nuyo aninkile.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Isaka amgamba Yakobo, “Hampu ni sogeila haguhi chani huhahase. Niweye Esau chindedi hegu suyo weye?” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Yakobo amsogeila haguhi ise, ise niyo amhahasa na kugamba, “Idizwi dyako dyenga dya Yakobo, mna imikono yako ikala enga ya Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Habunkule kugamba ni Yakobo, Kwaviya imikono yakwe naina mazoya saviya ya Esau ivyo vyaleka akonga kumjimbika. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Mna niyo amuza vituhu, “Chindedi ni weye Esau?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Agamba, “Nimiye”. <verse eid="GEN 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Ivyo ise agamba, “Ninka inyama nidye maingo yako chani hujimbike.” Yakobo amwigaila idya inkande niyo adya naho niyo amwigaila divai niyo anywa. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Akaheza tatiyakwe Isaka amgamba, “Sogela haguhi mwanangu unikubatile.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Umwo akaunga amkubatile, Isaka niyo eva mpofa yezisuche, niyo amjimbika akagamba, “Mhempe wa mwanangu ikala enga mpofa ya nkonde ijimbikwe ni Zumbe. <verse eid="GEN 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Chohile nakwinke mawaga ya kwembingu na akwinke nkonde igatile! Akwinke vintu vya kunywa na nkande kwa ulozo!” <verse eid="GEN 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Wantu mwe isi nawakusankanile, na makabila nayakwinamile kwa ntunyo. Utende sekulu ywa walukolo wako na wana mami yako nawakwinamile kwa ntunyo. Akukuligita naligitwe na wadya nawakujimbike nawajimbikwe.<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau ahembeleza ujimbiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Isaka eze abinde kumjimbika Yakobo, na hadya Yakobo akuhalaila, mkuluwe Esau engila kulaila kokucheseka. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Ivyo ambika nkande inamwile na kumwigaila Tatiyakwe. Amgamba, “Hampu, Tate, ikala udye inyama hwigaile, chani unijimbike.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Isaka amuza, “Niweye yuhi?” Amhitula, “Nimiye mwanawo umkulu Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Isaka etuka na kuzingiza mwili wose, nakumuza, “Niweye yuhi, naho ni yuhi anikomele nyama nakunigaila maingo miye sidya kale hadya hunati kwiza?. Simjimbika kale ivyo navitendeke kalenakale.”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Esau eze eve ivyo, niyo aila kwa izwi kulu na chinyulu na kugamba, “Wooi hampu nijimbika, miye nami nijimbika tate!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Isaka amgamba, “Mkuluwo ywako keza kunidanta, kaguha ujimbiko wako.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esau agamba, “Vino nivyo vikuleka etangwa Yakobo! Kanidanta nkanana mbili.” Nkongo aguhaga welekwa wangu wa nkongo. Haluse kaguha ujimbiko wangu. Akajika amuza ise, “Togola hunisigazize ujimbiko wowose?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Isaka niyo amhitula, “Simtenda kale atende mkuluwo na siwatenda walukolo wakwe wose watende watumwa wakwe na kumwinka nkande na mvinyo. Haluse weye mwanangu hutendele mbwani?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esau ajendeleza kumgamba Tati yakwe, “Tate vino unaujimbiko imwenga du? Tate hampu nijimbika nami!” Akajika Esau niyo aila kwa izwi nkulu.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Naho Isaka tatiyakwe amgambile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Hadya he isi ihoile nahatende wikazi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">na uhale na mawaga ya kwembingu ni yako. <verse eid="GEN 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Nowikwe kwa kupolaganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">na kumsankanila mvunawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Aho naulemeile naho nokante luzigi lwakwe mwe singo yako.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Esau kamwihiwa Yakobo, kwachausa cho ujimbiko enkigwe ni tati yakwe. Elongela momoyo, “Mazuwa ya malombolezo ya tate aho nayasile naho nanimkome mlukolo wangu Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Mna Lebeka eze amanye fanyanyi za mwanawe umkulu, kamsigila mntu akamwitangile mwanawe umdodo Yakobo, niyo agamba, “Tegeleza, mkuluwo Esau ehoza kwa kwika mzungu wakwe wakukukoma. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Haluse, mwanangu, damanya ivyo hukugambila. Hita kwa mkulu Labani uko Halani, <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />na wikaile uko kwa chipindi amaya yamsele, <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />amaya ya mkuluwo yanasela aho najaile mbuli umdamanyize nanisigile mntu eze akuvuze. Nimbwani hunga niwaze wanangu wose waidi mwe zuwa idyo?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka Amsigila Yakobo kwa Labani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Lebeka amgamba Isaka, “Sibuntika naho sisokezwa na wavyele wa Esau. Uneva Yakobo naye anasola mndele mwa wavyele wa wahiti, wikazi wangu uno loso lwani?”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Ivyo Isaka amwitanga Yakobo, amjimbika, na kumsigila akagamba, “Unase kusola mndele yoyose Mkanani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Hake hita Padani alamu, kwenyumba ya babako Besueli, ukasole yumwenga mwa wandele wa mtumbawo Labani. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Chohile mta nguvu nakujimbike chani utende na welekwa walozize na kongezekela, chani utende mntu mkulu ywa wantu walozize. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Chohile akujimbike weye hamwenga na welekwa wako saviya amjimbike Ibulahimu, utende mlisi ywe isi mudya ukwikala enga mjeni, si idya amwinkaga Ibulahimu!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Ivyo, Isaka niyo amsigila Yakobo, niyo aita Palani alamu kwa Labani, endile mwana ywa Besueli, mntu ywa Alamu mkuluwe dya Lebeka, mamiyawo dya Yakobo na Esau. <verse eid="GEN 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Esau niyo abunkula kugamba Isaka nakamjimbika Yakobo na kumsigila aite akasole kudya Padani Alamu, nakugamba nakamlemeza asekusola mvyele ywa si ya Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Esau eze abunkula kugamba Yakobo na kaweva tatiyakwe na mamiyakwe niyo aita Padani Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Esau niyo amanya kugamba wandele wa chikanaani hawaungigwe ni tatiyakwe Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Ivyo niyo aita kwa Ishumaeli mwanawe dya Ibulahimu kamsola Mahalasi endaga lumbudye dya Nebayosi kongezeza wadya awavyele nananawo.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sozi ya Yakobo kudya Besueli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakobo kakulawa Beelisheba kuhinga Halani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Eze abule hantu hasiku niyo agona aho kwaviya zuwa nadibula chisingi. Niyo aguha yuwe dimwenga dya hadya ahantu niyo adika ko mtwi wakwe na kugona. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Kalota kugamba kawona ntantilo zibwile hasi zilaile kwembingu, wandima wa kwembingu wa Chohile wakwela wakasela mwezintantilo izo. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Aho amwona Zumbe kachimala haguhi, amgamba, “Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywa tati yako Ibulahimu na Isaka,” amgamba, “Nahwinke weye no lweleko lwako isi ino ugonile. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Lweleko lwako na lutende enga tifili mwe isi. Nalujenyele na kuzagala ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa na ulailo wa zuwa na kwa mwenye mzi na chibula kulawana no lweleko lwako wantu wose mwe isi nawajimbikwe. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Kaula! Miye nihamwenga na weye na nahudime hohose nawite, nakukuvuza mwe isi ino. Nanijendeleze kudamanya yadya hugambile kubula hadya nanichintize ndagano hugambile.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Yakobo eze enuke agamba, “Chindedi Zumbe ehano! Miye savimanyize!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Kogoha niyo agamba, “Hantu hano hatisa vidala! Vyadaha kutenda ni nyumba ya Chohile, naho navitende nulwivi lwa kwembingu.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Yakobo niyo enuka chilochilo, aguha idiyuwe diya ekiye umtwi wakwe, na kudichimalisa uge nguzo na kudikukiza kwa kujida mavuta mlanga mwakwe ditende dya Zumbe. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Kahetanga hadya hantu Besueli, kugamba “Nyumba ya Chohile” Mna umzi uwo aho nkongo nauketangwa Luzu. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Yakobo niyo elisa kwa Chohile akagamba, “Uneva unatenda na miye nakunidima mwe sila hujinkila na kuninka nkande na suche, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />uneva ninauya mpeho kukaya kwa Tate, naho weye Zumbe notenda Chohile ywangu. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Yuwe dino nichimalise enga nguzo nahatende hantu hako hakukuvikila, yose noninke nahwinke fungu dya mlongo.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo Abula kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Akaheza Yakobo ajendeleza nentambo kuhinga mwe ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Uko awona sima dimwenkonde digubikwe ni yuwe kulu na mafyo matatu ya ngoto yagona mnkanda mwedisima. Kwaviya mafyo ayo nayakata kutekelwa mazi kulaila mwe disima na kuna yuwe kulu digubikwe mlanga mwe disima. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Kwamazwela yawo umwo amafyo yoseni yezingoto yakadugana hamwenga, wadimi wafilingisa idiyuwe hamwenga kunkanda na kuzitekela amazi. Wakaheza wadigubika.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakobo niyo awauza awadimi, “Wambuya zangu, mwalawahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Wamhitula, “Chalaila Halani.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Awauza, “Togolani mummanya Labani, mwezukulu ywa Naholi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Wahitula “Heye, chimmanya.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Niyo ajendeleza kuwauza, “Togolani nimjima?” Wamgamba, “Nimjima, kaula umndele ywakwe niyudya akwiza ne zingoto.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yakobo agamba, “Kwaviya hakunati kutenda nomsi naho mafyo hayanati kudugana, nimbwani hemkuzitekela na kuzigala kokudimwa?”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Wamgamba, “Hachikudaha kuyatekela kubula amafyo yose yadugane ne diyuwe difingilise mwe disima, chikaheza chadaha kuzitekela izingoto.” <verse eid="GEN 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Hadya Yakobo achei kulonga nawo, Laheli keza ne zingoto za tati yawke kwaviya uyo nuyo nakazidima. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Yakobo eze amwone Laheli mndele ywa Labani na mtumbawe eze awone izingoto za mtumbawe Labani niyo aita nakudifingilisa idiyuwe mo mlomo we disima niyo adinywesa mazi idifyo dya Labani. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Akaheza amsesa nakukonga kwila kwa izwi. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Ukajika Yakobo amgambila Laheli, “Miye ni mlukolo ywa tati yako, mwanawe dya Lebeka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:12">Laheli Kaguluka kakumgambila tati yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Labani eze eve izimbuli za mwihwawe Yakobo, kamgulukila na kumkubatila na kumsesa, na kumwigala kunyumba, Yakobo eze amtamwile Labani mbuli zose zimlaile, <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Labani agamba, “Heye chindedi, weye mwihwangu ywa sakame.” Yakobo niyo ekala naye mwezi mjima.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo awasola Laheli na Leya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Zuwa dimwenga Labani amgamba Yakobo, “Weye wimlukolo ywangu mna sivyo kugamba naunisankaile bule. Nigambila maliho yako hulihe nyingahi?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Labani endaga ana wandele waidi, umkulu naketangwa Leya, umdodo naketangwa Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Leya endega na meso yakulembuwa, mna Laheli endaga mtana wa umwili na sula.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yakobo nakamunga Laheli, ivyo agamba, “Nahudamanyize ndima mihilimo mfungate chani uninke nimsole Laheli.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Labani agamba, “Ni vyedi hwinke weye Laheli ukaleka mntu mtuhu. Chikale wose hano.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Yakobo niyo adamanya ndima mihilimo mfungate chani amsole Laheli, ichipindi icho chiwoneka enga mazuwa majeche kwakwe, kwaviya amungile Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Ivyo Yakobo amgamba Labani, “Ndima iheza, niloza mkazangu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Ivyo Labani adamanya ngasu na kugoneka wantu wose. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Mna nechilo, kamleka Laheli, amguha Leya na kumwigaila Yakobo, Yakobo niyo agona naye. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Labani amwinka Leya mtumwa ywakwe akwitangwa Zilipa amsankanile. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Mtondo wakwe numo Yakobo abunkwile kugamba ni Leya. Amuza Labani, “Haa! Nimbwani ukanitenda vino? Sidamanye ndima kwachausa chakumguha Laheli? Nimbwani ukanitila?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labani amhitula, “Mwe isi yetu hachikutenda ivyo hechizwele kuloza mndele mdodo hadya umkulu henati kulozwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Goja mazuwa mfungate ye ngasu yomboke, nahuloze Laheli, uneva unanisankanila naho kwa mihilongo mfungate.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yakobo niyo azumila, eze iheze ingasu, Labani niyo amwinka umndele ywakwe Laheli atende mkaziwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Labani kamwinka mtumwa ywakwe ywachiche akwitangwa Biliha atende mtumwa ywakwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Yakobo niyo agona na Laheli naho, mna Yakobo nakamungisa Laheli kumjinka Leya. Niyo amsankanila Labani mihilimo mfungate mituhu.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Zumbe eze awone kugamba Leya hakungwa ni Yakobo niyo amwinka wana mna Laheli nendile ni tasa. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Leya niyo atenda msoka eleka mwana amwitanga Lubeni, agamba, “Zumbe kawona nkunto zangu, ivyo mgosi wangu nanunge”. <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Niyo enula nda vituhu eleka mwana chilume vituhu, agamba, “Zumbe kaninka mwana chilume naho, kwaviya keva kugamba sikungwa” Amwinka zina Simoni. <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Vituhu naho enula nda eleka mwana chilume, agamba, “Haluse mgosi wangu nanitozese miye kwaviya simwelekela wanachilume watatu, amwinka zina Lawi.” <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Niyo atenda msoka naho nakwefungula mwana chilume naho. Agamba, “Haluse nanimtunye Zumbe amwinka zina Yuda.” Niyo aleka kweleka wana.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Laheli eze awone hamweleke mwana Yakobo niyo amuwonela chinyulu lumbudye niyo amgambila Yakobo, “Ninka wana hunaninkile nabanika!” <verse eid="GEN 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yakobo amwihiwa Laheli na kumgamba, “Togola, miye ni hantu ha Chohile yudya akuchindile usekweleka wana.”<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Laheli amhitula, “Hano eyaho mtumwa ywangu Biliha, gona naye, chani eleke wana hantu hangu, miye nami nipate wana kulaila mwakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Ivyo niyo Laheli amwinkiza mndima ywakwe Biliha atende mkaza Yakobo. Yakobo niyo agona naye. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Biliha atenda msoka na kumwelekela Yakobo mwana ywa chilume. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Laheli agamba, “Chohile kanidamanyiza vyedi, keva indilo yangu na kuninka mwana chilume.” Ivyo amwinka zina dya Dani. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Biliha, mndima ywa Laheli atenda msoka vituhu na kumwelekela Yakobo mwana chilume ywa kaidi. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Naho Laheli agambile, “Chifiligisana na lumbu dyangu, nami si mhuda.” Ivyo amwinka zina umwana uyo dya Nafutali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Hadya Leya eze aleke ukweleka, niyo amwinkiza mtumwa ywakwe Zilipa kwa Yakobo atende mkaziwe. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Zilipa amwelekela Yakobo mwana chilume. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Leya agamba, “Nina mpafu.” Ivyo amwinka zina dya Gadi. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Zilipa mndima ywakwe Leya amwelekela Yakobo mwana mtuhu ywa chilume, <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Leya agamba, “Selelwa vidala! Haluse wavyele nawanitange kwelelwa. Ivyo amwinka zina dya Asheli.”<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Mwovuni we ngano, Lubeni aitaga kwenkonde na uko kabwila mti wantu wakufanyanya kugamba maizi yakwe yadaha kumwambiza mvyele atende msoka, amwigaila mami yakwe Leya. Laheli amgamba Leya, “Hampu ninka maizi majeche yamwanawo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Leya amhitula kwamaya, “Togola, wafanyanya kugamba ni mbuli ndodo kunihoka mgosi wangu, haluse waunga uguhe maizi ya mwanagu?” Laheli niyo amhitula, “Uneva nauninke maizi ya mwanawo, dyelo Yakobo na gone kwako.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Ivyo, chisingi Yakobo eze auye kulaila kwe nkonde, Leya niyo aita akumsingila, na kumgamba, “Dyelo nechilo ni budi wize ugone na miye, kwaviya sikuliha maizi ya mwanangu.” Ivyo Yakobo agona kwa Leya ichilo icho.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Chohile ahitula malombezo ya Leya, naye katenda msoka na kumwelekela Yakobo mwana ywa shano ywa chilume. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Leya agamba, “Chohile kaninka jeleko, kwaviya nimwinkile mgosi wangu mtumwangu.” Ivyo amwinka zina dya Isakali. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Leya niyo atenda msoka vituhu na kumwelekela Yakobo mwana chilume ywa mtandatu. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Agamba, “Chohile kaninka jeleko dyedi. Haluse mgosi wangu nanizumile, kwaviya simwelekela wana chilume mtandatu.” Ivyo amwitanga zina dya Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Vikaheza kefungula mwana ywa chivyele, niyo amwinka zina dya Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Akaheza Chohile amkumbuchila Laheli, kamhitula amalombezo yakwe na kumfungula inda yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Katenda msoka na kwefungula mwana chilume, agamba, “Chohile kanusiza soni.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Ivyo niyo amwika zina dya Yusufu, “Zumbe naninke mwana mtuhu.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo atenda mgoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Eze amweleke Yusufu, Yakobo amgamba Labani, “Ninka sila nuye kwe isi yangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Ninka wakazangu na wanangu, nipatile kwakukudamanyiza ndima nihalawe nawo. Kuvimanya ivyo vitana hudamanyize.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Labani amgamba, “Hake goja nigambe vino, sihina kwa kutabana kugamba Zumbe kanijimbika kwachausa chako. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Longa amaliho yako, nami nanilihe.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yakobo ahitula, “Kuvimanya ivyo husankanile na ivyo niwadimile awanyama wako. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Ujeche udya wendile unanawo wo ugoli hadya sinati kwiza wongezekela na Zumbe kakujimbikisa chila uko nitile. Mna haluse, nanidamanye ini mbuli ze mwe nyumba yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Labani amuza, “Hwinke mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yakobo amhitula, “Sikunga chochose. Nani jendeleze ukudima awanyama wako uneva unanidamanyiza ulosi uno. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Dyelo nilekeila nijinke mgatigati mwa awanyama wako wose na kusagula chila ngoto ntitu na inamaoleole mwe zimbuzi. Izo nizo nazite amaliho yangu hunga. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Umo nyumani numo nauwonele ukanuni wangu pwilili. Ukeza kukaula amaliho yangu, uneva unabwila mbuzi inamaoleole hegu ngoto ntitu kwangu na natende kabaigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Labani ahitula, “Navitende seivyo ukulonga.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Mna mwedizuwa idyo Labani niyo apagula mavulata yose yana maoleole na fyele zose zina maoleole naho niyo apagula ngoto zose ntitu. Kazinkiza kwa wanawe wazidime. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Labani niyo esenta hale na Yakobo atamba lujendo lwa mazuwa matatu. Yakobo katenda mdimi ywa mafyo ya Labani yasigale.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Yakobo niyo aguha nkombosha za lubugu lubisi, mkole, na mvilu na kuzigobola amagome chani imisilimbo ing'aile iwoneke mwe zinkombosha izo. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Kazichimalisa izinkombosha agobole mnkanda mwa mahondo yo kunywela mazi awanyama. Hantu hadya awanyama wakwizila kunywa mazi, kwaviya awanyama nawakakwelana na kwinulanda umo wakeza kunywa mazi. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Ivyo awanyama wakenulanda aho heizo izinkombosha, weleke wagoto na wabuzi wata maoleole na misilimbo na mabanjubanju.<verse eid="GEN 30:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yakobo niyo awapagula wambuzi na wadya awagoto kulaila kwa wanyama wata maoleole na watitu mwe difyo dya Labani. Mwe sila ino Yakobo niyo epatila fyo dyakwe mwenye, naho hadihanganye na diya dya Labani.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Chipindi cha kwinuila nda cha wanyama wadamane chikabula, Yakobo aika ziya izinkombosha kulongozi kwa yadya amafyo yakunywela amzi, chani yenulenda hadya he zinkombosha. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Mna hadya wadya wanyama wanyaile hakuzika ziya izinkombosha kulongozi kwawo. Chize chijinke chipindi chisiku Labani katenda na ziya zinyaile na Yakobo ziya zose zidamane. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Mwe sila ino Yakobo katenda mgoli vitendese. Katenda na wanyama na watumwa na ngamiya na mpunda.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo amsumka Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Yakobo keva kugamba wana wa Labani na wakang'ung'ula, “Yakobo kaguha ugoli wose wa tati yetu. Ugoli wose ulawana na viya tati yetu ananavyo.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Kawona kugamba Labani hakumtolotoza saviya nkongo. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Akaheza Zumbe amgamba Yakobo, “Uya kweisi ya watati zako na walukolo wako. Miye nanitende hamwenga na weye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Ivyo Yakobo asigila ulosi kwa Laheli na Leya chani wadugane koludimo kudya nakadimila awanyama. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Awagamba, “Sibunkula kugamba tati yenyu hakunitolotoza saviya nkongo, mna Chohile ywa tate katenda hamwenga na miye. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Mvimanya kugamba simsankanila tati yenyu kwa nguvu zangu zose. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Naho tati yenyu kanidanta kwa kuhituila maliho yangu nkanana mlongo. Mna Chohile hamwinkile luhenyo lwa kunilumiza. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Chila nkanana tati yenyu agambile, ‘Nawatende na maoleole nawo nawatende amaliho yako,’ wanyama woseni weleka wana wata maoleole. Na chila akagamba ‘Wanyama wose wata misilimbo nawatende maliho yako ivyo wanyama wose nawakeleka wanyama wata misilimbo.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Nivyo Chohile amhokile tati yenyu mbuzi na ngoto na kuninka miye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Silota chipindi cha wanyama wakenulanda, mwesozi iyo siwona mavulata yakweile nendile yana misilimbo na maoleaole na mabanju banju. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile anitanga, ‘Yakobo!’ Nami niyo netika, ‘Yee,’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Naye anigamba, ‘Kaula,’ mavulata yose yakukwela amavyele yana misilimbo na maoleole na mabanjuabanju. Mbuli iyo itendeka ivyo kwaviya siwona ivyo Labani akutendele. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Miye ni Chohile akulaile kudya Besueli, kudya welisize mweyuwe nakuditila mavuta ditende lukumbusa kudya unelisize miye. Haluse halawe heisi ino uye kweisi yako welekelwe.”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Laheli na Leya wamhitula Yakobo, “Suwe hachina chochote cha kulisi kulaila kwa tati yetu. <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Kachitenda enga wajeni. Kwaviya kachitaga na ugoli udya chiguligwe nawo nuwo akutumiya. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Ugoli uno wose Chohile amhokile tati yenyu ni wetu na wana wetu. Damanya yadya yose Chohile akugambile.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Naho Yakobo ahalaile, awakweza wanawe na wakazize mlanga mwezi ngamiya. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Kaguha wanyama wakwe wose, na ugoli wose endile apatile uko Padanalamu, niyo akonga ntambo kuya kwa Isaka tati yakwe mwe isi ya Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Chipindi icho Labani aitaga kuwamonya mazoya awanyama wakwe, ivyo Laheli niyo apata luhenyo lwa kubawa matukulu ye milungu ya ise henati kuhalawa. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Kujinka ayo Yakobo kamdantiliza Labani mntu akulaila Alamu kwakuhalawa hehena kumgambila kugamba ahalawa. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Kaguha chila chendile chakwe na kusunguza kusumka. Eze adeluke umto wa Efulati na kuhinga kolugulu lwa Gileadi, si ya magulu.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Labani Amtimila Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Eze dibule zuwa dya katatu Labani agambilwa kugamba Yakobo kasumka. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Labani awaguha walukolo wakwe wamcheseka Yakobo kwa mazuwa mfungate na kumbwila mwa magulu ya Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Nechilo mwe sozi Chohile kamwizila Labani mntu akulaila Alamu nakumgamba, “Usinyise unase kumtisa Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Elo, Labani niyo ambwila Yakobo, Chipindi icho Yakobo nakazenga lago dyakwe kwamagulu. Labani naye hamwenga na walukolo wakwe, niyo waika lago dyawo mwa magulu ya Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Labani amgamba Yakobo, “Kutenda mbwani kunidantiliza na kuwaguha wandele wangu enga wantu watahigwe mwe nkondo? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Nimbwani kusumka chinyele? Kunidantiliza naho hunigambile chani hulage kwa chinyemi na nchemo za nyinka na machindi na selo. <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Hungile miye niwasese wezukulu wangu na wandele wangu niwalage. Ivyo hudamanye vyedi! <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Nina nguvu zakudaha kukubalanga mna chilo cha kwinukila dyelo Chohile ywa tati yako kanifunda akagamba, ‘Kwenege unase kumtisa Yakobo.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Simanya kugamba kusumka kwaviya nakungisa kuya kukaya kwa iso, mna nibwani ukanibaila matukulu ye milungu yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobo amhitula Labani, “Sihalawa chinyele kwaviya nasogoha nonihoke wandele wako. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Mna uyo nombwile na matukulu yako nakomwe! Kulongozi kwa wano walukolo wetu, lagisa chochose chako uchiguhe.” Yakobo nahamanyize kugamba Laheli nakabawa amatukulu ya Labani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Ivyo Labani niyo alonda amatukulu ye milungu yakwe mwedihema dya Yakobo na dya Leya na dya wadya wandima waidi, mna hayapatile. Niyo afosa mwedihema dya Leya engila mwedihema dya Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Laheli nakayaguha amatukulu ayo, niyo ayafisa mwamatandiko ye ngamiya nakwikala mlanga mwakwe. Labani kayalonda mwedihema dyose, mna hayalondole. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Naho Laheli amgambile ise, “Tate nileka, usekwihiwa sikudaha kuchimala kulongozi kwako kwaviya nimwamazuwa yangu.” Labani kayalonda amatukulu ye milungu yakwe, mna hayalondole.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Yakobo niyo ehiwa amfuzumila Labani agamba, “Sibalanga mbwani? Wanusa chisimo chani? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Togola, nichibwani upatile wize uzuze izibahasha zangu zose? Chilavize kulongozi kwa walukolo wangu na walukolo wako, chani wowo walamule mgati mwetu suwe waidi! <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Sikala na weye kwa chipidi cha mihilimo milongo midi. Mwe chipindi chose icho ngoto zako hegu mbuzi zako hazajezaga kutalisha, naho sajezaga kudya ndolome mwedibunga dyako. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Miye sakwigailaga hata lumwenga mnyama ywako akomigwe ni kala dya kumbago, mna kwaza uko sikulihila miye mwenye. Weye kununga huvuzize hufanyanyanye kugamba ibaigwa namsi hegu nechilo! <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Ivyo, nomsi sijijimiza zuwa kali. Nechilo sififizwa ni mpeho, vinitendile sijezize kugona hata hadodo. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Kwa mihilimo milongo midi sikala mwe nyumbako. Sikusankanila kwa mihilimo mlongo na mine kwachausa cha vigoli wako waidi, na mihilimo mtandatu sidima awanyama wako. Mna weye niyo wahitwila maliho yangu nkanana mlongo. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Hegu Chohile ywa baba Ibulahimu, Chohile uyo amdamanye tate Isaka kuzingiza, hatendile ntendele yangu, kokanuni nakunileka nihalawe mikono bule. Mna Chohile kayawona masulumizo yangu na ndima nidamanye kwa mikono yangu, niyo akukwahila chilo cha dyelo kwinukila dyelo.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wivano wa Yakobo na Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Aho Labani amhitula Yakobo, “Vigoli wano ni vigoli wangu, wana wano ni wanangu, wanyama wano ni wanyama wangu, vyose ukuwona hano ni vyangu. Mna miye dyelo nadaha kudamanya mbwani mwa wano vigoli wangu na wana wawo weleke? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Elo, weye na miye chidamanye lagano, ditende ukuzi mgati mwako na miye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Elo, Yakobo niyo aguha yuwe, adichimalisa ditende saviya nguzo ya lukumbusa. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Naho Yakobo niyo awagamba walukolo wakwe, “Chisanyani mayuwe.” Niyo wachisanya mayuwe yatenda chuga. Niyo wadya nkande haguhi nechuga icho cha mayuwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Chuga icho Labani niyo achitanga Yega Sahadita, mna Yakobo niyo achitanga Galedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Labani niyo agamba, “Chuga chino ni ukuzi mgati mwako na miye dyelo.” Elo, Labani niyo achitanga Galedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Idya inguzo Labani kaitanga Mizipa akagamba, “Zumbe nachidime umo chikatenda hale hachikuwonana. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Hegu unawasulumiza vigoli wangu, unasola wavyele watuhu ukaleka wano, umanye kugamba hahana mukuzi mgati mwetu mna Chohile mwenye.” <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Labani niyo amgamba Yakobo, “Kaula ichuga chino ne nguzo ino nichimalise mgati mwako na miye. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Chuga chino ni ukuzi nguzo ino nayo ni ukuzi kugamba miye sanijinke chino ichuga kwiza kwako hulumize. Wenawe hojinke chino ichuga kwiza kwangu unilumize. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Chohile ywa Ibulahimu na Chohile ywa Naholi nalamule mgati mwetu.” Ivyo Yakobo niyo elisa kwa Chohile uyo amtendile ise Isaka azingize na kutoza chiya walagane. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Niyo alavya ntambiko kwa Chohile uko kolugulu, agoneka walukolo wadye nkande. Weze wadye nkande wasigaila uko chilo chose.<verse eid="GEN 31:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Mtondo chilochilo Labani enuka, awasesa wezukuluwe na vigoli wakwe, awajimbika. Niyo ahalawa auya kwekayakwe.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo emalanya adugane na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Yakobo ajendeleza notafi wakwe. Niyo adugana na mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Eze awawone, agamba, “Ino ni nkambi ya wankondo wa Chohile!” Ivyo niyo ahetanga hantu aho Mahanaimu. <verse eid="GEN 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Yakobo kasigila wantu wamlongoile kwa mlukolo ywakwe Esau, uko Seila, mwe isi ya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Kawalagisa akagamba, “Mumgambe sekulu ywangu Esau vino, mndima ywako Yakobo agamba vino, ‘Sikala kojeni kwa Labani kubula haluse. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Nina ng'ombe na mpunda na mafyo ya ngoto na wandima wa chilume na wachiche. Nakwigaila ulosi uno, sekulu ywangu, chani nihokele wedi wako.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Awo wasigilwa waita, wakaheza wauya wamgamba Yakobo, “Chita kwa mlukolo ywako Esau, naye emwesila kwiza kukuhokela, akatenda na wantu magana mane.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Ivyo, Yakobo kogoha vidala na kwagilwa. Kawapagula mwe mabunga maidi awantu nehamwenga nawo na ngoto na mbuzi na ng'ombe na ngamiya. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Akafanyanya, “Uneva Esau aneza kudikoma idibunga idimwenga, dimwenga dyadaha dinyilike.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Akaheza Yakobo amlombeza Chohile, “Weye Chohile ywa baba Ibulahimu, Chohile ywa tate Isaka! Weye Zumbe unigambaile nuye mwe isi kwa walukolo wangu, kunelisiza nonidamanyize yedi. <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Siwagilwe hata hadodo mo uwedi uninkile kwa ukanuni miye mndima ywako. Nize nideluke umto wa Yolodani, nesina chintu mna nkome, mna vino haluse nina mabunga yano maidi. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Nakulombeza unikombole haluse kulaila mwa maya ya mlukolo ywangu Esau, kwaviya nogoha kugamba nachitowe na kuchikoma chose, mamizamtu na wana. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Fanyanya kugamba nakunelisiza kunidamanyiza vyedi na kulutenda ulweleko lwangu lutende luloza enga msanga wa bahali udya heukudahika kuwazika.”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Ivyo, Yakobo kagona aho ichilo icho. Akaheza apagula fungu dya wanyama wakwe, ditende jeleko kwa mlukolo ywakwe Esau. <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />Mbuzi fyele magana maidi na mavulata milongo midi, ngoto fyele magana maidi na ndolome milongo midi, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />ngamiya milongo mitatu zikonkeza hamwenga nezi ndama zawo, ng'ombe fyele milongo mine na njeku mlongo umwe, na mpunda fyele milongo midi magosi mlongo umwenga. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Kawenka wandima wakwe, chila yumwenga bunga dyakwe, awagamba, “Nilongwelani mkasa mpong'a mgati mwe bunga na bunga mwe ntambo yenyu.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Amsigila yudya alongole, “Mlukolo ywangu Esau ukadugana naye na kukuza, ‘Weye wi mndima ywa yuhi? Waita nahi? Na wanyama wano ni wayuhi?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Weye mhitule, ‘Wano ni wanyama wa mndima ywako Yakobo, ivyo ni majeleko yako weye sekulu ywangu Esau. Naho Yakobo mwenye emnyuma atimila.’” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Kasigila ivyo kwa mndima ywa bunga dya kaidi na dya katatu na watuhu wose, akagamba, “Mnadugana na Esau mgambileni ulosi sauwo. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Naho namumgambe, ‘Mndima ywako Yakobo emnyuma mwetu atimila.’ ” Yakobo na akafanyanya kugamba, “Tankani nanimhoze kwa yadya majeleko humlongozeza, nyumani nadaha nidugane naye chimntu mntu.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Ivyo, kalongoza jeleko dyakwe, mna yeye mwenye kagona kwedilago ichilo icho.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo ahigana vyeleka na Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Ichilo icho Yakobo kenuka, kawaguha wakazize waidi, wandima wakwe waidi na wana wakwe mlongo na yumwe, adeluka umto wa Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Eze awadeluse kwe ng'ambo yo mto wadya nanawo no ugoli wakwe wose, <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Yakobo niyo asigala ichedu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">Ukajika mntu yumwenga niyo eza, ahigana naye vyeleka kubula chilochilo. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Mntu uyo eze awone kugamba hakudaha kumhuda Yakobo, kamtoza Yakobo mwe dipeng'ene, niyo atenkuka umo wakahigana vyeleka. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Vikaheza yudya mntu agamba, “Nilekela nite, kwacha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Yakobo ahitula, “Sahulekele ng'o, kubula unijimbike.” <verse eid="GEN 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Yudya mntu amuza, “Zina dyako ni weye yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Netangwa, “Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Yudya mntu agamba, “Hawitangwe Yakobo vituhu, mna nawitangwe Izulaeli, kwaviya kuhigana na Chohile na wantu niyo wahuda.”<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Yakobo amgamba, “Haluse nigambila idizina dyako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Mna amhitula, “Wanuzizani idizina dyangu?” Niyo amjimbika Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Yakobo niyo ahetanga ahantu aho Penieli, akagamba “Simuwona Chohile meso kwa meso mna miye sibanike.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Zuwa naditontomoka kale umo Yakobo akahalawa Penieli, nakabodila kwachausa che chigudi chakwe. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Nivyo vilekile hata dyelo dino Waizulaeli hawakudya nyama ya ping'ene, kwaviya yudya mntu na kamtenkula Yakobo mwe dipeng'ene dye chigudi chakwe.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo adugana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Vikaheza Yakobo akaula, amwona Esau eza na wantu magana mane. Aho Yakobo awapagula wanawe mgati mwa Leya na Laheli na wadya wawandima awaidi. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Awaika awandima na wana wawo walongole, akaheza Leya na wana wakwe, watimila Laheli na mwanawe Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Akaheza yeye mwenye awalongwela, agwa chifudifudi kubula hasi kwa ntunyo nkanana mfungate, akabula haguhi na mlukolo ywakwe. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Mna Esau niyo aguluka amsingila Yakobo, amkubatila na kumsesa. Wose na wakaila. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Esau eze akaule na kuwawona wadya wavyele na wana, auza, “Niwahi wano unananowo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakobo amhitula, “Wano ni wana wadya Chohile, kwa wedi wakwe kaninka miye mndima ywako.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Akaheza wadya wandima wadugana hamwenga na wana wawo, wenama kwa ntunyo. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Naho Leya na wanawe wenama kwa ntunyo. Vize vibule gati, Laheli na Yusufu weza, wenama kwa ntunyo.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esau auza, “Vyalagisa mbwani mwa mafyo yano ya wanyama nidugane nayo mwe sila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakobo ahitula, “Nahagamba nanizumilwe kulongozi kwako sekulu ywangu.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Mna Esau agamba, “Nina ugoli ukunichinta mlukolo wangu. Ugoli wako nautende wako mwenye.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yakobo amgamba, “Ng'o! Uneva chindedi kuzumila kunihokela, ivyo, nakweila uhokele jeleko dyangu. Chindedi, kuwona uso wako vyenga kuwona uso wa Chohile, kwaviya unihokele kwa vitana vitendese. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Ivyo, nakulombeza uzumile jeleko hwigaile, kwa viya hata miye Chohile kanitendela vyedi vitendese na kuninka chila chintu vitendese.” Yakobo kamhembeleza Esau niyo ahokela idijeleko dyakwe.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Esau agamba, “Heye! Chijendelezeni ne ntambo. Miye naniwalongwele.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Yakobo amgamba, “Sekulu ywangu, weye kumanya kugamba wano wana wache wadodo. Na kugamba wanyama wano wonkeza, uneva wanegalazanywa kwa zuwa dimwe nawafe woseni. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Ivyo, nakulombeza ulongole, nami na nitimile mpalahole ivyo na vikale ulujendo lwa wanyama na wana, kubula aho nanibule uko Seili.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Aho Esau agamba, “Goja hwasize wantu wangu awamwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Mna Yakobo agamba, “Vyalagisa mbwani kudamanya ivyo? Vyanichinta kugamba miye sihokela wedi wako weye sekulu ywangu.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Ivyo, mwedizuwa idyo Esau kakonga utafi wa kuya Seili. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Mna Yakobo katamba kwita Sukosi, uko niyo ezengela nyumba yakwe na maheha ya wanyama wakwe. Kwachausa icho hantu aho niyo hetangwa Sukosi.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Mo kuya Padani alamu, Yakobo kabula vyedi mo mzi wa Shekemu, mwe isi ya Kanani, niyo aika nkambi yakwe haguhi no mzi uwo. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Kagula chipande cha nkonde kwa welekwa wa Hamoli, tati yakwe Shekemu matundu gana ya hela. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Ivyo, niyo aumbika mayuwe na kutenda nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko hantu aho kahetanga Chohile ni Chohile ywa Izilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Kugonywa kwa Dina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Dina, mwanawe dya Yakobo na Leya, kaita kuwatalamkila wavyele wa Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Shekemu mwana Hamoli Mhiti, endile umkulu ywa kaya iyo, eze amwone, kamkakalisa na kumgonya chinguvu. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Mna Shekemu niyo atamilwa vidala nuyo mndele, amunga vyaleka akonga kumhembeleza. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Ivyo, amgamba tati yakwe Hamoli, “Naunga unilombezeze yuno mndele ni msole.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Yakobo niyo amanya kugamba Dina, mndele ywakwe, kajelwa uzavu ni Shekemu, mna kwaviya wanawe nendile wache koludimo, kanyamala kubula hadya wawiye. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Hamoli, tati yakwe Shekemu, kaita kwa Yakobo chani akatamwile naye, <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />mwe chipindi icho wana wa Yakobo wauya kukaya wakalaila koludimo. Weze weve ivyo, wabwanga awo wengilwa ni chinyulu na kwihiwa vitendese, kwaviya Shekemu awatendile mbuli ya soni mwa Izulaeli kwa kumgonya mwana ywa Yakobo, kwaviya mbuli iyo na nimwiko. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Mna Hamoli awagamba, “Mwanangu Shekemu amungisisa mndele ywenyu. Vikadahika mlekeni amsole. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Lekani chisolane nyuwe namchiloze wandele wenyu suwe nawi nachiwaloze wandele wetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Ivyo mwadaha kwikala hano mwe isi yetu, namtende mwenenwa mwe isi ino. Namwikale muno mkadamnya mayombe nakutenda wagoli.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Vikaheza Shekemu amgamba tati yakwe Dina na wakuluze, “Niwonelani mbazi, naniwenkeni ivyo namunge, <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />nigambilani chochose namunge mwe mali na jeleko, hata hegu chikulisa miye nanilavye mladi ni msole.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Ivyo, wana wa Yakobo niyo wamhitula Shekemu na ise Hamoli kwa udanti, kwaviya Shekemu nakamgonya lumbu dyawo Dina. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Wawagamba, “Hachikudaha kudamaya mbuli sa iyo, hachikudaha kumlekela lumbu dyetu asolwe ni mntu hejeligwe ngasu, navichijele soni. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Nachivane na nyuwe mwe vino kugamba namtende uge suwe kwa kuwajela ngasu wagosi wenyu wose. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Aho naho nachiwaloze wandele wetu na kuwasola wandele wenyu. Nachikale hamwenga na kutenda wamwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Mna uneva hamnevane na suwe na kujelwa ngasu, ivyo suwe nachimguhe mndele ywetu nakwita zetu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Amalagano yano yatenda yamwelela Hamoli na mwanawe Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Mbwanga uyo halemele yadya yalongigwe, kwaviya nakamungisisa mndele ywa Yakobo. Shekemu nani mntu atunyigwe mwe nyumbawo.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Hamoli na mwanawe Shekemu waita hantu ho kudugana he nchili yo mzi nakutamwila na wantu wo mzi, <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“Wantu wano ni wambuya wetu, walekeni wekale mwe isi yetu na kudamanya mayombe mndani mwakwe, isi ni nkulu naho yachichinta suwe na wowo. Chikajika suwe nachisole wandele wawo nawo nawasole wandele wetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Mna wano wantu nawazumila kwikala nasuwe hamwenga kwa mwiko uno, kugamba na chiwajele ngasu wagosi mgati mwetu saviya wowo wajeligwe ngasu. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Togola, hamkwona kugamba uludimo lwawo no ugoli wawo wose nautende ugoli wetu chose? Handikoni, chivaneni nawo chani wekale hamwenga na suwe.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Wagosi woseni wadugane henchili yo mzi uwo wevana na Hamoli na mwanawe Shekemu. Vikaheza wagosi wose niyo wajelwa ngasu.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Mazuwa matatu yeze yomboke, umo wadya wajeligwe ngasu wachei na masulumizo ya tendese, wana waidi wa Yakobo, Simoni na Lawi, wakuluze dya Dina, waguha amabamba yawo, wawebunga umzi na kuwakoma awagosi wose. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Wawakoma kwa bamba Hamoli na mwanawe Shekemu, niyo wamusa Dina kulaila mwekaya ya Shekemu na kuhalawa. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Eze wabinde kuwakoma, wana watuhu wa Yakobo niyo wengila na kuuguha umzi uwo kwaviya lumbu dyawo nakajelwa uzavu. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Waguha ngoto na mbuzi na ng'ombe na mpunda na vyoseni vyendile momzi hegu mwe zinkonde. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Wataha ugoli wose wana na wavyele wose, na kuguha chila chintu mwe zinyumba.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Ivyo, Yakobo awagamba Simoni na Lawi, “Nyuwe mnigaila nkunto, kwakunitende nihiwe na wekazi weisi ino ya Wakanani na Wapelesi. Suwe chiwajeche hegu wanachintana nakunebunga nawanibalange miye nolukolo lwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Mna wadya wambwanga waidi niyo wahitula, “Hachikudaha kumlekela lumbu dyetu atendwe enga mchilanga.”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Chohile amjimbika Yakobo uko Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Chohile amgambila Yakobo, “Hita Beseli haluse, na ukekale uko. Umbika mayuwe na kutenda nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko uko, miye Chohile nikulaile hadya nendile ukamsumka mkuluwo Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Ivyo, Yakobo awagamba welekwa wakwe na wose wendile wehamwenga naye, “Usani hale matukulu ye chi chohile ye chijeni ye mgati mwenyu, hakani na kuvala suche ntana. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Ukajika soni chite Beseli kudya hunga hamzengele Chohile nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko anambizaga zuwa dya nkuto yangu, naho endaga na miye hohose nitile.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Ivyo, wamwinka Yakobo matukulu ye chijeni yechichohile yadya wendile wananayo hamwenga na heleni wavaile mwamagutwi. Yakobo niyo kavisimbila mwe sina dya mti ukwitangwa mwaloni wendile wihaguhi na Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Umo Yakobo hamwenga nawanawe wakakonga kutamba, nkama nkulu iwengila wantu wendile mwe mizi yose iwazunguluke, ivyo hahana awatongele. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Yakobo na wantu wakwe wose nananawo wabula Luzu kugamba Beseli, mwe isi ya kanani. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Kaumbika mayuwe na kutenda nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko uko na kuhetanga hantu aho Chohile ywa Beseli, kwaviya Chohile kamlaila mwenye aho umo akamsumka mkuluwe. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Chipindi icho Debola mwambizi ywa chivyele ywa Lebeka, kabanika niyo ahambwa hasi ho mti wa mwaloni wihasi ha Beseli. Niyo hetangwa Aloni bakusi kugamba “Mti wa ndilo.”<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Umo Yakobo eze auye kulaila Padan alamu, Chohile kamlaila vituhu na kumjimbika. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Chohile amgamba, “Zina dyako ni Yakobo, mna kukongela haluse hawitangwe vituhu Yakobo, mna haluse zina dyako naditende Izulaeli.” <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Naho Chohile amgamba, “Miye nuyo Chohile mta nguvu zose. Utende na welekwa walozize. Kwako weye nakulaile wantu walozize na maseuta nawalaile mo welekwa wako. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Nahwinke isi idya ya Ibulahimu na Isaka naho nahwinke weye no lweleko lwako.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Eze alosane na Yakobo Chohile niyo amleka ahalawa. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Hantu hadya Chohile alosane naye, Yakobo kachimalisa yuwe dya lukumbusa wa kuditenda ditende dya Chohile na kudijidila ntambiko ya divai na mavuta. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Yakobo ahetanga hantu aho alosane na Chohile Beseli.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubanika kwa Laheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Yakobo na welekwa wakwe wajendeleza nentambo walaila Beseli. Weze watende hawanati kubula Efulata, Laheli katozwa nusungu mkulu wa kwefungula. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Naye eze engilwe nusungu mkulu, mwelesi amgamba, “Usekogoha, Laheli, kuna mwana chigosi mtuhu.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Mna kuno Laheli akatenda ehaguhi na kubanika, kefungula mwana na kumwitanga Benoni kugamba, “Mwana we chinyulu changu.” Mna ise amwitanga Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Ivyo, Laheli niyo abanika mwe sila ikwita Efulata kugamba Beselehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakobo niyo achimalisa myuwe wa lukumbusa mlanga mwe mbila ya Laheli idya iyaho kubula vino dyelo. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Izulaeli kajendeleza ne ntambo yakwe na kwika ntulwe yakwe akaheza kujinka umnala wa Edeli.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Umo Izulaeli endile akekala mwe isi iyo, Lubeni kagona na Biliha chilaga cha ise, Izulaeli niyo eva izimbuli izo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobo na anawana wachigosi mlongo na waidi. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Wana wa Leya wendaga ni Lubeni mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa Yakobo, Simoni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakaliya na Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Wana Laheli wendaga Yusufu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Wana welekwe ni Biliha mwambizi ywa chivyele ywa Laheli wendaga Dani na Nafutali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Wana wa Zilipa mndima ywa Leya wendaga ni Gadi na Asheli. Wano nawo wana wa Yakobo elekaga akatenda uko Padani Alamu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yakobo niyo auya kaya kwa tati yakwe Isaka uko Mamle na haguhi Kiliasi aliba kugamba Hebuloni, kudya Ibulahimu na Isaka wendaga wakekala. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Isaka endaga na mihilimo gana na milongo mnane, <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />akajika Isaka abanikaga akatenda mdalahala na wanawe Esau na Yakobo wamhamba.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Wano ni welekwa wa Esau, iviya etagwa Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esau asolaga wavyele wa Kanani, Ada mndele mwana ywa Eloni Mhiti na Oholibama mndele ywa Anahi mwana ywa Sibioni Mhivi, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />na Basemati, mndele ywa Isumaili lumbudye dya Nebayoti. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada amwelekelaga Esau Elifazi na Basemati amwelekelaga Leueli, <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />na Oholibama amwelekelaga Yeushi Yalamu na Kola. Wose wano wana elekelagwa Esau umo akekala mwe isi ya Kanani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Akaheza Esau aguha wakazize, wanakwe wechigosi na wachiche na wantu wose wa mwenyumbakwe, ngombe zakwe, na wanyama wakwe wose na ugoli wose asumile mwe isi ya Kanani, kasamila hantu hatuhu hale na mlukolo ywakwe Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Kasama kwaviya ugoli wawo naulozesa wadunduga kwikala hamwenga. Isi nawakekala enga wajeni yendaga ndodo haikuwachinta kwa ulozo wa wanyama wawo. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Ivyo, Esau ekalaga mwe isi ya magulu ya Seili. Zina tuhu dya Esau ni Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Wano ni welekwa wa Esau, ise dya Waedomu mwe isi ya magulu ya Seili. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Yano ni mazina ya wana wa Esau, Elifazi mwana ywa Esau elekwe ni maziwe Ada na Leueli elekwe ni Basimati mkaziwe umtuhu. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Wana wa Elifazi wendaga Temani na Omali na Sefo na Gatamu na Kenazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Elifazi endaga na mndima zina dyakwe Timina. Yuno amwelekelaga mwana, zina dyakwe Amaleki. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Basemati mkaza Esau, kamweleka Laueli. Wana Leueli wendaga Nahasi na Zela na Shama na Miza. <verse eid="GEN 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Oholibama, mdele ywa Anahi, mndele ywa Sibeoni, amwelekelaga Esau mgosiwe wana watatu, Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Wano wakutimila wendaga wakulu wa makabila yalawane na Esau. Elifazi mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa Esau awelekaga Temani na Omali na Sefo na Kenazi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Kola na Gatamu na Amaleki, chila yumwenga ywawo akatenda mkulu ywa kabila dyakwe. Awo wose ni wana chilume wa Elifazi mwe isi ya Edomu, walawane na Ada, mkaza Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Leueli mwana ywa Esau, awelekaga Nahati na Zela na Shama na Miza, chila yumwe ywawo endaga mkulu ywa kabila dyakwe. Awo wose ni wana wa Laueli mwe isi ya Edomu, walawane na Basemati mkaza Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Wana Oholibama mkaza Esau, wendaga Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola, chila yumwe ywawo endaga mkulu ywa kabila dyakwe. Awo wose ni wa Oholibama mndele ywa Anahi, mkaza Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Awo nawo welekwa wa Esau kugamba Edomu, chila yumwenga ywawo endaga mkulu ywa kabila dyakwe.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa Seili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Wano wakutila ni welekwa wa Seili mntu ywa Holi naho nawo wakaya we isi iyo, Lotanina na Shobali na Sibeoni na Anahi, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />na Dishoni na Eseli na Dishani, chila yumwenga ywawo endaga mkulu ywa kabila dyakwe mgati mwa Waholi wo lukolo lwa Seili mwe isi ya Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Wana chilume wa Lotani wendaga Holi na Hemani, lumbudye Lotani naketangwa Timina.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Wana chilume wa Shobali wendaga Alivani na Manahati na Ebali na Shefo na Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Wana chilume wa Sibeoni wendaga Aya na Anahi. Anahi nuyo abunkulaga sokwe za mazi ye moto kwedijangwa, umo endaga akadima izimpunda za ise Sibeoni. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Wana wa Anahi wendaga Dishoni na mchiche yumwenga zina dyakwe Oholibama. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Wana chilume wa Dishoni wendaga Hemdani na Eshibani na Itulani na Kelani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Wana chilume wa Eseli wendaga Bilihani Zawani na Akani.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Wana chilume wa Dishani wendaga Usi na Alani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Ivyo, awo nawo wakulu wa Waholi, Lotani na Shobali na Sibeoni na Anahi, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />na Dishoni na Eseli na Dishani, chila yumwenga ywawo endaga mkulu ywa kabila dyakwe mwe isi ya Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maseuta we isi ya Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Wano wakutimila ni maseuta walongoze mwe isi ya Edomu, hekunati seuta yoyose kuwalongoza Waizulaeli. <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela mwana ywa Beoli alongozaga isi ya Edomu akatenda wikazi wakwe mkulu mo mzi wa Dinihaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela eze abanike, Yobabu mwana ywa Zela alaile Bosila alongoza hantu hakwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobabu eze abanike, Hushamu we isi ya Watemani, alongoza hantu hakwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Hushamu eze abanike Hadadi mwana ywa Bedadi alongoza hantu hakwe, wikazi wakwe mkulu wendaga mo mzi wa Aviti. Yuno nuyo awatoile na kuwahuda Wamidiyani mwe isi ya Moabu. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadadi eze abanike, Samula kulaila Masileka alongoza hantu hakwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samula eze abanike, Shauli alaile Lehoboti, wihaguhi no mto wa Eufulate, alongoza hantu hakwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Shauli eze abanike, Bali Hanani, mwana ywa Akiboli, alongoza hanu hakwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Bali Hanani, mwana ywa Akiboli eze abanike, Hadali alongoza hantuhakwe, zina dyo mzi wakwe dyendaga Pau. Mkaza Akaboli endaga Mehetabeli, mndele ywa Matuledi mwezukulu ywa Mezahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Wakulu wa makabila yalawane na Esau, kuligana na makabila yawo ivyo yeli no wikazi wawo wendaga, Timuna na Aliva na Yeteti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />na Oholibama na Ela na Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />na Kenazi na Temani na Mibusali, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />na Magidieli na Ilamu. Awo nawo wakulu wa makabila yalawane na Edomu, kugamba Esau, ise yda Edomu, watajwa kuligana na wikazi wawo mwe ntendele ye izisi nawakalongoza.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu na Wakuluze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakobo niyo ajendeleza kwikala mwe isi ya Kanani, umo ekalaga ise enga mjeni. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Zino ni mbuli za ukolo lwa Yakobo. Yusufu, embwanga mdodo mta mihilimo mlongo umwe na mfungate, nendile akadima ngoto na mbuzi hamwenga na wakuluze, wana chigosi wa Biliha na Zilipa, wakaza ise. Yusufu nakamwigaila mbuli zihiye ise zendile zikadamanywa ni wakuluze.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Izulaeli nakamungisa Yusufu kujinka wanawe wose, kwaviya elekagwa mo untu ujima wakwe. Nakamsumila Yusufu nkazu ntana ihambigwe. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Mna wakuluze weze wawone kugamba tati yawo amungisa Yusufu kujinka wowo, wamwihiwa mlukolo ywawo vilekile hawatamwile naye vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Chilo chimwenga, Yusufu kalota sozi, mna eze awatamwile wakuluze isozi iyo, wowo niyo wajendeleza kumwihiwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Awagamba, “Tegelezani isozi nilotile. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Silota suwe chose na chikwenkonde chika chisanya machisa ya uhemba chipumpa chisa dyangu niyo dya chimala chululu. Machisa yenyu yaika mkungo yenamila idichisa dyangu.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Walukolo wakwe wamuza, “Togola, waunga uchigambile kugamba nochilongoze?” Hegu notende sekulu ywetu elo, niyo wajendeleza kumwihiwa kwachausa cha sozi na milosi yakwe.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Akaheza Yusufu niyo alota sozi ntuhu. Nakuwagambila walukolo wakwe akagamba, “Tegelezani, silota sozi ntuhu, siwona zuwa, mnenge na ntondo mlongo na imwenga vyaninamila.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Mna eze amtamwile ise na walukolo wakwe isozi iyo, ise niyo amfankila, “Nisozi yani iyo ulotile? Togola, nechunge miye, mami yako na walukolo wako weze kukwinamila hasi kwa ntunyo?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Wakuluze dya Yusufu wamdila finju, mna tati yakwe niyo atenda achekufanyanya imbuli iyo.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu atagwa ni wakuluze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Zuwa dimwenga, wakuluze dya Yusufu waita kwekudima ludimo lwa tati yawo haguhi na Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Yakobo amgamba Yusufu, “Kuvimanya kumgamba wakuluzo wadima imifugo kudya Shekemu. Elo, nanga husigile kwawo kudya wakudimila.” Yusufu amhitula, “Haya tate.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Ise amgamba, “Hita ukawakaule wakuluzo noludimo hegu wevyedi, ukaheza wize unigambile.” Ivyo, Yakobo amsigila Yusufu kulaila mwedikolongo dya Hebuloni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Yusufu eze abule haguhi na Shekemu, <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />abwilwa ni mntu yumwenga angadika mo luwala, amuza, “Walondani?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yusufu amhitula, “Nawalonda walukolo wangu. Hampu, nigambila uko wakudimila.”<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Yudya mntu amgamba, “Vyadahika wahalawa kale, kwaviya nasiweva wakagamba, Chiteni Dosani.” Ivyo, Yusufu niyo awatimila walukolo wakwe niyo awabwila uko Dosani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Walukolo wakwe weze wamwone kwa luhale henati kuwabwila haguhi, niyo wevana wamkome. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Wagambana, “Kaulani! Yudya mlota sozi eza. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Sunguzani, chimkomeni na chimjele mwe sima dinyaile. Chikaheza chigambe kugamba kakomwa ni kala dya kumbago. Chikaheza chikaule izisozi zakwe nazitende vivihi.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Mna Lubeni eze eve milosi iyo, aunga amkombole Yusufu mwe mikono yawo. Awagamba walukolo wakwe “Hampu, chisekumkoma. <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Msekwitila sakame, mjeleni mwedisima dino hano holuwala, mna msekumlumiza.” Nakalonga ivyo chani amkombole Yusufu mwemikono yawo, nyumani amvuze kwa ise. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Yusufu eze awabwile wakuluze, wamvula chinguvu inkazu yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Wakaheza wamgwila na kumdula mwedisima. Mna idisima idyo nendile dinyala.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Weze wekale hokudya, weze wenule meso wawona welekwa wa Washimaeli watamba walaila Gileadi waita Misili. Ngamiya zawo nazinula mizigo ya ubani na zeli na manemane. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Aho Yuda awagamba walukolo wakwe, “Nachipate chibwani uneva chinamkoma mlukolo ywetu na kufisa ndilo yakwe? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Ni vyedi chimtage kwa wano welekwa wa Washimaeli, mna chisekumtenda dyodyose, kwaviya ni mlukolo ywetu, sakame imwe na suwe.” Wakuluze niyo wazumila. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Ahadya wata mayombe welekwa wa Ishumaeli weze wabule hantu aho, awo walukolo wakwe wamlavya Yusufu mwedisima, wamtaga Waishumaeli wakwitangwa Wamidiani kwa yombe dya vihande milongo midi vya hela, nawo wamguha Yusufu waitanaye Misili.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Ivyo, Lubeni eze auye kwedisima, hambwile vituhu Yusufu, niyo atatula suche zakwe kwa chinyulu. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Awabasa walukolo wakwe, awagamba, “Yudya mbwanga hakuli kudya! Nanitende vivihi?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Ivyo, niyo wachinja mbuzi waguha inkazu ya Yusufu nakuitweza mwe sakame ye mbuzi. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Wakaheza wamwigaila tati yawo idya inkazu, wamgamba, “Chilogota inkazu ino. Hake ikaule yenga ya mwanawo hegu siyoiyo.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Tati yawo niyo ebunkula inkazu iyo, agamba, “Heye nino! Chindedi kala dya kumbago dimkoma na kumdya. Chindedi Yusufu mwanangu katatulwa vihande hande.” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Aho Yakobo niyo atatula suhe zakwe kwa chinyulu, avala suche ya juniya mwe chigudi. Amwila mwanawe kwa chipindi cha mazuwa yalozize. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Wanawe wose wachigosi na wechivyele wambasa chani wamhoze, kalemela kuhozwa, akagamba, “Nilekani, na nijendeleze kulomboleza kwachausa cha mwanangu, vibule hadya nawanihambwe.” Nivyo ise amwilile Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Chipindi icho, kudya Misili, wadya Wamidiani wamtaga Yusufu kwa mntu akwitangwa Potifa, yumwenga ywa wandima wakulu ywa Falao, uyo endaga sekulu ywa bunga dya wankondo.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Yuda na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Chipindi icho, Yuda nakasentana na walukolo wakwe, niyo aita kwikala na mntu yumwenga ywa mzi wa Adulami, zina dyakwe Hila. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Umo akatenda uko, Yuda niyo amwona mndele akwitangwa Shuwa, Mkanani niyo amsola. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Mndele wa Shuwa atanda msoka efungula mwana chilume. Yuda amwitanga Eli. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Atenda msoka vituhu, efungula mwana chilume, amwitanga Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Akaheza efungula mwana mtuhu ywa chilume, amwitanga Shela. Umo Shela akelekwa, Yuda endaga akekala Kezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Nyumani Yuda amloza mwanawe ywa nkongo Eli, kwa mvyele akwitangwa Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Mna Eli, mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa Yuda, endaga mbanasi kulongozi kwa Zumbe, ivyo Zumbe niyo amkoma. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Ivyo, Yuda amgamba Onani, “Mguhe mkaza mlukolo ywako mtokwaga, kwaviya nivyo vikungwa udamanye, vinatende umwelekele wana mlukolo ywako.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Mna Onani nakamanya kugamba wana awo hawatende wakwe. Ivyo, eze agone na mkaza mlukolo ywakwe niyo etila hasi mbeyu ze cheleko, anase kumwelekela mlukolo ywakwe wana. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Imbuli iyo imwihiza Zumbe, amkoma Onani naye. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Aho Yuda amgamba Tamali, mkamwanawe, “Uya kukaya kwa iso, usigale mvyele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe kubula mwanangu Shela aho natende mntu mjima.” Yuda nana nkama kugamba Shela naye nabanike saviya walukolo wakwe. Ivyo, Tamali niyo auya kukaya kwa ise.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Chize chijinke chipindi chitali mndele ywa Shuwa, mkaza Yuda abanika. Yuda eze abinde indilo niyo ahalawa na mbuyaye Hila waita Timna kwekumonya mazoya yezingoto zakwe. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Mntu yumwenga niyo amgambila Tamali kugamba mkwewe emwesila kwita Timna kumonya mazoya yezingoto zakwe, <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />niyo avula suche zakwe zo uvyele wa kubanikilwa ni mgosi egubika ushungi akaheza akwikala he nchili yo kwingila Enaimu, kamzi kendile mwe sila ikwita Timna. Adamanyaga ivyo kwaviya awonaga kugamba Shela katenda kale mntu mjima, mna yeye Tamali hawozigwe atende mkaziwe. <verse eid="GEN 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Ivyo, Yuda eze ambwile Tamali aho, nakamfanyanya kugamba ni mvyele mchilanga, kwaviya egubike ko uso.<verse eid="GEN 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Aho, hemanyize kugamba uyo ni mkamwanawe, kambasa hadya hankanda hesila, amgamba, “Naunga ni gone na weye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Tamali amuza, “Ninazumila noninke mbwani?” <verse eid="GEN 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Yuda amhitula, “Nahwinke mwana mbuzi mwe difyo dyangu.” Tamali amgamba, “Ika ukombo kulagisa kugamba naunigaile uyo mwana mbuzi.”<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yuda amuza, “Waunga hwinke chibwani chitende ukombo?” Niyo amhitula, “Ninka iyo impete no luzigi lwakwe hamwenga naiyo inkome utozize.” Yuda niyo amwinka ivintu vyose ivyo, agona naye. Tamali niyo atenda msoka. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Tamali niyo auya kukaya avula udya ushungi egubike, avala vituhu suche zakwe zo kubanikilwa ni mgosiwe.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Umo Yuda eze amsigile mbuyaye, Mwadulami, amwigaile yudya mvyele mwana mbuzi chani avuzizwe ukombo amwasize, mna Hila hamwone. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Hila niyo awauza wakaya wa Enaimu, “Ekuhi yudya mvyele mchilanga endaga mnkanda mwe sila haguhi na hano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Wamhitula, “Hano hahendaga na mvyele mchilanga.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Ivyo, uyo mbuyaye niyo auya kwa Yuda, amgamba, “Simwone! Naho wakaya wa uko wanigambila kugamba hahatendaga na mvyele mchilanga yoyose uko.”<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yuda agamba, “Mleke aguhe ivintu ivyo, vinase kuleka chikasekwa. Weye mwenye kuwona kugamba nasimwigaila mwana mbuzi, mna weye humwone.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Eze yomboke miezi mitatu, Yuda niyo eva mbuli, “Tamali, mkamwanawo katenda mchilanga, naho ni msoka kwa uchilanga wakwe.” Ivyo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yuda asigila, “Mlavyeni kuse okigwe moto abanike!”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Umo wakamlavya kuse, Tamali niyo asigila kwa ise vyala, akagamba, “Mwenye vino ivintu nuyo aninkile inda. Kwaivyo, nakulombeza umbunkule mwenye impete ino no luzigi lwakwe ne nkome ino.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yuda kavibunkula ivintu ivyo, agamba, “Tamali ni mchindedi kujinka miye. Ni chindedi, kwaviya simlozize kwa mwanangu Shela.” Kukongela zuwa idyo Yuda hagonile vituhu na Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Chipindi cha Tamali cho kwefungula chize chibule, vyabunkuka kugamba ni msoka ywa mapacha. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Ivyo, eze emukwe nusungu wo kwefungula yumwe ywa mapacha niyo alavya umkono kuse, umkunga niyo aufunga luzigi lwinkundu akagamba, “Yuno nuyo alongole kwelekwa.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Mna uyo mwana eze auvuze umkono wakwe kundani, mlukolo ywakwe niyo akonga kwelekwa. Mkunga agamba, “Nimbwani weye ukakumpuka?” Ivyo niyo etangwa Pelesi. Kugamba, “Kukulumpuka.” <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Nyumani nivyo elekwa mlukolo ywakwe akatenda naludya luzigi lwinkundu mo mkono, naye niyo enkigwa zina dya Zela. Nikugamba “Ung'azi winkundu kukatandazuka.”<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu na mkaza Potifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Ivyo, Yusufu eze aguhigwe kwigalwa Misili, Mmisili yumwenga naketangwa Potifa uyo endaga seuta ywa wandima wa Falao naho nuyo sekulu ywa bunga dya wamizi, amgula kwa Washimaeli wamletile kulaila Misili. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Zumbe endaga hamwenga na Yusufu, niyo amdahiza kudamanya chila chintu vyedi. Yusufu niyo atenda ekala mwe nyumba ya seuta ywakwe, Mmisili. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Uyo sekulu ywakwe kabunkula kugamba Zumbe nehamwenga na Yusufu na kugamba nuyo amjimbike mwe mbuli zose adamanye Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Ivyo, Yusufu nakaungiswa ni Potifa, vileka atenda nuyo mndima ywakwe mwenye, kamtenda mchimaila ywe nyumbakwe na msinya ugoli wakwe wose. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Kukongela mwe chipindi Potifa amtendile Yusufu mchimaila ywe nyumbakwe na mchimaila ugoli wakwe. Zumbe kaijmbika inyumba ya uyo Mmisili kwachausa cha Yusufu. Ujimbiko wa Zumbe niyo watenda mlanga mwa chila chiya nananacho, mnyumba na kwenkonde. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Kwachausa icho Potifa kamwinka ukulu Yusufu wa uchimaila wa chila chintu ananacho, Yusufu eze atende mo ulongozi, Potifa nahena luhosa lwa kudamanya chintu chochose ukaleka nkande yakwe nakadya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yusufu endaga mbwanga mtana na awagizwe. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Eze chomboke chipindi chisiku, mkaza Potifa niyo ammeila mate Yusufu na kumgamba, “Gona na miye.” <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Mna Yusufu alemela na kumgamba yudya mvyele ywa sekulu ywakwe, “Ng'o! Sekulu ywangu kaninka ukulu mlanga mwe chila chintu hano henyumba, na kwaviya nihano, hakudamanya mbuli yoyose vituhu. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Hano hanyumba hana ukulu wowose Kujinka miye. Uyo hanilemeze kutoza chochose ukaleka weye du kwaviya weye wimkaziwe. Vyatenda vivihi naho nidamanye wavu wihiye sauwo, nakukola masa kwa Chohile.?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Uyo mvyele niyo ajendeleza kumhembeleza Yusufu chila kukacha, mna Yusufu hamwetegeleze naho hamzumile kugona naye ng'o.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Zuwa dimwenga, Yusufu kengila kunyumba adamanye ndima yakwe saviya mazwela, na wadamanya ndima watuhu wendaga hewehali hanyumba. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Ivyo, mkaza Potifa kamtoza isuche na kumgamba, “Gona na miye!” Mna Yusufu kamwasiza isuche yakwe mwemikono yakwe, kagulukila kuse. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Aho, yudya mvyele eze awone kugamba Yusufu kasa inkazu yakwe mwemikono yakwe na kugulukila kuse, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />niyo awetanga wandima wamnyumba mwakwe na kuwagamba, “Kaulani! Yuno Mwebulaniya chigailwe achijela soni. Keza kwangu nakonga anigonye chinguvu, mna niyo naguta lukunga. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Eze anive naguta lukunga, niyo asa isuche yakwe, agulukila kuse!”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Ivyo, yudya mvyele niyo aika idya isuche amgoja mgosiwe auye kunyumba. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Kamgambila ulosi uwo akagamba, “Yuno mndima Mwebulaniya umletile kwetu nakeza kunikakalisa chinguvu chani anijele soni. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Mna aho nize nigute lukunga, kanasiza isuche yakwe na kugulukila kuse.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Ivyo, Potifa eze eve izimbuli za mkaziwe, kugamba nivyo mndima ywakwe adamanye, emukwa ni maya. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Kamguha Yusufu na kumwingiza mwe dijeleza, hantu hafungigwe wandima wabanasi wa seuta. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Mna hata umo mwedijeleza Zumbe nehamwenga na Yusufu akamdahiza na kumtenda awagile mwameso ya mkulu ywe dijeleza. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Ivyo mkulu ywe dijeleza niyo amtenda Yusufu atende mkulu ywa wafungwa wose wafungigwe mwedi jeleza, chila chikutendeka umo chitendeka kwa ulongozi wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Uyo mkulu ywe dijeleza hadamanye chintu chituhu chochose enkigwe Yusufu kwaviya Zumbe nehamwenga na Yusufu na kumtendela chila chintu adamanye.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu afyambula sozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Chipindi chisiku yeze yomboke ayo, wandima wakulu waidi wa seuta ywa Misili wamtendela wavu seuta. Wakulu awo wendaga mkulu ywa vyakunywa na mkulu ywa woka migate wa seuta. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Falao nakawaihiwa wakulu wakwe awo waidi, <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />niyo awavugaila mwedijeleza dya mkulu ywa bunga dya wamizi hantu avugailwe Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Mkulu ywa bunga kamsagula Yusufu wakatenda we mwe chifungo kwa chipindi chisiku.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Ivyo, zuwa dimwenga nechilo, yudya mdima mkulu ywa vyakunywa na yudya mdima mkulu ywa mwoka migate ywa seuta ywa Misili, walotaga sozi umo mwedijeleza, chila yumwenga na sozi yakwe yesimile. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Nomtondo Yusufu eze aite kwawo kuwakaula, kawabwila wose waidi wasusuhala.<verse eid="GEN 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Ivyo, Yusufu niyo awauza wakulu awo wa Falao wendaga mwechifungo hamwenga naye mwe nyumba ya sekulu ywakwe, “Vita vivihi dyelo msusuhala mwameso yenyu?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Wamhitula, “Chisusuhala kwaviya chilota sozi mna hahali akudaha kuchifyambuila izisozi zetu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">“Togolani, kufyambula sozi siyo ndima ya Chohile? Hake, nigambilani izisozi zenyu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Mndima mkulu ywa vyakunywa wa seuta kamtamwila isozi yakwe, akagamba, “Mwe sozi yangu siwona mzabibu kulongozi kwangu, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />nawo nauna vikocha vitatu. Aho wize ukonge kusuka mani, maluwa yakwe yabwalika na vikocha vyakwe yatenda zabibu ziviye. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Momkono wangu nendaga na chikombe cha Falao, ivyo, naguha zabibu, nazifumbula mwe chikombe icho, namwinka Falao.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yusufu amgambila uyo mndima, “Fyambulo dye sozi yako ni dino, viya vikocha vitatu ni mazuwa matatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Yakajinka mazuwa matatu Falao nakulavye kulaila mwedijeleza na kukuvuza vituhu mwo ukulu wako. Naudahe vituhu kumwinka Falao chikombe mo mkono saviya wendile ukatenda aho nkongo. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Mna hampu unasekunijala umo mbuli zikakujendela vyedi, unidamanyize wedi nilonga mwa meso ya Falao, nidahe kufosa muno mwedijeleza. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Kwaviya miye nasisumswa kulaila si ya Waebulaniya, hano Misili sinati kutenda chochose chikuleka hajelwa mwedijeleza.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Yudya mwoka migate mkulu eze awone kugamba fyambulo diya ni dyedi, amgamba Yusufu, “Hata miye silota sozi! Mwe sozi yangu nasinula nyungo ntatu za migate komtwi. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Mo lungo lwa kulanga, nendile kuna nkande zesimile zokigwe kwachausa cha Falao. Mna wadege nawakazidya kulaila mo lungo lwi momtwi wangu!”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yusufu amhitula, “Fyambulo dye sozi yako ni dino, ziya nyungo ntatu ni mazuwa matatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Yakajinka mazuwa matatu Falao nakulavye kulaila mwedijeleza, nenule umtwi wako akunyulike mwe mti, wadege nawadye umwili wako.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Mwe zuwa dya katatu, dyendaga zuwa dya chinyemi cha kwelekwa kwakwe, Falao kawadamanyiza ngasu wakulu wa wandima wakwe wose. Kawalavya mwedijeleza mndima mkulu ywa kunywa na mwoka migate mkulu, awaika holumpe ha wakulu wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Akaheza amvuziza ukulu wakwe wo kudima vyokunywa, amwinkwe Falao chikombe. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Mna yudya mwoka migate mkulu kamkanta isingo na kulungika umwili wakwe saviya Yusufu afyambule izisozi zawo. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Mna yudya mdima ywa vya kunywa, niyo amjala Yusufu hantu hakumkumbuka.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu Afyambula sozi ya Falao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Eze ijinke mihilimo midi, Falao niyo alota sozi. Kebwila kachimala mnkanda mo mto Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />awona ng'ombe mfungate zedi zitunkane zikalaila mo mto zadya mani. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Vikaheza, ng'ombe ntuhu mfungate zinyalise zalaila mo mto Naili, zeza na kuchimala haguhi na ziya ng'ombe zedi zitunkane, mnkanda mo mto. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Ziya ng'ombe zinyalise zadya ziya izintuhu mfungate zedi na zitunkane. Aho Falao niyo enuka mwe zintongo. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Eze agone vituhu, alota nkanana ya kaidi. Kawona maiso mfungate yo uhemba makulu yedi yasuka mwe kongoti dimwenga. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Vikaheza, maiso matuhu mfungate masisili na yanyazigwe ni mpeho ya kwedijangwa yalaila, <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />maiso mfungate masisili ya nyaile yayamela yadya maiso mfungate makulu yamemile mpuluzi. Ivyo Falao eze enuke abunkula kugamba ni sozi. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Eze kuche, Falao niyo asusulahala vitendese, kawetanga wasai wose wa Misili, na wabala, awagambila izisozi zakwe, mna hahali hata yumwenga adahile kufyambula sozi izo.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Naho, yudya mndima mkulu ywa vyakunywa akumgamba Falao, “Dyelo sikumbuka wihi wangu! <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Hadya wize uchihiwe suwe wandima wako, miye namoka migate mkulu, nakuchivugaila mwe nkambi ya sekulu ywa bunga dya wamizi. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Chilo chimwenga chalotaga sozi, chila yumwenga sozi yakwe yesimile. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Ivyo, mbwanga yumwenga Mwebulaniya, mndima mkulu ywa bunga dya ludimo, nendile ehamwenga na suwe mwe chifungo. Chize chimtamwile izisozi zetu, uyo kadaha kuchifyambwila chila yumwenga ywetu kuligana ne sozi yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Ivyo afyambule nivyo vilaile, miye niyo navuzwa mwe ndima yangu, na yudya moka migate mkulu kakantwa isingo na kutundikwa umwili momti.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Ivyo, Falao kalagisa Yusufu etangwe, naye niyo asunguza kulavigwa mwedijeleza. Eze aheze kuwegula na kusankanya suche zakwe, Yusufu niyo eza kulongozi kwa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Falao amgamba Yusufu, “Miye silota sozi, mna hahana mntu adahile kunifyambwila. Siva kugamba weye ukagambilwa sozi wadaha kuifyambula.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yusufu amhitula Falao, “Sina udahi uwo, mna Chohile na kwinke hitulo diwagile.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Aho Falao amgamba Yusufu, “Nasilota kugamba sichimala mnkanda mo mto Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />niyo nawona ng'ombe mfungate zedi na zitunkane zikalaila mo mto zadya mani. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Izo zitimilwa ni ng'ombe ntuhu mfungate zisokele, sisili naho zinyalise. Miye sinati kuwona ng'ombe seizo mwe isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Ivyo, ng'ombe ziya zinyalise zazidya ziya izing'ombe mfungate zitunkane. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Mna hata zize zidye ziya zitunkane, mntu yoyose hadahile kubunkula kugamba zidya ziya izintuhu, kwaviya niviya zinyaile du saviya nkongo. Aho niyo nenuka mwe zintongo. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Haheza niyo nalota sozi ntuhu, siwona maiso mfungate matana yamemile mpuluzi yakasuka mwe buwa dimwenga. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Yakaheza yatimilwa ni maiso matuhu mfungate heyena chintu, masisili yanyazigwe ni mpeho ya kwedijangwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Yadya maiso mfungate masisili yayamela yadya maiso mfungate yedi. Ivyo miye siwagambila wasai sozi izo mna hahali mntu adahile kunifyambwila.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Naho Yusufu amgambile Falao, “Sozi zako zose mbili fyambulo dyakwe ni dimwenga. Chohile kakugubwila mbuli akunga adamanye hano haguhi. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Ng'ombe ziya mfungate zedi ni mihilimo mfungate, yadya maiso mfungate iviya ni mihilimo mfungate. Sozi izo fyambulo dyakwe ni dimwenga. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Ng'ombe ziya mfungate zinyalise, zitimile ziya zitunkane, na yadya maiso mfungate ya nyazigwe ni mpeho ya kwedijangwa, fyambulo dyakwe ni mihilimo mfungate ya gumbo. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Saviya hugambile, weye Falao, Chohile kakugubwila mbuli akunga adamanye ahano haguhi. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Nakutende na mihilimo mfungate ya ulozo utendese mwe isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Mna nyumani na itimile mihilimo mfungate ya gumbo, Iyo nyigusa naijaliswe. Gumbo idyo na diibalange ino isi. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Nyigusa iyo naijaliswe kwaviya gumbo naditimile naditendese. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Sozi yako ivuzagizwa nkanana mbili kwa miliganyo iligane kukulagisa kugamba Chohile nivyo aungile, uyo nalavyanye mbuli iyo ahano haguhi.”<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Ivyo viwagila vino haluse, weye Falao, usagule mntu mta umanyi na ubala, umwinke ndima yakuichimaila isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Naho, weye Falao, uwasagule watakuchimaila wasiku hano heisi, uwalagise wachisanye fungu dya shano dyo ulozo wose wa Misili mwe chipindi chino che mihilimo mfungate yo ulozo. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Uwasigile wata kuchimaila awo wachisanye nkande yose mwe mihilimo mfungate ikwiza yo ulozo. Nkande iyo ikwe heulongozi wako, weye Falao, itende mpamba ya nkande mwe mizi yose, nawo waitunduliye inkande iyo. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Nkande iyo neitende mpamba ya nchinga kwe isi ya Misili inase kubalangwa kulawana ne digumbo dye mihilimo mfungate ikwiza.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu enkigwa ukulu we isi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Ulosi alongile Yusufu uwoneka kugamba ni wedi kulongozi kwa Falao na vilongozi weyawe wose. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Kwaiyo Falao awauza vilongozi weyawe. “Yuno mntu ana Muye wa Chohile! Togolani, chadaha chimpate mntu mtuhu sayuno?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Akaheza amgamba Yusufu, “Kwaviya Chohile kakugubwila yano yose, hahali mntu mtuhu mta ubala na umanyi saweye. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Weye niweye ukunga uchimaile isi yangu, na wantu wangu wose na watende hasi mwe lagiso dyako. Miye du nimiye umkulu kujinka weye kwaviya nekaila chiti cho useuta. <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Ivyo, haluse nakusagula utende mchimaila ywe isi yose ya Misili!” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Naho, Falao avuile impete yakwe yedihula mwedidole dyakwe na kumvisa Yusufu, niyo amvisa suche yedi ya chiseuta na lunyolo lwa zahabu mwe singo. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Falao amkweza Yusufu momutuka wakwe wa kaidi ukukweswa ni falasi na wamizi wamlongwela Yusufu wakenula maizwi na kugamba, “Kwenegeni mchimaila ajinke!” Nivyo, Falao amwinkile Yusufu uchimaila mkulu mlanga mwe isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Kujinka ayo, Falao amgamba Yusufu, “Miye ni miye Falao! Nagamba, mntu yoyose mwe isi yose ya Misili asekudamanya dyodyose hehana lagiso dyako.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Falao kamwinka Yusufu zina dya Chimisili, Safenati paneya. Amloza Asenati mndele ywa Potifela, mlavyantambiko ywa mzi wa Oni. Ivyo, Yusufu niyo akonga kuitalamkila isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Yusufu endaga na mihilimo milongo mitatu eze akonge kumsankanila Falao, seuta ywa Misili. Kalaila mwe nyumba ya Falao na kwitalamkila isi yose ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 41:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Vyatenda, mwe mihilimo idya mfungate yo ulozo, nkonde za Misili zilavya nkande ilozese. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yusufu kachisanya nkande yose mwechipindi icho che mihilimo mfungate yo ulozo na kuika mpamba mo mzi wa Misili. Mwe chila mzi kaika mpamba ya nkande ilaile mwe zinkonde zi haguhi no mzi uwo. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yusufu kaika mpamba ya nkande ilozese niyo yatenda iloza saviya msanga wa bahali, vitendile isekuhimika.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Mihilimo gumbo hedinati kukonga, Yusufu nakaheza kutenda na wana waidi mwa mkaziwe Asenati, mndele ywa Potifela, mlavyantambiko ywa mzi wa Oni. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yusufu niyo amwitanga mwanawe ywa nkongo Manase, akagamba, “Chohile kanijela chijazi nkunto zangu zose na walukolo wa tate.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Niyo amwitanga mwanawe ywa kaidi Efulaimu. Akagamba, “Chohile kaninka wana mwe si ya nkunto zangu.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Mihilimmo idya mfungate yo ulozo mwe isi ya Misili niyo yajinka. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Yakonga mihilimo mfungate ya gumbo saviya Yusufu alongile aho nkongo. Si zose niyo zatenda na gumbo, mna isi yose ya Misili itenda na nkande. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Mwe chipindi icho wanasi wa Misili weze wakonge kuwona idigumbo, wamwila Falao awenke nkande. Falao naye awagamba wa Misili wose, “Hitani kwa Yusufu, idyo nawagambileni mtende, tendani.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Gumbo niyo dyatendesa na kujenyela mwe isi yose, ivyo Yusufu niyo avugwila amagulu yose, awatagila nkande Wamisili. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Kujinka ayo, wantu walaile chila hantu mwe si yose weza Misili kwa Yusufu kugula nkande, kwaviya gumbo naditendesa mwe zisi ntuhu.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Wakuluze dya Yusufu waita Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Yakobo eze agambilwe kugamba kwendaga na nkande uko Misili, awagamba wanawe, “Ni mbwani mwikala mkusinyana du? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Siva kugamba Misili kuna nkande. Hitani uko mkagule nkande chinase kubanika kwa gumbo.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Ivyo walukolo mlongo wa Yusufu waita Misili kwekugula nkande. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Mna Yakobo hamlekile Benjamini, mvunawe dya Yusufu, waitanye kwaviya nakogoha kugamba nakadaha kwakulumizwa.<verse eid="GEN 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Ivyo, wana wa Isilaeli wabula Misili wakatenda mgati mwa waguzi watuhu, iviya mwe isi ya Kanani mwendaga na gumbo. <verse eid="GEN 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Mwe chipindi icho Yusufu endaga nuyo chilongozi mkulu uko Misili. Uyo nuyo endaga akawagilwa kuwatagila wantu wa si zose nkande. Ivyo wakuluze weza na kumwinamila Yusufu kwa ntunyo. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Yusufu eze awone wakuluze niyo awabunkula, mna ketenda enga kugamba hawamanyize, akalonga nawo kwa kufanka. Awauza, “Mlawahi nyuwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Wamhitula, “Chilawa si ya Kanani, chiza kugula nkande.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Hatahegu Yusufu nakawabunkula wakuluze, wowo hawambunkule. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Akumbuka sozi zakwe za kale kuwalanga wakuluze, awagamba, “Nyuwe mwi wazuza, mwiza kuzuza usokezi we isi yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Wowo wa mhitula, “Ng'o, sekulu ywetu. Suwe wandima wako chiza kugula nkande. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Suwe chiwalukolo, tati yetu ni yumwe. Suwe chiwantu wedi, hachi wazuza.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Mna Yusufu alahiliza, “Ng'o! Mwiza kuzuza hantu hehekwamilwa vyedi mwe isi yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Wamgamba, “Suwe, wandima wako, chiwalukolo mlongo umwe na waidi, wana wa mntu yumwenga, mkaya ywa isi ya Kanani. Mvunetu chimwasa na tati ywetu kukaya, na mlukolo ywetu mtuhu abanikaga.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Mna Yusufu awagamba, “Ni saviya nilongile, nyuwe mwi wazuza du. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Vino nivyo namjezwe. Nelisa kwa zina dya Falao, kugamba hamfose hano kubula aho mvunenyu nezile. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Msigileni yumwe ywenyu akamguhe uyo mvunenyu ichiziwanda, chipindi icho watuhu wenyu wamgojeza mwedijeleza. Aho naho ulosi wenyu no umanyike ichindedi chakwe. Uneva sivyo ivyo, nelisa kwa zina dya Falao akafanka kugamba nyuwe mwi wazuza!” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Eze viheze awajela mwedijeleza kwa chipindi cha mazuwa matatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Zuwa dya katatu Yusufu awagamba, “Kwaviya miye ni mtunya Chohile, tendani vino chani mpate kwikala. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Uneva chindedi nyuwe mwi wantu wedi, yumwe ywenyu na asigale mwedijeleza, na watuhu wawegaile inkande walukolo weyawe wasigale wata gumbo. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Mkaheza mnigaile uyo mvunenyu chiziwanda. Ino neibunkule ichindedi cha mbuli zenyu, nyuwe naywi hamkomwe.” Ivyo niyo wazumila kutenda ivyo. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Wakaheza wagambilizana wenye kwa wenye, “Chindedi suwe chimbalanga mlukolo ywetu. Ukaleka kugamba nachimwo ana chinyulu momoyo wakwe, suwe hachimwetegeleze hata hadya achihembeleze. Nivyo vikuleka nkunto ino yose yachilaila.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Lubeni awagamba, “Togolani, miye siwagambileni chisekumlumiza yuno mbwanga? Mna nyuwe hamnetegeleze! Haluse chakantilwa kwachausa cha sakame yakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Wowo hawamanyize kugamba Yusufu nakayamanya yose ayo walongile, kwaviya kalonga nawo kwa sila ya mtapita. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Yusufu aita hankanda, amisamisa mesozi. Eze anyamale, auya na kutamwila nawo. Akaheza yudya mndima amgwila Simeoni na kumjela mpingu kulongozi kwawo.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakuluze dya Yusufu wauya Kanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Yusufu alagisa wandima wakwe wamemeze nkande majuniya yawo, chila yumwenga ywawo avuziwe hela zakwe mo mkwiji wakwe, naho wenkigwe nkande yakudya mweisila. Wadamanyizwa mbuli izo zose. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Niyo walukolo wa Yusufu wazitwisa izimpunda zawo imizigo yawo yezinkande, wahalawa. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Vyatenda weze wabule hantu waika ntulwe wagona uko kwesila, yumwe ywawo avugula mkwiji wakwe chani alise mpunda yakwe, etuka kubwila hela yakwe mo mkwiji wakwe.<verse eid="GEN 42:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Awagamba walukolo wakwe, “Hela yangu ivuzwa. Ino hano mo mkwiji wangu!” Weze weve ivyo, wafa chevu. Wasinyana kuno wazingiza na kuzana, “Ni mbuli yani ino Chohile achidamanye?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Weze wabule mwe isi ya Kanani kwa tati ywawo Yakobo wamtamwila yose ya walaile, wamgambila, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Mkulu ywe isi idya kalonga na suwe kwa kufanka, nakuchidila nkama kugamba suwe chiwazuza mwe isi yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Mna suwe chimgambila kugamba suwe chiwantu wedi, mna hachiwazuza. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Chimgambila kugamba suwe chiwalukolo mlongo umwenga na waidi wa tati ywetu ni yumwenga. Nakugamba yumwe ywetu abanikaga na yudya mvunetu ekaya mwe isi ya Kanani hamwenga na tati yetu. <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Naho mkulu ywe isi iyo akuchigamba, ‘Vino nivyo na vinitende ni bunkule kugamba chindedi nyuwe mwi wantu wedi. Mwaseni mukolo ywenyu yumwenga, nanywi watuhu mwigale nkande kaya kwa walukolo wenyu wata gumbo. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Mkaheza mnigaile uyo mlukolo ywenyu umdodo chiziwanda, aho nanimanye kugamba hamwi wazuza, mwiwedi. Mnatenda ivyo nanimlekele mlukolo ywenyu, nanywi namlekelwe kutaga mayombe mwe isi ino.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Hadya wakakupula uhule wawo kulaila mwamajuniya yawo, wehelwa wawona chila yumwenga ywawo kavuzizwa kakwiji kakwe na hela mndani mo mkwiji wakwe. Weze wawone ayo, wose hamwenga na tati yawo, wengilwa ni nkama. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Tati yawo Yakobo, awagamba, “Mwanihoka wanangu! Yusufu hahali, Simeoni hahali, haluse mwaunga mumguhe Benjamini. Yose ayo yanibwila!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Aho Lubeni amgamba ise, “Sina mvuzize Benjamini, wakome wanangu waidi. Mleke Benjamini mwe mikono yangu, nanimdime na kumvuza kwako.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Mna ise amhitula, “Mwanangu haite na nyuwe, mlukolo lwakwe kabanika kale, uyodu nuyo asigale. Miye sidalahala nina fii uneva yuno mbwanga anabwilwa ni mbuli ihiye mwe ntambo namtambe namnikome kwa chinyulu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Benjamini aita Misili na walukolo wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Gumbo niyo dyatendesa mwe isi ya Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Eze isile idya inkande wagwile kulaila Misili, Yakobo awagamba wanawe, “Hitani naho Misili, mkagule nkande ntuhu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Mna Yuda amgamba ise, “Yudya mntu kachifundisa, akagamba, ‘Saniwahokele uneva hamnezile na mvunenyu chiziwanda.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Uneva unazumila chite hamwenga no mlukolo ywetu, nachite chikakugwile inkande. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Mna hunazumile chitanye, uko hachikwite, kwaviya yudya mntu nakachigambila pwilili, ‘Hamniwone hamnezile na mvunenyu chiziwanda.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Yakobo niyo agamba, “Nimbwani mwanijela mwe nkunto kwa kumgambila uyo mntu kugamba mna mlukolo ywenyu mtuhu?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Wamhitula, “Yudya mntu kachuzisa mbuli zikuchilanga suwe na walukolo wetu akagamba, ‘Togolani, tati yenyu ache mjima? Togolani, mna mlukolo mtuhu?’ Ivyo vileka chimhitula kuligana na viya achuzize. Nachimanya vivihi kugamba nachigambe, ‘Mnigaile mlukolo ywenyu.’?”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Yuda amgamba Izulaeli, tati yakwe, “Leka miye nite naye chani chisunguze chihalawe, chikagule inkande, chinase kukomwa ni gumbo hamwenga naweye na wenetu. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Miye mwenye nanitende mkombo ywakwe. Weye nonitigize miye. Sina mvuzize ukamwona kwa meso yako mwenye, laho naditende na miye mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Hegu hachakawile nachita kudya ulodu na kuya nkanana mbili.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Aho Izulaeli, tati yawo, awagamba, “Nivyedi! Kwa viya nibudi vitende ivyo, tendani vino, guhani mgati mwe mikwiji yenyu mbeyu ntuhu zedi ze isi yetu, mmwigaile majeleko uyo mkulu. Mwigaileni mavuta majeche ya nyonyo na lude chidogo na ubani na manemane na nkungu na nguju. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Mwigaileni hela nkanana mbili ya ziya zikungwa, kwa viya ni budi mvuze hela za idya yaikagwa mwamajuniya yenyu, tankani zavuzagwa kwa kuzaganya. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Mguheni mlukolo ywenyu mwite naye kwa uyo mntu. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Chohile Mta Nguvu nawajimbikeni muwonelwe mbazi kulongozi kwa uyo mntu, awalekeile yudya mlukolo ywenyu mtuhu na Benjamini wauye hamwenga na nyuwe. Kwangu miye, hegu vyaungwa nagilwe ni wanangu navitende ivyo!”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Aho, niyo waguha yadya amajeleko na hela nkanana mbili ya ziya za nkongo, waita Misili hamenga na mlukolo ywawo Benjamini. Eze wabule, waita niyo wachimala kulongozi kwa Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Yusufu eze amwone Benjamini wehamwenga nawo, amgamba mta kuchimaila inyumbakwe, “Wegale wadya wantu kwenyumbangu, uchinje mnyama yumwenga umdamanye vyedi, kwa viya wantu wano nawadye nkande yamsi hamwenga namiye.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Mtokuchimaila uyo niyo etenda saviya asigilwe, awegala wadya wejeni kwenyumba ya Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Weze wawone wegalwa kwenyumba ya Yusufu, wengilwa ni nkama, wagambana wenye, “Chigalwa kuno kwachausa chezi hela chavuzizagwa mwamajuniya yetu hadya chezaga ntambo ya nkongo chani alonde luhosa lwa kuchebunga chipumpa na kuchihoka mpunda zetu na kuchitenda watumwa wakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Kwaiyo niyo wambasa mchimaila inyumba ya Yusufu watamwila naye holwivi, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />wamgamba, “Chiwonele mbazi, sekulu! Suwe chezaga hano nkanana ya nkongo kugula nkande. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Eze chibule hantu niyo chaika ntulwe nakugona uko kweisila, chivugula majuniya yetu, chehelwa chibwila hela ya chila yumwenga ywetu mlanga mwe dijuniya chiyasi chiya chigale hechinati kutozwa. Haluse chivuza izi hela izo. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Chiza na hela ntuhu chigwile nkande. Hachimanyize ni yuhi ajeile izi hela mwamajuniya yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Yudya mta kuchimaila awahitula, “Mse kutenda na nkama, naho msekogoha. Utankani Chohile ywenyu, Chohile ywa tati yenyu, nuyo awavuzizeni izi hela mwamajuniya yenyu. Miye nasihokela hela zenyu.” Vikaheza niyo awegaila Simeoni mlukolo ywawo.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Uyo mta kuchimaila eze awenke mazi ya kuhanka mwe viga vyawo niyo awengize mwenyumba ya Yusufu na kulisa izi mpunda zawo. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Wowo nawo niyo wamalanya majeleko yawo yokumwinka Yusufu, kwachausa chakwiva kugamba nawadye hamwenga naye. <verse eid="GEN 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Yusufu, eze auye kunyumba, wamwigaila yadya majeleko wendile nayo, wamwinamila mitwi yawo hasi kwa kumtunya. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Yusufu niyo awauza mbuli zawo na kugamba, “Namnitamwila mbuli za mdalahala, tati yenyu. Togolani, ni mjima? Achemeso?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Wamhitula, “Mndima ywako, tati yetu, ni mjima naho achemeso.” Wakaheza wamwinamila kwa kumtunya. <verse eid="GEN 43:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Yusufu eze enule ameso yakwe na kumwona Benjamini, mlukolo wyakwe, mwana mami yakwe, agamba, “Yuno nuyo mlukolo ywenyu umdodo mnigambile izimbuli zakwe? Chohile akudamanyize yedi, mwanangu!” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Chipumpa, Yusufu niyo ahalawa ahantu aho, kwaviya mesozi nayakamlenga lenga nkwina zilozize nananazo kwa walukolo wakwe, kengila kwechumba chakwe nakwila. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Eze ahake mazi mouso wakwe, niyo afosa kuno akajijimiza, asigila nkande ikwe. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Yusufu nakekiwa nkande yakwe ichedu, na walukolo wakwe wekiwa hawo, seivyo naho Wamisili wendile wakadya naye, wekiwa hawo, kwaviya havizweleke kwa Wamisili kudya nkande hamwenga na Waebulaniya. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Walukolo wakwe Yusufu na wekala kulongozi kwakwe kuligana na mihilimo yawo, kukongela ywa nkongo kubula ywa nkomelezo, watenda wasinyana kwa kwehelwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Nkande nendile ikaguhigwa kulaila mwemeza ya Yusufu na kwigailwa kwawo, mna Benjamini nakenkigwa nkanana shano kujinka chihimo wenkigwe walukolo wakwe. Ivyo, wanywa na kwelelwa hamwenga na Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Chikombe chawoneka kwa Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Akaheza Yusufu amsigila mchimaila nyumbakwe akagamba, “Memeza nkande mwamajuniya ya wantu wano chihimo wakudaha kwinula. Ukaheza, ika hela ya chila yumwenga ywawo mlanga mwamajuniya yawo. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Mwedijuniya dya yudya umdodo ywawo chiziwanda, chike chiya ichikombe changu che zahabu, hamwenga na hela zakwe.” Uyo mchimaila niyo atenda saviya agambilwe ni Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Eze kuche walagwa wahalawa hamwenga nezimpunda zawo. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Weze watambe ndambo nguhi wakalaila komzi, Yusufu niyo amgamba mtakuchimaila inyumbakwe, “Sunguza! Wabase wadya wantu, ukawabwila, wauze, ‘Nimbwani mkaliha yedi mtendelwe kwa wihi? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Nimbwani mkabawa chiya ichikombe cha sekulu ywangu? Icho mwenye akunywela na kutoila mlamulo? Kwakutenda ivyo mbalangisa!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Yudya mtakuchimaila eze awabwile awagambila ulosi alagizwe ni Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Mna wowo wamuza, “Sekulu, walagisa mbwani kuchigambila ulosi sa uwo? Suwe wandima wako ng'o hachikudaha kudamanya mbuli seiyo! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Fanyanya, sekulu, hela chibwile mlanga mwamajuniya yetu chizivuza zikalaila mwe isi ya Kanani. Navidahike vivihi naho chibawe hela hegu zahabu mnyumba mwa sekulu ywako? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Ivyo, uneva anabunkulwa yumwenga ywetu ana ichikombe icho, nakomwe, naswi watuhu wose nachitende watumwa wako.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Uyo mchimaila agamba, “Heye, navitende seivyo mlongile. Yoyose nabwilwe nechikombe icho, natende mtumwa ywangu, mna watuhu wose hamtende na malaho.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Ivyo, chila yumwenga asunguza kwetula idijuniya dyakwe hasi na kudichohola. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Yudya mta kuchimaila kachakula amajuniya yose, akakongela dyo mkulu ywawo na kubindliziza na dya yudya mdodo ichiziwanda. Ichikombe chibwilwa mwedijuniya dya Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Aho niyo watatula suche zawo kwa chinyulu. Chila yumwenga ywawo atwisa impundakwe idijuniya dyakwe, wauya komzi.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yuda na walukolo wakwe wabula kwenyumba ya Yusufu uyo Yusufu naye nendile achei mnyumba. Ivyo, wamwinamila kwa kumtunya, <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />uyo Yusufu niyo awauza, “Nimbwani mtenda ivyo? Togolani hammanyize kugamba mntu samiye nina udahi wa kulotela?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yuda amhitula, “Chikugeze sekulu? Chilonge mbwani kulagisa kugamba hachibalange? Chohile kafumbula wihi wetu, suwe wandima wako. Haluse chose chiwatumwa wako, suwe hamwenga na yudya abwilwe nechikombe chako.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Mna Yusufu agamba, “Ng'o! Miye sikudaha kutenda ivyo! Yudya du abwilwe ne chikombe changu nuyo natende mtumwa ywangu. Nyuwe watuhu wose uyani kwautondowazi kwa tati yenyu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda amlombezeza Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Naho Yuda amsogeile haguhi Yusufu na kumgamba, “Sekulu, nakulombeza unizumile miye mndima ywako, negombeile kulongozi kwako kwa milosi mijeche, nakweila usekunihiwa, kwaviya weye ni saviya Falao mwenye. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Sekulu, weye nakuchuza kugamba china tati yetu hegu mlukolo. <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Suwe niyo chakugambila kugamba china tati yetu, naye kadalahala, nakugamba china mlukolo mtuhu mdodo elekwe mwe chipindi cho udalahailo wa tati yetu. Mkuluwe dya uyo mbwanga abanikaga, nauyo mvunetu nuyo ichedu asigale kwa mami yakwe, na mdalahala ywetu amungisisa umbwanga yuno. <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Sekulu, nakuchisigila suwe wandima wako chize na yuno mvunetu chani wize umuwone. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Chakugambila kugamba umbwanga yuno hakudaha kulekana na tati yakwe, kwachausa icho anadamanya ivyo tati yetu nabanike. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Mna weye sekulu niyo wachigamba kugamba uneva hachinezile na mlukolo ywetu umdodo, hauchihokele vituhu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />“Eze chuye kukaya kwa mndima ywako, tati yetu, chimgambila ivyo sekulu uchisigile. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Naye eze achigambile chize vituhu kuno chigule nkande. <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Chimgambila, ‘Hachikudaha kwita, mnadu hegu nachitanye na mvunetu umdodo, uneva hachinetanye hachidahe kuhokelwa ni yudya mntu.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Ivyo, tati yetu, mndima ywako, kachigamba, ‘Mvimanya kugamba mkazangu Laheli anelekelaga wana waidi, <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />yumwenga agaga, miye nami niyo nagamba, ivyo navinatende kasapulwa vihande hande ni makala ya kumbago, kwaviya sinati nimwone vituhu. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Uneva mnamguha yuno umwana kulaila mwangu, analailwa ni nkondo, ivyo namnihambe mwe mbila hatenda mdalahala mta chinyulu.’”<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />“Elo, sekulu, ninamuwiya tate mndima ywako sine yuno mbwanga, nakugambila ujima watate wegamila mwe yuno mbwanga, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />anawona kugamba mbwanga sinanaye, nabanike! Ivyo suwe wandima wako, nachimkome tati yetu kwa chinyulu,” <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />ukaleka ivyo, miye mwenye naselavya kutenda ukombo wa yuno mbwanga kwa tate, hagamba, “Sina mvuzize Benjamini kwako, laho nadinigwele miye mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Haluse, mbwawe sekulu, nakweila, miye mndimako, nisigale, nitende mtumwako ukamleka yuno mbwanga. Mleke yuno auye kukaya hamwenga na walukolo wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Nanidahe vivihi kumuwiya tate sine yuno mbwanga? Sikudaha kujijimiza ulumi naumpate tate.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu elavyanya kwa walukolo wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Aho Yusufu adunduga kwechinda kulongozi kwa wose wa timilane naye, awalagiza wandima wakwe wafose kuse. Ivyo Yusufu nendile echedu hadya akelavyanya kwa walukolo wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Mna kaila kwa izwi kulu vilekile Wamisili wamwiva, hamwenga na wantu walukolo wa Falao nawo wamwiva. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yusufu awagamba walukolo wakwe, “Miye ni Yusufu. Togolani, tate achei mjima?” Mna walukolo wakwe wakangawala kulongozi kwakwe, vilekile wadunduga kumhitula. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Yusufu awagamba walukolo wakwe, “Hampu, sogelani haguhi namiye.” Eze wamsogeile, awagamba, “Miye nuyo mlukolo ywenyu Yusufu, mtagile Misili. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Mna haluse msekususuhala hegu kwefuzumila kwa kunitaga. Chohile nuyo anigale kuno niwalongwele, chani nikombole ujima wa wantu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Uno ni mhilimo wa kaidi du wa gumbo mwe isi, kuchei na mihilimo mishano mitihu wantu hawadahe kulima hegu kulozola ulozo. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Chohile kanigala kuno niwalongwele, chani kuhonya wikazi wenyu msigale nojima mwe isi na kuwakombola kwa ukombo mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Ivyo, sawo nyuwe mnigale kuno, mna ni Chohile. Nuyo anitendile saviya tate kwa Falao, mchimaila nyumba yakwe yose na chilongozi ywe isi yose ya Misili.”<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />“Ivyo, tendani msunguze, mwite kwa tate na kumgamba, Yusufu, mwanawo, agamba, ‘Chohile kanitenda mkulu ywe isi yose ya Misili. Ivyo unase kukawa kwiza kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Nawikale haguhi na miye mwe ntendele ya Gosheni, weye na wanawo na wezukuluwo, ludimo lwako na ugoli wako wose. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Umowiyuko Gosheni, miye nahudime weye, walukolo wako hamwenga na ludimo lwako chani mnase kubanika kwa gumbo, kwaviya ichei mihilimo mituhu mishano ya gumbo.’”<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Akaheza Yusufu agamba, “Nyuwe wenye muwona kwa meso yenyu hata mlukolo ywangu Benjamini kawona kwa meso yakwe kugamba ni miye mwenye Yusufu hulonga na nyuwe. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Nibudi kumgambila tate chinyemi changu kuno Misili na yose myawone. Ivyo sunguzani, mkanigaile tate kuno.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Akaheza Yusufu amkubatila Benjamini, mlukolo ywakwe na kwila, Benjamini naye niyo aila, kuno wakubatilana. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Umo achei kwila, Yusufu awakubatila walukolo wakwe na kuwasesa. Aho naho walukolo wakwe wadahile kulonga naye.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Mbuli izo zize zibule kowikazi wa seuta, kugamba walukolo wa Yusufu weza, zimwelelesa Falao na wandima wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Ivyo, Falao amgamba Yusufu, “Wagambe walukolo wako wakweze izimpunda zawo mizigo, wauye mwe isi ya Kanani, <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />wamlete hano tati yawo na walukolo wawo wose. Miye naniwenke hantu hedi hatendendese mwe isi ya Misili, kudya wakudaha kwelelwa matunda yose ye isi ino. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Naho wagambe waguhe malingisha kulaila hano ya kuwaleta wana wawo wadodo na wakazi zawo naho wasekuswesa kumleta tati yawo. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Wagambe wase kwehelwa vyo ugoli wawo kwaviya hantu hedi kujinka hose mwe isi ya Misili naitende yawo.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Ivyo, wana Izulaeli watenda saviya wasigilwwe. Yusufu niyo awenka malingisha kuligana na malagiso ya Falao na nkande ya mwesila. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Kawenka chila yumwe ywawo suche za kuhitwila, mna kamwinka Benjamini vihande magana matatu vya hela na suche shano za kuhitwila. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Naho kamwigaila tati yakwe majeleko yano yentambo yakwe yo kuya, mpunda mlongo zinule vintu vya Misili, mpunda fyele mlongo zinule nkande, migate na nkande ntuhu. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Ivyo, Yusufu kawalaga walukolo wakwe. Umo wakahalawa kawafunda akagamba, “Mnase kulemana mwesila!”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Ivyo wafosa Misili na kuya kaya kwa tati yawo Yakobo kwe isi ya Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Wamgambila tati yawo, “Yusufu emeso! Uyo nuyo chilongozi ywe isi yose ya Misili!” Aho tati yawo akangawala, kwaviya hadahile kukombaganya izimbuli zawo.<verse eid="GEN 45:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Mna, weze wamtamwile yose wasigilwe ni Yusufu naho eze awone malingisha egailwe ni Yusufu kumguha, moyo wakwe wingilwa ni chinyemi chitendese. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Izulaeli agamba, “Haluse sizumila, mwanangu Yusufu emeso! Nanite hamwone sinati kubanika.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo atamba kwita Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Ivyo, Izulaeli akonga utafi wakwe hamwenga no ugoli wakwe. Eze abule Beli Sheba, amlaviza ntambiko Chohile ywa Isaka, tati yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Nechilo Chohile niyo alonga na Yakobo mwe uwoni, kamwitanga, “Yakobo! Yakobo!” Yakobo niyo etika,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">“Heye netegeleza.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Chohile amgamba, “Miye nuyo Chohile, Chohile ywa tati yako. Usekogaha kwita Misili, umo wiyuko nahutende utende na wantu walozize. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Miye mwenye nanite hamwenga naweye uko Misili na kukuvuza kuno. Umo ukabanika, mkono wa Yusufu nuwo naukuzinge ameso yako.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Ivyo, Yakobo ahalawa Beli Sheba. Wanawe wamguha uyo, wana wawo wadodo hamwenga na wavyele wawo mwa malingisha yadya Falao egale kwakumguha. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Naho waguha ludimo na ugoli wawo wose wapatile mwe isi ya Kanani, waita Misili. Yakobo nakaguha lweleko lwakwe lose, <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />wanawe na wezukuluwe wa chilume na wa chiche, wose awegala Misili.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Welekwa wa Yakobo wadya waitile Misili hamwenga nauyo wendaga Lubeni, mwelekwa ywakwe ywa nkongo, <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />hamwenga na wana wa Lubeni, Hanoki na Palu na Hesiloni na Kalimi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Wana wa Simeoni ni Yemueli na Yamini na Ohadi na Yakini na Sohali na Shauli, elekwe ni mvyele Mkanani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Wana wa Lawi ni Gosheni na Kohati na Melali. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Wana wa Yuda ni, Eli na Onani na Shela na Pelesi na Zela. Mna Eli na Onani wabanika mwe isi ya Kanani. Wana wa Pelesi wendaga Helisoni na Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Wana wa Isakali ni Tola na Puva na Yashubu kugamba Yobu na Shimloni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Wana wa Zabuloni ni Seledi na Eloni na Yaleli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Awo nawo wana chilume na Dina mndele ywakwe Leya amwelekelaga Yakobo kudya Padani alamu. Mligano wawo wanawe na wandele wakwe na wezukuluwe wendaga wantu milongo mitatu na ntatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Wana wa Gadi ni Sifioni na Hagi na Shuni na Esiboni na Eli na Alodi na Aleli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Wana wa Asheli ni Imna na Ishiva na Ishivu na Beliya na Sela lumbu dyawo. Wana Beliya ni Hebeli na Malikieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Wano milongo mtandatu ni wana na wezukulu wa Yakobo na Zilipa, mndima yudya Labani amwinkaga Leya mndele ywakwe.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Laheli amwelekelaga Yakobo wana waidi, Yusufu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Uko Misili, Asenati, mndele ywa Potifela endaga mlavyantambiko ywa mzi wa Oni, amwelekelaga Yusefu wana waidi, Manase na Efulaimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Wana wa Benjamini wendaga ni Bela na Bekeli na Ashibeli na Gela na Namani na Ehi na loshi na Mupimu na Hupimu na Alidi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Wantu awo mlongo na wane ni wana na wezukulu wa Yakobo na Laheli mkaziwe.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Mwana ywa Dani endaga Hushimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Wana wa Nafutali ni Yaseeli na Guni na Yeseli na Shilemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Awo mfungate ni wana na wezukulu wa Yakobo na Biliha, mndima ywa chivyele yudya Labani amwinkaga mndele ywakwe Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Mligano wa welekwa lwa Yakobo aitaga nawo Misili, ukaleka kuwaza wakamwanawe, wendaga wantu milongo mtandatu na mtandatu. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Uko kwe isi ya Misili Yusufu endaga na wana waidi. Ivyo wantu wose wolukolo lwa Yakobo wengile Misili wendaga Milongo mfungate.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo na welekwa wakwe wabula Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Yakobo kamlongoza Yuda kwa Yusufu kumlombeza wadugane uko Gosheni, wowo nawo niyo wabula ntendele ya Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yusufu niyo akwela lingisha dyakwe dya falasi, aita kumsingila Yakobo, tati yakwe uko Gosheni. Eze ambwile tati yakwe, kamkubatila na kwila kwa chipindi chitali. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Yakobo amgamba Yusufu, “Hata habanika havihiye kwaviya siwona uso wako na kumanya kugamba weye wimjima!”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Yusufu awagamba walukolo wakwe na welekwa wose wa tati yakwe, “Naita nakumgambila Falao kugamba walukolo wangu na welekwa wose wa tate wendile mwe isi ya Kanani weza kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Nanimgambile kugamba nyuwe mwi wadimi kwaviya nendile mkadima ludimo na kugamba mwingila hamwanga na mbuzi na ngoto na ng'ombe na ugoli wenyu wose. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Ivyo, Falao akawetanga na kuwauzani, ‘Ndima yenyu niihi?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Gambani, ‘Sekulu, suwe wandima wako chiwadimi kukongela udodo wetu kubula vino dyelo, kwaviya nivyo wendile wa baba zetu.’ Gambani ivyo chani mwinkigwe wikazi mwe ntendele ya Gosheni.” Yusufu kalonga ivyo kwaviya wadima ngoto nawakabelwa ni Wamisili.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Ivyo, Yusufu niyo aita kwa Falao, amgamba, “Tate na walukolo wangu hamwenga na ngoto na ng'ombe na ugoli wawo wose, wabula kulaila isi ya kanani. Haluse we ntendele ya Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Yusufu nakawaguha walukolo wakwe washano, awalagisa kwa Falao.<verse eid="GEN 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Falao awauza, “Ndima yenyu nihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Wamhitula, “Seuta, suwe wandima wako chiwadimi, saviya wendile wababa zetu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Akaheza wamgamba Falao, “Suwe wandima wako chiza kwikala saviya wajeni muno mwe isi kwaviya gumbo ditendesa uko Kanani naho hahana hekudimila uludimo lwetu. Ivyo, seuta, chakulombeza, suwe wandima wako, uchinke chikale mwe ntendele ya Gosheni.”<verse eid="GEN 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Falao amgamba Yusufu, “Tati yako na walukolo wako wakwizila weye. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Isi yose ya Misili imoulongozi wako, wenke tati yako na walukolo wako ntendele yedi ye isi ino. Waleke wekale mwe ntendele ya Gosheni. Naho hegu kumanya wantu wakankalu mgati mwawo, wasagule watende wadimi wa ludimo lwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Akaheza, Yusufu amwigala ise Yakobo kwakumlamsa Falao, naye Yakobo kamwinka Falao ujimbiko wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Falao amuza Yakobo, “Mihilimo yako ni mingahi?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakobo amhitula, “Mihilimo yangu ninkigwe saviya mtafi ni mihilimo gana na milongo mitatu. Mihilimo iyo itenda mijeche na imemile kwangadika, naho haibuile idya imihilimo wekale wakale wangu saviya watafi.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Akaheza Yakobo amjimbika Falao, nakuhalawa. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Ivyo, Yusufu awenka tati yakwe na walukolo wakwe haguhi na mzi wa Lamesesi udya wendile wedi utendese mwe isi ya Misili, utende wikazi wawo, nawo waikaila saviya asigile Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yusufu niyo awenka nkande tati yakwe na walukolo wakwe na welekwa wose kuligana na mligano wa wantu wakuwegamila.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uchimaila wa Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Nyumani nkande yagisa mwe isi yose. Gumbo niyo dyatendesa yawatenda wantu wose mwe isi ya Misili na Kanani wahwahwatile. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yusufu kachisanya hela zose ze isi ya Misili na Kanani kulawana ne nkande wagwile, kegala izihela izo kowikalo wa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Wantu wose we isi ya Misili na Kanani wajeseza izihela zawo zose, Wamisili wose wambasa Yusufu na kumgamba, “Chinke nkande! Nimbwani chibanike kulongozi kwako? Kaula, haluse hela zetu zisila!”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yusufu awagamba, “Uneva izihela zenyu zisila, ivyo ninkani uludimo lwenyu, nami naniwenkeni nkande.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Naho wamwigaile Yusufu uludimo lwawo, Falasi na ng'ombe na ngoto na mbuzi na mpunda, naye niyo awenka nkande. Mhilimo uwo Yusufu niyo atenda akawenka nkande kuhituila na ludimo lwawo lose.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Mhilimo utimile wambasa vituhu na kumgamba, “Sekulu, ichindedi ni kugamba hela zetu zose zisila, noludimo lwetu lutenda ugoli wako. Haluse, sekulu, suwe wandima wako hachina chochose chikudaha kukwinka ukaleka suwe wenye du ne zinkonde zetu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Chibanikileni kulongozi kwako na nkonde zetu zibanike? Chigule suwe hamwenga nezinkonde zetu, chitende watumwa wa Falao, chani uchinke nkande du. Chinke nkande chinase kubanika, uchinke na mbeyu kwachausa che izinkonde zetu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Ivyo, Yusufu kagula isi yose ya Misili itende ugoli wa Falao. Chila Mmisili vimtenda atage nkonde yakwe, kwavivyo gumbo ditendesa. Isi yose yatenda ugoli wa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Na Yusufu kawatenda wantu watende watumwa, kulaila ntendele imwenga kubula ntendele ntuhu ye isi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Sanga heguile Yusufu nidya yatozigwe ni walavyantambiko. Awo hawaungigwe watage sanga zawo kwaviya nawakekala kwa kulihwa maliho masiku wakenkigwa ni Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Akaheza Yusufu awagamba wantu, “Kaulani, siwagulani kale nyuwe nyose ne izikonde zenyu zitenda ugoli wa Falao. Mwenkigwa mbeyu naywi namhande izinkonde zenyu. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Chipindi chokulozola, fungu dya shano namwinke Falao. Mafungu mane nayasigale nayatende mbeyu na nkande kwa nyuwe na welekwa wenyu na wanenyu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Wamhitula, “Sekulu, kuhonya wikazi wetu! Kwaviya kuchilagisa wedi wako, suwe nachitende watumwa wa Falao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Nivyo Yusufu ekiye sigilizi imwenga idya iyaho kubula vino dyelo mwe isi ya Misili, chila mntu aungwa alavye fungu dya shano dya ulozo wakwe kwa Falao. Sanga ya walavyantambiko du nizo heziguligwe na kutenda ugoli wa Falao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulangilizi wa udumo wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Ivyo, wantu wa Izulaeli wekala mwe ntendele ya Gosheni mwe isi ya Misili. Wakatenda uko, walozola ugoli ulozize, welekana na kujenyela vitendese. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobo kekala mwe isi ya Misili kwa chipindi cha mihilimo mlongo umwenga na mfungate, eze abule mihilimo gana na milongo mine na mfungate. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Chipindi cho kubanika kwakwe chize chisogele, Yakobo niyo amwitanga mwanawe Yusufu, amgamba, “Haluse, uneva chindedi wanunga, ika umkono wako mwamaheke yangu, unelisize kugamba naunidamanyize kwa ntunyo na wedi. Use kunihamba kuno Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Mna unigoneze hamwenga na wababa zangu. Niguha kulaila Misili ukanihambe mwe zimbila zawo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yusufu niyo amhitula, “Nanidamanye saviya ulongile.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Yakobo agamba, “Nelisiza!” Yusufu kamwelisiza. Akaheza Yakobo kenamila kwakumtogola Chohile hadya holusazi lwakwe.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo awajimbika Efulaimu na Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Akaheza aho, Yusufu kagambilwa kugamba tati yakwe ni mnyonje. Ivyo, kawaguha wanawe waidi, Manase na Efulaimu, kaita nawo kwa ise. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Yakobo eze agambilwe kugamba mwanawe Yusufu keza kumkaula, ahikiliza kwinuka, niyo ekala molusazi, <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Yakobo amgamba Yusufu, “Chohile mta nguvu kanilaila umo nikudya Luzu mwe isi ya Kanani, niyo anijimbika. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Kanigamba, ‘Kaula, nahutende utende na lweleko na ujenyele, nahutende utende baba ywa lweleko lukulu lwa wantu. Sanga ino naniwenke welekwa wako, itende yawo mazuwa yose.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Yakobo ajendeleza kulonga, “Yusufu, wanawo waidi welekwe hano Misili sinati kubula, ni wanangu, naniwenke hantu he sanga yangu Efulaimu na Manase nawatende wangu saviya weli Lubeni na Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Mna, wana naweleke nyumani hawenkigwe ulisi we sanga yangu mna nawahokele fungu dyawo kujinkila kwa walukolo wawo waidi Efulaimu na Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Naika ivyo kwachausa cha mamiyako Laheli. Umo hauya kulaila Padani uyo niyo abanika mwe isi ya Kanani, chikatenda haguhi kubula kwingila Efulata, kanasa na chinyulu. Ivyo, niyo namhamba aho, mnkanda mwe isila ikwita komzi wa Efulata.” Kugamba Beselehemu.<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Yakobo eze awawone wana wa Yusufu, amuza, “Wano ni wahi?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yusufu amhitula ise, “Wano ni wanangu aninkile Chohile hatenda kuno.” Yakobo agamba, “Hampu, walete haguhi niwajimbike.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Meso ya Yakobo nendile hayakuwona vyedi kwachausa cho kudalahala. Ivyo Yusufu niyo awasogeza wanawe haguhi na ise, niyo awakubatila na kuwasesa. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Akaheza Yakobo amgamba Yusufu, “Savimanyize kuwona uso wako vituhu, mna, kumbeke, Chohile kanitenda niwawone wanawo!” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Aho Yusufu kawausa wanawe mwamavindi ya ise, akaheza enama kubula hasi kwa ntunyo.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Yusufu kawenula wanawe waidi, Efulaimu mo mkono wakwe wa kulume, akamlagisiza ko mkono wa kumoso wa tati yakwe, na Manase mo mkono wakwe wa kumoso, akamlagisiza ko mkono wa kulume wa tati yakwe, awasogeza kwa babawo. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Mna Yakobo kahituila imikono yakwe, mkono wakwe wa kulume kawika mlanga mo mtwi wa Efulaimu, hatahegu nuyo mdodo, na mkono wakwe wa kumoso kawika mo mtwi wa manase, endile mwelekwa ywa nkongo. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Akaheza Yakobo amjimbika Yusufu, akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Chohile yudya baba zangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Bulahimu na Isaka na wamtunya mowikazi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Chohile yudya anilongoze mo wikazi wangu kubula vino dyelo.<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Na mndima ywa kwembingu yudya anikombole mwe wihi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">nawajimbike wabwanga wano!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Zina dyangu na mazina ya wakale wangu, Bulahimu na Isaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">yajendelezwe mwa wabwanga wano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">nawo wongezekele vitendese mweisi yose.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Yusufu eze awone kugamba tati yakwe kaika umkono wakwe wa kulume mlanga mo mtwi wa Efulaimu habwedile. Ivyo, kautoza umkono wa ise, akaunga ause mlanga mo mtwi wa Efulaimu awike mo mtwi wa Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Amgamba ise, “Bule, tate! Yuno hano nuyo mwelekwa ywa nkongo. Hampu, ika umkono wako wa kulume mlanga mo mtwi wakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Mna ise kalemela, akagamba, “Simanya, mwanangu, simanya. Wana wa Manase nawo nawatende si nkulu na wakankalu. Mna mlukolo mdodo natende mkulu kujinka uyo, na welesi wakwe nawatende si nkulu ya wantu walozese.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Ivyo, Izulaeli kawajimbika zuwa idyo, akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">“Waizulaeli nawajeseze mazina yenyu kujimbika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">nawagambe, ‘Chohile akudamanyize vyedi saviya Efulaimu na Mnase!’ ” Nivyo Yakobo amwikile Efulaimu kulongozi kwa Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Akaheza Izulaeli amgamba Yusufu, “Savino ukuwona, miye ni haguhi na kubanika. Ivyo, Chohile natende hamwenga na nyuwe, na kuwavuzani mwe isi ya wababa zenyu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Ukaleka ayo, sikwinka weye, sawo walukolo wako, ntendele imwenga kwa magulu, kudya nigombile nkondo na kutaha isanga ya Waamoli kwa bamba na uta wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo awajimbika wanawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Yakobo kawetanga wanawe, awagamba, “Duganani hamwenga niwagambileni mbuli namchintane nazo mazuwa yakwiza.”<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />“Duganani mwetegeleze, nyuwe wana wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">netegelezani miye Izulaeli, tati yenyu.”<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />“Weye Lubeni wi mwelekwa ywangu ywa nkongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">nguvu yangu na tunda dya ubwanga wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Weye wawajinka walukolo wako kwa ukulu na nguvu.”<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Weye wenga mazi yabohole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Mna hotende ywa nkongo naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">kwaviya nakukwela molusazi lwangu miye tati yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">weye na kulujela uzavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Heye weye nakulukwela. <verse eid="GEN 49:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />“Simeoni na Lawi ni walukolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">viziha vyawo wajeseza kudamanyiza uvambi.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Mna miye sanehange mwenjama zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">weye muye wangu, usekwikala mwemidugano yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">kwaviya, kwa maya yawo, wakomaga wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">kwa upapala wawo wasenga mshipa wa ng'ombe.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Naligita maya yawo kwaviya yatendesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">na mpula yawo heina mbazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Naniwasente mwe isi ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">nawazagale mwe isi ya Izulaeli.”<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />“Weye Yuda, walukolo wako nawakutogole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Mkono wako nauwagoge mwe singo wankondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">na walukolo wako nawename kulongozi kwako.”<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Weye Yuda, mwanangu, wisaviya mwana simba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">yudya akomile maingo yakwe niyo akwela kulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Saviya simba, yegolola na kugona hasi, simba ina nguvu, ni yuhi akujeza kuinula.<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Nkome ya useuta hayusike kwa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">hegu bonkola yo uzumbe mwe viga vyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">kubula aho nabule yudya mwenye ni yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">yudya si zose nazimwive.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Natalize mpunda yakwe mwe mzabibu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na mwana mpunda ywakwe mwe mzabibu wedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Afula suche zakwe mwe divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na suche zakwe mwe divai inkundu.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Meso yakwe yenkundu kwa kunywelesa divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">meno yakwe yang'ala kulawana na kunywa mele. <verse eid="GEN 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />“Zabuloni nekale ntendele ya mpwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">mpwani yakwe naitende hantu hakwegemeza meli.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Isi yakwe neihakane na Sidoni.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />“Isakali saviya mpunda ina nguvu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">Negone mgati mwe mizigo yakwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Kawona kugamba hantu hakuhumula ni hedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">na kugamba isi yawagizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">kenamiza umgongo wakwe kwinula mzigo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">nazumile kudamanya ndima za utumwa kwa wantu watuhu.”<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />“Dani natende mlamuzi ywa wantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">saviya nkolo ntuhu za Izulaeli zikudamanya.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Natende saviya nyoka mwesila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">nyoka ina sumu mnkanda mwesila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">ikuluma visigino vya falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">yudya mkwela falasi agwa mangali.”<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />“Weye Zumbe, nagoja unikombole.”<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />“Gadi nebungwe ni wapolaganyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">mna uyo nawatimile mnyuma na kuwebunga.”<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />“Sanga ya Asheli nailavye ulozo utendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">uyo nalavye nkande ikumuwagiza seuta.”<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />“Nafutali nisaviya kapala kenenwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">akweleka wana watana.”<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />“Yusufu nisaviya mti ukweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">mti ukweleka mnkanda mwe sokwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">matambi yakwe yatambala mwe chiwambaza.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Wakunta mifulo wamwebungisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">wamkuntila mifulo na kumtumbwadisa vitendese.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Mna uta wakwe uchehindile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">nemikono yakwe inkigwa nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">kwa udahi wa Chohile Mta Nguvu ywa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">kwa zina dya Mdimi ywa Izulaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Kwa Chohile ywa tati yako nakwambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">kwa Chohile Mta Nguvu nakujimbike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">upate ujimbiko wa fula kulaila kulanga kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">ujimbiko wa mazi ya vilindi vihasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">ujimbiko wa wavyele nawelekese wana na ludimo lutendese,<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />jimbiko za tati yako zihude jimbiko zikulaila kwa magulu mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">jimbiko hukwinka zitende zedi kujinka jimbiko zikulaila kwa wagulu wa kale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Ujimbiko uwo nautende mwa Yusufu yudya eli mkulu kujinka wakuluze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">mlanga mwe chinengo cha yudya asentingwe ni walukolo wakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />“Benjamini nisaviya uzi kali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">mtondo dyadya amaingo yakwe yanechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">na chisingi dyasanga viya ditahile.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Awo nawo nkongelo ya makabila mlongo na maidi ya Izulaeli, na iyo niyo imilosi awagambilaga tati yawo umo akawajimbika, chila yumwenga ywawo seivyo vyungigwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">File no Kuhambwa kwa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Akaheza Yakobo kawasigila wanawe vino, “Miye ni haguhi na kubanika na kwehanga hamwenga na wantu wangu wabanike. Nihambani hamwenga na wakale wangu mwe mpanga idya imwenkonde ya Efuloni Mhiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />kudya Makipela, ulailo wa zuwa wa Mamle, mwe isi ya Kanani. Ibulahimu agulaga mpanga na nkonde iyo kwa Efuloni Mhiti, itende yakwe ya kuhambila. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Uko nuko wahambigwe Ibulahimu na mkaziwe Sala, uko nuko wahambigwe Isaka na mkaziwe Lebeka, na uko nuko ni mhambile Leya. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Nkonde iyo ne mpanga yakwe yagulagwa kwa Wahiti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Yakobo eze abinde kuwalangiliza wanawe, avuza iviga vyakwe molusazi, afunda umuye na kwehanga na wakale wakwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Aho Yusufu kamwinamila na kumkubatila tati yakwe akaila. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Akaheza, awasigila wagangana wakwe wamhake miti tati yakwe Izulaeli chani asekuwola, nawo niyo watende ivyo. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Saviya mazwela, mazuwa milongo mine yaungwa kwendima iyo. Wamisili nawo niyo walomboleza indilo ya Yakobo kwa chipindi cha mazuwa milongo mfunkate.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Eze wabinde matanga, Yusufu awagamba wantu walukolo lwa Falao, “Uneva sizumilwa kulongozi kwenyu, hampu longani na Falao kwachausa changu kugamba tate kanelisiza, akagamba, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‘Miye ni haguhi na kubanika. Waungwa unihambe mwe mbila nesongwele mwe isi ya Kanani.’ Kwaivyo namlombeza anizumile nite hamhambe tate, haheza nanuye.”<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Falao ahitula, “Hita ukamhambe iso saviya akwelisize.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Yusufu ahalawa akumhamba ise akalongozana na wandima masekulu wose wa Falao, masekulu wedibalaza hamwenga na masekulu weisi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Iviya, Yusufu kalongazana na welekwa wakwe wose, na walukolo wakwe na welekwa wa tati yakwe Yakobo. Mwe ntendele ya Gosheni wasigala wana du hamwenga na ngoto na mbuzi na ng'ombe zawo. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Naho na walongozana na wakwela falasi na malingisa, dyendaga fyo dikulise.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Weze wabule mo lwazo lokuhuguziza uhule lwa Atadi, ntendele ya kaidi yo mto wa Yolodani, wahongeza kwa chinyulu chitendese, uyo Yusufu kamwikiya tati yakwe mtokubanika matanga ya mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Wakanani wakaya we isi iyo, weze waviwone kuhongezwa kudamanywe mo lwazo lo kuhugusiza uhule lwa Atadi, wagamba, “Kuhongeza kuno kwa Wamisili, chindedi ni kukulu!” Kwaivyo, hantu hadya niyo hetangwa Abel Misili, aho hentendele ya kaidi yo mto wa Yolodani.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Wana wa Yakobo wamtendela tati yawo saviya awasigilaga. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Wamguha kubula mwe isi ya Kanani. Wamhamba mwe mpanga yendile mwe nkonde kudya Makipela, ulailo wa zuwa wa Mamle. Impanga hamwenga ne nkonde iyo Ibulahimu nendile aigulaga kwa Efuloni Mhiti, chani hatende hantu hakwe hakuhambila. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Eze amhambe ise, Yusufu auya Misili hamwenga na walukolo wakwe na wantu wose wendile alongozane nawo kwita kokumhamba ise.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu Awausa nkama Wakuluze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />File yatati yawo ize ijinke, walukolo wa Yusufu walafya, “Tankani Yusufu naihiwe niyo achilihiza yeihiye yose chimtendile.” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Kwaivyo wamwigaila Yusufu ulosi, wakagamba, “Tati yako, henati kubanika, asigilaga vino, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />‘Mgambeni Yusufu hantu hangu, hampu walekele walukolo wako wihi wawo wihiye na ubanasi wose wakutendile.’ Haluselo, hampu ulekele ubanasi chikutendile suwe wandima wa Chohile ywa tati yako.” Yusufu eze ahokele ulosi uwo, kaila.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Akaheza walukolo wakwe wambasa, wamwinamila kubula hasi kulongozi kwakwe, wakagamba, “Kaula, suwe chi wandima wako.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Mna Yusufu awagamba, “Msekogoha! Togolani, miye ni hantu ha Chohile? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Nyuwe namunga mnitende vihiye, mna Chohile kanungila yedi chani wantu walozize watende wajima saviya mkuwona dyelo. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Elo, msekogoha. Miye naniwenkeni nkande hamwenga na wanawenyu.” Ivyo niyo awahoza na kulonga nawo vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yusufu kajendeleza kwikala mwe isi ya Misili hamwenga na welekwa wose wa tati yakwe. Kekala kwa chipindi cha mihilimo gana dimwenga na mlongo niyo abanika. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Yusufu kadahizwa kuwawona wana na wezukulu wa mwanawe Efulaimu, naho kuwahokela saviya wanawe, iviya kawawona ukwelekwa kwa wana wa Makili mwana ywa Manase. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Nyumani Yusufu awagamba walukolo wakwe, “Miye haluse nihaguhi na kubanika. Mna Chohile chindedi neze awambizeni. Nawalavye mwe isi ino na kuwegalani mwe isi awelisize Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Akaheza Yusufu kawelisiza wana wa Izulaeli, akagamba, “Chohile aho nawezileni kuwambizani, mkombaganye kugamba mwenula amavuha yangu kulaila hano myegale uko wahambigwe wakale wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Ivyo, Yusufu kabanika kudya Misili, akatenda na mhilimo gana na mlongo. Awo wauhaka miti umwili wakwe usekuwola, wawika mwe jeneza kudya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>